<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">Jeremiah</book>
  <para style="h">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin gam a Anathoth khuo a siempute lah a khat Hilkiah tapa Jeremiah thugente:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda leengpa Amon tapa Josiah vaihawm kum, akum sawm leh thumna hunlai in Jeremiah kungah Mangpa thu ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim hun laiin zong ahing tunga, Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Zedekiah vaihawm kum sawm leh khatna tawp dong ha ngana a Jerusalem sal a puimanga aum tandong in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Naubu sungah ka hing siem masangin, nang ka hing theita hi; na pien masanga ka hing suhsiengthousa na hita hi, Namte kunga guolnei hi dingin ka hing guotta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken “Eh! Mangpa Pasian, Ngai vawi, naupang nou ka hiziehin thu ka genthei sih,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Naupang ka hi chisin, ka hing sawlna poumate kungah na pei dinga, ka hing thupieh pouma nagen ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amauh giing sin, aziehpen nangma hunkhe dingin na kungah ka um hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n akhut ahing hakhie a, kakam ahing khoi a, tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, “En in, ka thute na kam ah ka koita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngaivawi, tuni’n keiman nangpen namte leh leenggam tungah, botdoh ding leh luoikhe ding leh, sumangthai ding leh paikhe ding leh, lam ding leh phut dingin ka hing guotta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga, “Jeremiah bang na mu ei?” achi hi. Tualeh ken “Kawlthualu sing ba khat ka mu hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Na mudih hi, aziehpen tam khu bawla ka thu tangtung sah pai dinga mansa ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa thu aniveina dingin ka kungah ahing tungkia a; “Bang na mu ei?” ahing chi hi. Tualeh ken “Bel sou but but akam in mallam nua ngat khat ka mu hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Mallam akipat in sietna, gamsunga tengte zousie tungah ahing tung ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen ngaiin, mallam leenggam a namte zousie ka han ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tuachi’n leengte ahing pei ding ua, Jerusalem kulpi lutna kotpi bul ah, akimvel a kulbaang zousie bul ah leh, Juda khopi zousie ah aleengtoupha chiet uh, atungchiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei ahing nuasie ua, pasien dangte kunga gimnamtui ahal ua, amauh khut suohte abieh zieh ua, agitlouna zousie uh tungtanga amauh dinga, ka vaihawmnate ka gendoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kawng gah inlen dingdohin, tualeh kang thupieh pouma amaute kungah genin, amaitang uah lungke vawt sin, tua ahisih leh ken amaute masang ah, ka hing lungkesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen ngaiin, tuni in agam pumpi Juda leengte, amiliente leh asiempute leh tua gam a mite lah ah, khopi kulnei leh sia khuom sum-eng kulbangin, ka hing bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaun nang ang dou ding ua, hinanleh ahing zousih ding uhi; aziehpen nang hing hundoh dingin ka hing umpi hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Pei inlen, Jerusalem zah in Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi chi’n va kikou in. Haichi tu louna gam, gamdai a ka nua na zui lai a, na khangdawn lai a na hoinate, mou dinga na kikham lai a na itnate, ka thei ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel khu Mangpa a dingin sienthouna leh, agapung masa pen ahi. Ama negam zousie in, maw atang ding ua, atung uah sil hoilou atung ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi,” vachi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakob innkuonte leh Israel innkuonte zousie aw, Mangpa thu ngaiun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Napu napate un keima ah bang dihtatlouna mu ahi ua, Kei a kipat a gamla taha apeimang ua, milimte azui ua, bangmalou milim bete ahing hi tah mai uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amauten, Izipt gam a kipat a hing puidoh a, gamdai gamgaw guom kokhuh lah leh, tui umlouna leh shina lim guom tawn a, Koima pei ngailouna leh koima tenna ngailou gam tan a, hing puipa khu hei a um ahi tai? achi hetsih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ken noute gam hoitah ah, agam ga leh ahoina kiningchingtah ne dingin, ka hing tutta hi; hinanleh na lut tah un ka gam na subuata ua, tualeh ka goutan khu kidah huoi nasuoh sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siempute’n lah Mangpa hei a um ahiei? chiin akan ngai sih ua; dan thu saiten lah kei ahing thei sih uhi; Vaihawmte lah keima kalin atakhiel ua, guolneiten zong Baal thu agen ua, tualeh bangma phatuomlou silte nua azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuaziehin noute kang gawt nalai dinga, natu nate uh zong ka gawt nalai ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuipi gei a Saipras gam ah galkai unlen, en unlen, Kedar ah mi sawl unlen, kitup tahin ngaituo un, tambang sil a um ngaita mawngmawng eimah, en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nam khat in a pasiente uh, pasiente hisihnanleh aheng ngai uh amah? Hinanleh ka miten a thupina uh, phattuomna neilou milimte toh ahengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw vante, tami dipkawzen in lamdangsa unlen, chizat huoi sahna toh zau unlen, segawp siengun, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen ka miten sil hoilou ni abawlta uhi: Kei hinna tuinah ahing nuasieta ua, amauh tuikhuh ding akitaw ua, tui veitheilouna tuikuong sesa abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel suoh ahiei mah? Suoh leh sal hisa a pieng ahiei mah? Bangdinga susiet a um ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Humpibahnei hatlaiten ahawhkhum a, angih uhi; agam uh asuhsietpieh ua, akhompite uh akihaltum a, Koima ateng nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noph leh Tahpanhes miten zong na lutunga manglukhu ahing suhsiet piehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lampi a ahing pui lai a, Mangpa na Pasian na taisan zieh a, tamte nangma tunga na tunsah hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh bangdinga tu a Sihor tuite dawn dinga, Izipt lampi a pei na hi uoi? ahisihleh bangdinga Luipi tuite dawn dinga, Assiria lampi a pei nahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nouma gitlouna mama in ahing sudih dinga, na nuatolna un nou ahing phawh ding hi; tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian uh na taisan ua, Keima giinna na neilou pen uh sil hoiloutah leh khatah ahi, chi thei unlen mu un, galkapte Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Masang laipeh a kipat in, na hahkol uh kang suhtan piehta a, na kolbute zong kang sutawng piehta hi; tualeh ka takhiel nawn sih ding na chi a, singbawh chinteng nuoi ah, kizua bangin na lum kawi kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabang pumpum in ken nang grepgui dihtah leh chi hoi penpen in ka hing suon a, bangchi dana kei a dinga grepgui dihlou, leh gam grepgui suohdoh nahi tai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tang al a kisil in sabon tampi zang nan lachin zong, na gitlouna ka masangah chiemte in a umta hi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangchidan a ka kisubua sih a, Baalte nua zong ka zui sih na chithei ahiei mah? Phaijanga na gamtat dan en inlen, na sil bawlte thei ve, sangawngsau la hua, khau khi theilou a tai kawi kawi bang na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gamdai a um zel gamsabiltung, hua seng kisa a dah iau uou a, huinam vutvut toh kibang na hi. A utna koiin ahiai khamzou ding, Amanu sui zousie kisu gim nuom da uheh, aha chin chieng amuna ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na kengah kedap bunlouin um sinlen, na dang zong tasah sin. Hinanleh nang kinepna ding um sih, gamdang pasiente ka itzawta a, amaute nua ka zui ding hi nachi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Guta akimudoh chienga azum bangin, Israel innkuonte azum uhi. Ama uleh aleengte uh, amiliente uh, tualeh a siempute u’leh, a guolneite u’toh abawn un azum siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Singbul kungah ka pa nahi, achi ua, suongbul kungah ahing hingkhepa na hi, chiin kei ang nua ngatsan ua, ahing maingat sih uhi. Hinanleh abuoi hun chiengun, thou inlen hing hundam in, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh na pasien ding ua na kisiemthu, uh milim na pasiente uh hei a um ata uoi? Thou u’leh asih diei, Na buoi hun chieng ua, hing hundam thei ding ahi u’leh. Aziehpen Aw Juda, na khopi uh tam dungzui a na pasien uh tam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Bangzieh a ka tunga lungkimlou na hi uoi? na bawn un ka tungah na takhielta uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na tate uh amawhna in kana gawtbawl khata a, bawlhoina asang tuom sih uhi. Humpibahnei gongsan bangin, na namsau un na guolneite uh avaltumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khangthate aw, Mangpa thu thei un, Israel a dinga gamdai bang mai, ahisihleh mielna gam bang mai kata amah? Bangdinga ka miten, zalen ka hita uh, na kungah hing pei nawn sih va ung, achi thei uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nungah in akizepna amanghil thei diei? Ahisihleh mounu’n akitenna puon silte amanghil thei diei? Hinapiin ka miten ni simsenglou sung kei ahing manghilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Bangdinga itna suina dinga, na umdan na kilawmsah mawh ahiei? Tuaziehin numei giloute kungah na umdan na hil zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na nihte tungah zong, mi zawng mawna neiloute hinna sisan akimu hi; aguh agal a kasui a ka mu ahisih a, hinanleh tamte zousie tunga ka mu ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinapiin nangman, mawna neilou ka hi ziehin, pellouin alungthahna kei akipat akiheimang ding hi, na chi hi; Ngaiin, Ka khiel sih nachi ziehin na tungah, thukhenna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bangdinga na umdante henga hichi viel dien kawi na hiei? Assiriate masanga na zum bangin, Iziptte masang ah zong na zum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi, na khuta na lutung hum kawm in ama akipat in, na pawtdoh ding hi. Mangpa’n na mimuon leh, na kizoppite anuoltah ziehin ama ute ziehin, na lawching sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Amaun pasal khat in azi khul henlen, azi in ama nuasiein pasal dangtoh vakiteng taleh, tua pasal in azi anua nei thei kia diei mah? Tua gam khu, nasatah a kibuasah gawp sieng hitalou ding amah? Hinanleh na kingaipi tampite a dingin, kizua bangin na um a, tuabang hinapiin zong ka kungah na hing kile kia hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Muol sang lam ah dahtou inlen, en in. Ahingluppi louna mun uh a um mawngmawng ei mah? Gamdai a Arabmite bangin, lampi gei lah ah ang luppi ding amaute ngah in na tou a, gam sung kizuana leh gitlouna in na buasah siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin guo zuh ding akikhatan a, guotui nukhia zong azutasih hi; tualeh kizuate mel na puo a, zumdan mawngmawng na thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tumama akipat in ka kungah, Kapa ka khangdawn lai a hing puipa nang chi sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama kumtawn a lungthah den ding ahiei mah? Aman tua khu atawp dong akem diei mah? Ngaiin, na genta hi, tualeh na bawl theitawpin sil hoilou na bawlta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lengpa Josiah vaihawm sungin Mangpa’n ka kungah: “A nuatol Israel sil bawlte na mu eimah? Muolsang chinteng tungah leh sing hing bawh lim chinteng nuoi ah apeitou a, kizuana gamtatna abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tam silte zousie abawl nuain, ken ka kungah hing kinuale kia in kachi hi. Hinanleh ama ang kinuale kia sih hi, tualeh asanggamnu ginatlou dan Juda in amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n anuatol Israel in angkawmna abawlna san leh aziehte ka mutah ziehin, amanu ka koimanga, khulna lai ka pieh laiin, asanggamnu lepchiena Juda in azau tuon sih a, apei a angkawm in kizuana ava bawl hi, chi ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n tambang ahing hi a, ahuana gamtat aman khawh asahlou ziehin gamsung asubua a, sing leh suong chinteng toh ang akawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asanggamnu lepchiena tambang teng hinapi Juda alungtang zousie toh ka kungah ahing kinuale sih a, akisiakhem kipang ahi bou hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, a nuatol Israel in alepchie Juda sangin akidihtatsah zaw nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pei inlen tam thute mallam ah va phuongzah in: Nang nuatol Israel hing kinualekia in, Mangpa’n achi hi, Kei khotuona adim ka hi ziehin na tung ah, ka lungthahna ka tungsah sih ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, tualeh na tungah kumtawn in ka lungthah den sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian tunga na tatkhelnate leh, singbawh hing nuoi chintenga, gamdang pasiente toh na gamtat thanghuoinate leh, ka aw na sanlounate, thupha tawi phot maiin, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hing kinuale un Aw nuatol tate, Mangpa’n achi hi. Aziehpen nang ka hing kitenpita a, noute lah akipat, khopi a mi khat, innkuon khat akipat mi ni, ka la dinga, Zion ah kang tut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tualeh theina leh thesiemna toh noute hing vaa dingin ka lung tuoh mama belampu ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi ding, chiin Mangpa’n agen hi; gam sunga na hing pun ua, na hing tam deu deu hun chiengun, tuami ni chiengin, amaun “Mangpa thuhunbawm” achi nawn sih ding ua, alungsim uah zong a gel kha nawn sih ding ua, thei zong atheikha nawn sih ding ua, ve zong ave ngai nawn sih ding ua, bawl zong abawl kia nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin Jerusalem khu Mangpa Mangtoupha achita ding ua, tualeh nam zousie Mangpa min in Jerusalem ah ahing kikhawm ding ua, amaun alungtang gilou u’leh genhanate uh azui nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Juda innkuonte khu Israel innkuonte toh a umkhawmta ding ua, mallam gam akipat in napu napate uh kunga, agoutan ding ua ka piehsa gam ah ahing peikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh ken: “Bangchidan in nang tate lah ah ka hing koi in, gam nuomtah nam zousie dinga, goutan kilawm pen hing pe ding ka hiei mah? ka chi hi. Tualeh ken: Ka pa, na hing chi dinga, kei a kipat na pielmang sih ding hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zi muonhuoilou apasal akipat a ataimang bangin, tuamabangin lepchietahin kei na hing bawl uhi, Aw Israel innkuonte,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Muolsangtung lah a, Israel tate kaa leh mauna leh, thungetna aw ging akiza hi; aziehpen amaun aumdan uh asegawp sah siengta ua, Mangpa a Pasian uh amanghilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hing kile kia un nou nuatol tate, na nuatolna uh ka hing damsah ding hi.” Ahi, na kungah “Ka hing pei uhi, aziehpen nang Mangpa ka Pasian uh na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Adihtah in, muol tungte leh muol tampite akipat a, hundamna kinep khu amawhna ahi bou hi. Adihtahin Mangpa i Pasian uah, Israelte hundamna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“I khangdawn lai akipat in zumna in ipu ipate, sepgimna gate, abelam honte uh, aganhonte uh atapate u’leh atanute uh anegamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zum sasa in tuol ah ilumsuh ua, izalatna un ahing khuta hi; eite leh ipu ipate un ikhangdawn lai ua kipat, tuni dong in Mangpa i Pasian uh tungah ikhielta ua, Mangpa i Pasian aw ina zuita sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw Israel, na kinuale kia ding leh, keima kungah hing kile kiain, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tualeh ka mitmu akipata na kidahhuoinate, na koimanga ahileh na kisuonkhe sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa ahina ahin sungsie chi a, thutahna in thukhendihna in, tualeh dihtatna in na kichiem dinga namte khu, Ama ah amauleh amauh hampha akichi ding ua, Ama ah akisuongta ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Juda leh Jerusalem mite kungah, Mangpa’n tambangin thu agen hi: “Na leikhalte uh satnen unlen, ling lah ah haichi tu sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa kungah na tep uh tan unlen, na lungtang tep vunte uh paidoh un, nou Juda mite leh Jerusalem a tengte aw, tua ahisihleh, na silgilou bawlte ziehun, ka lungthahna mei bangin akuong dinga, koima’n aphelzou sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda gam ah phuongdoh unlen Jerusalem ah genthang un, tualeh gamsungah “Pengkul mut unlen, kikou unlen, kikhawm khawm un, tualeh hing kikhawm unlen, kulpinei khopi sungah lutvai, chiun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion langah puonlap khai unlen, zekai louin bitna delun, aziehpen mallam akipat in keiman sietna leh manthaina, hing tungsah ding ka hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A umna gammang zing keikui nuoi akipat in, humpibahnei ahing pawtta a, tualeh namte sumang dingpa zong lampi ah a umta hi. Ama khu nagam uh suse ding in amun apat akuondohta hi; na khopite uh atengmi umlou in asuse gawp sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin sai-ip puon sil unlen, dalekap in mau un, aziehpen Mangpa thangpaina eite apat akiheimang sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin tambang hing hiva, Mangpa’n achi hi: Lengpa leh a miliente hansanna lungtang abei sieng dinga, siemputen lamdang asa ding ua, guolneiten zong lamdang asa ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken, “Ah! Mangpa Pasian, tam mite leh Jerusalem nahpi taha solgawp in hamuonna na nei ding uh na chi a, lah namsau in alungtang uh adawt zaw valongin ka chi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin tam mite leh Jerusalem kungah, “Gamdai a munsang kieute akipat hui lum ka mite tanute zap sieng ding lah hilou susieng ding lah hilou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamte adinga hat mama hui khat kei a dingin ka lang sah ding a, tuin amaute tunga ka thukhenna genkhe ding ka hi,” achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En in, Ama meipi bangin ahing peitou dinga, aasakollengte khu pingpei bang ahi dinga, asakolte muvanlai sangin agang zaw ding hi. I tung uh agih hi, suhsiet a um ihita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem gitlouna akipat na lungtang silsieng in; tuachi’n hundam in na um thei ding hi. Ngaituona giloute bangtan vei na sung a kem ding na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan gam akipat in aw khat in aphuonga, Ephraim muol akipat in suhgentheina atangkoupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namte kungah hil unlen Ahing dou dingte gamlapi akipat in ahing kuonta ua,” Juda khopite aw ngaitahin akikou khumta uhi chiin Jerusalem ah phuong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda gam ka tunga ahelzieh un, tua galkapten louveng mite bangin akimvel in a im khum uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na umdante u’leh na silbawlte un, na tung ua tam silte ahing tut ahi. Tami na gitlouna ahia, akha mama a, na lungtang a sun hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka lungtang na e, ka lungtang na e! Ka lungtang mama ana hi. Ka lungtang na in kasung kihawt ging sah a, ka um khinkhian thei sih hi, aziehpen Aw ka hinna in, ki galginna pengkul gin azata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sietna tungah sietna atunga, gamsung pumpi suhsiet in a um ta hi. Thakhat in ka puon innte suhsiet in a um a, ka puonzahte zong mitphiet kallou in a sie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangtanvei kidouna puonlap mu dinga, pengkul ging za ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka mite amo seng ua, kei ahing theita sih uhi. Naupang mo ahi ua, amaun theisiemna anei sih uhi. Silhoilou bawl asiem ua, silhoi bawl dan athei sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leitung ka et leh, Ngai vawi, ahawm leh aguoh ahi a, tualeh vantein zong vahna anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tangte ka en a, Ngai vawi, akiling uhi, tualeh muol zousie aki thing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka en a, Ngai vawi, mihing koima a um sih a, tungleeng vate zousie aleengmang siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka en a, Ngai vawi, louma hoiteng gamdai asuoh siengta, tualeh akhopi zousie Mangpa masang leh, alungthahna maiah achim siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Gam pumpi nuasie hivan in, hinanleh atawpna tahtah hisah naisih vang, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam ziehin leitungin suun van in, tunga vante amiel ding hi. Aziehpen keiman ka genta a, Keima’n ka tumta hi, ka lungsim ka heng sih dinga, tualeh tami apat in ka kinuahei kia sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khopi pumpi sakol tungtuong mite leh, thaltawi mite thawmging za in ataimang ding uh a, gammang ah atailut ding ua, suongpi tungte ah akaltou ding uhi. Khopi chinteng akitaisan dinga, asungah mi koima ateng nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh nang suhsieta na um hun chiengin, bang na bawl diei? Puonsandup silinlen sana in kizem nanlachin, na mit na mai nutheiteng nu nanlachin, na kihoisahna amawhna ahi bou hi, Nang hing it hing ngaiten, ang simmawta ding ua, na hinna asui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aziehpen numei nauvei nat thuoh kikou aw ging leh, taluchil hingkhe ding, natna thuoh Zion tanu kaa leh mauna awgingleh, akhutte leh a, tuin ka tung agih hi! Aziehpen tuolthatte ziehin ka hinna agimgawpta hi, chi a “Zion tanu kaa leh mau aw ging ka za hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem gawlzing tengah suhtai toutai kawi unlen, tuin en unlen, thei un, vai dihtah a hawm a, thutah sui mi khatbeh na mu uoi mah, mun awngte ah sui un, na mu u’leh ka ngaidam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaute, “Mangpa hinna louin” kichiem nan u’leh, zuou a kichiem ahibou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na mitte thutah tunga tu hilou ahiei mah? Nangman amau na vuo a, hinanleh alunggim sih uhi; amauh na sumanga, hinanleh bawlhoina asang nuom sih uhi; amaitangte uh suongpi sangin atah sah zaw ua, akinuale ut vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin ken, “Tamte mitaga ahi ua, mi mo ahi uh, aziehpen amaun Mangpa lampite athei sih ua, a Pasian uh thukhenna athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi liente kungah va pei vangin, akung uah kava gen ding hi, aziehpen amaun Mangpa lampi leh, a Pasian uh vaihawmna atheita uhi.” Hinanleh tam miten hahkol asutan ua, akolbute uh atansahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin gammanga hing kipan, humpibahnei in amauh athat dinga, gamgaw a ngia in amauh anegam ding hi; Kamkei in akhopite uh abuh dinga, tua mun akipat a pawtdoh pouma ana eehmal ding hi; aziehpen atatkhielna uh atam a, anuatolna uh apung semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tami ziehin nou bang ka hing chi ngaidam diei? na tate un kei ahing taisanta ua, pasien hiloute min in akichiemta uhi; gilva tah a ka vah nua in, Aang nangkawm san ua, ahon hon in kizuate inn ah akikhawm vapual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute hoitah a kivah sakoltal hua abang ua, michin a innvengte zi enla in ngeu hua tau abang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam silte ziehin amauh ka gawtsih ding amah? Mangpa’n achi hi, tualeh tambang nam tungah phuba kala sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Aguol a kisuon grep gui lah ah peitou unlen, susie un ahivangin abei den dingin bawl sihun, aba zamte satkhie un, Mangpa a ahi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Israel innkuonte leh Juda innkuonten, zuoutat in ahing bawl uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaun Mangpa tungtangah zuou agen ua, Aman bangma hing lawsih va, silhoilou zong itung uah tungsih vanin, namsau leh kiel ahiei zong imu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Guolneite lah huisi bang ahi ua, asung uah bangma thu a um sih hi. Tuabangin atung uah akibawl ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Tam thu nagen ziehun, Ngaiun, ka thu na kam uah meikuong in ka bawl ding a, tam mite sing toh kibang va un, ka mei kuongin amauh akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />En vawi, Israel innkuonte aw, gamlapi a um namkhat noute dou dinga, hing pui ding ka hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Nam hattah ahi ua, nam lui mama ahi ua, aham uh na theilou u’leh agen uh na theisiemlou uh nam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Athal bawmte uh han kihongsa bang ahi a, amaute abawn un mihat ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaun, na tapate leh na tanute uh neh ding, na bu na balte uh aneh beipieh ding ua, na belamhonte u’leh na ganhonte uh ahing nehkhawng pieh ding ua, na grepte u’leh na theipite uh ang neh khawng pieh ding uhi. Na muon mama uh khopi kulneite namsau in asuse sieng ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hinanleh tuami ni chiengin, ka hing sumang den sih ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh na miten bangdinga, Mangpa i Pasian un tam silte zousie i tung ua abawl adiei? achi hun chiengun Kei nang taisan ua, na gam sung ua pasien dangte, nna nasep pieh mabangun, noua hilou gam ah midangte nna naseppieh ding uhi,” chi’n amauh na dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakob innkuonte lah ah phuongzah unlen, Juda gam ah tam thu genzah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nou mimote leh theina neiloute, mit nei napi a muloute, bil nei napi a zaloute tami zaun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei nang giing sih uh amah? Mangpa’n achi hi. Ka mai ah na chitun sih ding uh amah? Keima’n tuipi alet theilouna ding senel in gamgi ka bawl a, aumden a, tuipi in akaan thei sih hi. Tui kihot in kinawng vutvut in luong nanleh alet thei sih dinga, ging het hut nanleh akaan zou tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh tam miten Paupenna lungtang leh, helhatna lungsim anei uh, ahel ua a peimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amaun, tuin Mangpa i Pasian uh ahun tah a guo masa leh, guo nukhia hing pepa leh, bu lah hun nipi kaalte hing bawl piehpa, i giing ding uhi alungtang un achi ngai vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na gitlounate un tam silte aheimangta hi, Tualeh na khelnate un silhoite nou akipat ahentaangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka mite lah ah migiloute a um ua, thangkam miten thang akam ua, abuh dap bang un, mihing matna dingin thang akam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Va bawmsunga, va adima a um bangin, a innte uh zuoubawlna in a dim hi. Tuaziehin ahing thupi ua, ahing khang lienta ua, ahing hausata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahing thau ua, ahing mamta uhi; Ahi, migiloute silbawlte akhupkhel uhi, Pa neiloute thu agen pieh sih ua, hinapi alawching zel uhi; tualeh mitasamte dihna ahumbit pieh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam silte ziehin amaute ka gawtsih ding amah? Mangpa’n achi hi. Tambang nam tungah keiman phuba ka lasih ding amah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gamsungah lungsimphawng leh, sil chizat huoi akibawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Guolneiten zuouthu agen ua, siempute’n lah athu thu un vai ahawm uhi, tualeh ka miten lah tambanga bawlte adeilam uh ahi hi; hinanleh atawpna ah bang na bawlta ding uoi leh?
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oh! nou Benjamin tate aw; Jerusalem akipat taidoh dingin kikhawm unlen, Tekoa ah pengkul mut unlen, tualeh Beth-Hakkerem ah chiemtena meikuong phutdoh un, aziehpen mallam akipat in sietna leh, suhsietna thupitah ahing kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion tanu khu numei melhoitah leh noutah toh ka tekahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Belamchingte khu a belamhonte u’toh akungah ahing pei ding ua, akim vel ah apuon innte uh azah ding ua, amauh michin ama uh mun ah akivah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Amanu dou dingin kigalging un, thou un, suntang laiin douvai,” i tunguh gih e, “Nisa lah a kiemsuh ta a, nitah lam ni him asau sem semta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Thou un, zan laiin i kuontou ding ua, a leeng innpi huongsung uh isuhsiet pieh ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Singte phua unlen, Jerusalem douna dingin muolvum bawl un, tami gawta um ding khopi khu ahi, asung khu kinuoisiena a dim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuikhuh in tuite apuldohsah mabangin, aman zong gitlouna apawtdohsah hi. Asungah gummtatna leh kipawngbawlna akiza a, ka masangah lungdon chimawna leh liemnate a um ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, vau hilna ngaisah in, tuachilouin ka hinna in ang pawtsan kha dinga, na gam ka suse dinga, koima tenlouna gam ka hing suohsah kha ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Israel mi umsunte bu sang bangin khonkhawm unlen, grep sang khonte bangin abate na khut un khon sieng un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azah theina ding ua koi kunga thu gen a, koi ahiei vau hilna ka pieh ding? Ngaivawi, abil uh teptanlou bil ahi a, angaikhe thei sih uhi, Ngai in, Mangpa thu khu ama ua dingin simmaw huoi ahi a, kipahna mal mal anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa lungthahna in ka dim a, kideh ka chimtah gawpta hi, “Kholai a naupangte tungah leh khanglai kikhawmte, tungah ka sungkhe ding hi; Aziehpen pasal nangawn zong azi toh lahkhawm ahi dinga, tesie kum tam tahte zong ama toh lahkhawm ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh a innte uh midangte kung a pieh ahi dinga, aloute u’leh azite u’tawh piehkhawm ahi ding uhi; aziehpen gamsunga tengte douna in ka khut ka lam ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Aziehpen alah ua aneu pen a kipat alien pen dongin, michin huoihamna ah akipe siengta ua, tualeh guolneite leh siempute tanpha in, michin azuoutat chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaun ka mite liemna a ngai khoh pieh sih ua, hamuonna umloupi in, hamuonna, hamuonna achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sil kidahhuoi abawl chiengun azum uoi leh? Azum vawt sih uhi, kisuon na dan zong athei mawngmawng sih uhi. Tuaziehin apuate lah ah ama u’zong apua ding ua, tua hun chiengin amauh ka gawt dinga, nawkhiet in a um ding uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Lampite ah ding unlen, en un, Lampi lui hoi um na khu dong unlen tua lampi hoi zuiun, Tuachi’n na hagau ua dingin khawldamna na mu ding uhi, ka chi a, hinanleh a maun tua khu ka zui sih ding uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tung uah galveng mite zong ka koi a, pengkul ging ngaikhie un, ka chi hi. Hinanleh amaun, ka ngaikhesih ding uh, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin namte aw, ngaikhie unlen, mipi kikhawmte aw, atung ua hing tung ding thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Leitung ngaikhie in, En in, tam mite tungah angaituona ga uh sietna ka tungsah ding hi, aziehpen amaun ka thute khoh asa sih ua, ka dante zong anuolta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bang tupna a Sheba a kipat a Panamtui leh, gamlapi akipat a phai hum, hing kipuo adiei? Na halmang sillatte uh kei dingin pomtah ahi sih a, na kithoina sillatte uh kei a dingin anamtui sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: En in, tam mite masangah kipalpuana ding ka koi dinga, Pate leh atapate apua khawm ding ua, a innvengpa leh alawmpa amangthai ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “En in, mallam gam a kipat in nam khat ahing kuon dinga, lei ning gamla penpen akipat in, nam thupitah khat ahing dingdoh ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaun thalpi leh teipi atawi ding ua, atatsie ua hepina anei sih uhi, a aw uh tuipi ging abanga, sakol tunga tuongin, nangma dou dingin galdou mi bangin akichieng uhi; Aw Zion tanu.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amauh tungtanga thu kigen izata ua, ikhutte azawgawp sienga, mangbatna in numei nauvei natna bangin ahing manta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gamlah ah pawtkhe sih unlen, lampi ah zong pei sih un, aziehpen melma in namsau atawi a, mun chin ah dipkuotna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka mite tanute aw, sai ip puon sil unlen vut vai lah ah kilia un, tapa neisun suun bangin, kap in mau vengvung un, aziehpen sumangthaipa itungah thakhata hing tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Nangpen ka mite lah ah innsang leh, kulpiin ka hing guotta a, a umdan uh na thei a, na et chientheina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaute mi phengphi, helhat, migensie a vahkawite ahi ua, sum-eng sie bang ahi ua, abawn un silsie ngen abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pum nasatahin akizap hut hut a, ngentang mei ah azunmang hi, asusiengpa suhsiengna khu amawhna asuoh a, migiloute paimang ahituomlou ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mangpa’n amaute anuoltah ziehin, miten dangka sia deiloute, achita ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa akipat a Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung khu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa innkotpi ah ding inlen, tuanah tam thu phuongin: Mangpa be dinga tami kotpi a hing lut Juda zousiete aw, Mangpa thu ngaikhie un chiin genin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Na umdante u’leh na silbawlte uh siempha un, tuachi’n tam mun ah ka hing tengsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamte khu Mangpa biehinn ahi, Mangpa biehinn Mangpa biehinn, Mangpa biehinn tamte ahi, chi a zuouthu kigente tahsang sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Na umdante u’leh na silbawlte uh na siemphat ua, mi khat leh a innveng kikal a, vaihawmna dihtah na bawl u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamdang mite, Pa neiloute leh meithaite, na nuoisie sih ua, mawna neiloute sisan nasuolou ua, nouma kisuhliemna ding bep a gamdang pasiente nua na zui sih pou u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam mun ah, na pu napate u’kunga ka pieh gam ah kumtawn in kahing teng densah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“En un, phattuomna neilou zuouthute na tahsang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na guta un, tuolnathat un, ang na kawm un, zuoua kichiem in, Baal kunga gimnamtui hal in na theingailou uh pasiente nua na zui un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka min pua tam inn a, ka mai a hing dingin, tam silkidahhuoite zousie bawl dingin, hutkhiet in iumta uh chi ding na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka min pua, tami inn na mitmu ua, suomhatte kokhuh hing suoh ahita amah? En un, Keima ngelngel in ka mu ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka min umna dinga ka bawl masah, Shiloh mun ah pei unlen, ka mi Israelte gitlouna zieh a tua mun a ka silbawlte va mu un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh tuin tamsilte zousie na bawl ziehun, zingmawng matah a thouin na kung uah thu ka gen a, hinanleh naza nuom sih ua, ka hing hat leh lah nang dawng nuom sih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin Shiloh tunga ka bawl bangin, ka min pua na muon mama uh tami inn tungah leh noute leh napu napate kunga ka piehsa mun tungah ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh na unaute uh Ephraim hahlesuonte zousie ka paidoh bangin, noute zong ka mitmu akipat hing paimang ding ka hi; Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tam mite a dingin thungetpieh sinlen, kikou ging ahiei, thungetna ahiei bawl sinlen ka kungah ngetna leh thumna zong bawl sin, ka hing ngaikhe sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda khopite leh Jerusalem kholai dunga asil bawlte uh mulou na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupangten sing atom ua, apate un mei ataw kuong ua, numeiten van leengnu kunga lat ding tanghou ameh ua, Keima ang suh lungthah theina dingun pasien dangte a dingin dawn sillatte alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei maw ahing lungthahsah uh? Mangpa’n achi hi; amauleh amauh kimaizumsuona bep hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: En un, ka thangpaina, leh lungthahna, tam mun tungah leh mihing leh gamsa tungah tualeh gamlah singte leh leitung a theigate tungah ka sungbo dinga, aka dinga, akiphelmit sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Na kithoinate uah, na halmang sillatte uh belap unlen, asa ne un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen Izipt gama kipat a napu napate uh ka puidoh niin, halmang sillat ahiei, kithoina tungtang akung uah ka genkha sih a, thupieh zong ka bawl khasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh tami ahi ka thupiehte: Ka thu mangun, na Pasian uh ka hi dinga tualeh noute ka mite nahi ding uhi. Tualeh na umdan ding ua ka hing thupiehte zuiun, tuakhu nou a dingin ahoi ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh amauten azui utsih ua, abil un zong angaikhe ut sih ua, tuanahsangin a lungtang giloute uh deidan leh ngaituona bangin agamta ua, mailam sawnlouin anuatawn zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh Izipt gam akipat ahing pawtdoh ni ua kipat tuni dongin, ka suoh guolneite nichin a matah a thou in na kung uah ka hing sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun ka thu asang sih ua, abil uzong adaw ut sih ua, angawng uh akhausah ua, apu leh pate uh sangin agilou zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tam thute zousie akung uah na gen dinga, hinanleh amaun ahing ngaikhe sih ding uhi; amauh na han dinga, hinanleh ahing dawng sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n akung uah Mangpa a Pasian uh aw zuilou, bawl hoina zong pom nuomlou, nam ahi uh, na chi dinga; thutah abeimangta a, akam ua pat in satkhieh ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na sam heu inlen, paimangin, tualeh munsang tung kieute ah kaa teng louin awi inlen, aziehpen Mangpa’n athangpaina khangte anuol a, anuasieta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Aziehpen Juda taten ka mitmu ah silgilou abawlta uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Ka mina kihan innsung suhbuana dingin silkidahhuoi, milimte atungdohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh ka lungsim a ka gelkhah ngailou leh thu ka pieh khahlou, atapate u’leh atanute uh mei a halna dingin, Hinnom tapa guom a um Tophet mun ah munsangte alam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngai un, nite hing tung ding ahita, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tam mun pen Tophet akichi nawn sih ding a, Hinnom tapa guom zong akichi nawn sih dinga, kithana guom akichizawta ding hi, aziehpen mun dang aum nawnlou masangsie Tophet ah avui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tam mite mishi luongte khu tungleeng vate leh leitunga gamsate ann neh ahita dinga, koiman amaute aheumang zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda khopite apat leh Jerusalem gawlzingte apat in, lungnopna leh kipahna husate tualeh mouneipa leh mounu lungdam awte ka tawpsahta ding hi; aziehpen gam luolou a segawp ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tua hun chiengin Mangpa’n achi hi, Juda leengpate gute, amiliente gute, siempute gute, zawlneite gute leh Jerusalem a tengte gute ahankhuh ua kipat in ahing ladoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh a it uh, ana ana seppieh uh, anua azuiuh, asui u’leh abieh uh, ni leh haleh van a um zousie masangah akipha ding ua, akilakhawm nawn sih ding ua, akivui sih ding uhi, tualeh leitung masang ah eeh bang giap ahita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka delmangna mun aum tam innkuon gilouten hin sangin shi atel zaw ding uhi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tuathamlouin, amaute kungah, Mangpa’n tambangin thu agen hi: Mi apua leh thoukia lou dinguh amah? Mi apielmang chiengun, hing kinuale kia lou dinguh amah? na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahileh bangdinga, Jerusalem mite kumlekhua a nuatol den ata uoi leh? Lepchiena atukip ua, hing nuakia ut nawnlou uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ke’n ka ngaikhie a, kaza hi, hinanleh amaun thudih agen sih uhi. Agitlouna ua pat koima akisia utsih ua, bang ka bawl ngel ei? achi uhi. Michin ama lampi chiet ah akihei ua, sakol kidouna phuol lam del abang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vanlai a tuivapi nangawn in ahunbi kiguotte athei a, vakhu leh tuiva tualeh sielpaleeng in ahing tun hun uh athei uhi. Hinanleh ka miten Mangpa vaihawmna athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Bangchidan a, kapil uhi, Mangpa dan ka kung uah a um hi nachi thei uh ahiei mah? En un, laigiel miten laikung zuou thei azang ua zuou thumal agiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipilte azum ua, alungdong ua, mat in aum uhi. En un, amaun Mangpa thu adeisih ua, tuachi’n ama uah bang pilna a um ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin azite uh midangte kungah ka pe dinga, tualeh aloute uh aluo ding mite kungah ka pe ding hi. Aziehpen aneupen akipat alien leh thupipen dongin, michin abawn un punna dei a enna leh, huoihamna ah akipe siengta uhi. Zawlneite leh siempute na ngawn azuoutat chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaun ka mite tanute liemna awlmawlou tahin athoi ua, hamuonna umloupi, hamuonna, hamuonna, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sil kidahhuoi abawl chiengun azum uoi mah? Zumlou uh, zumna mawngmawng anei sih ua, zalatdan zong athei vateh sih uhi. Tuaziehin apuate lah ah atel ding ua, gawt a aum ni chiengun, amaute paikhieh ahita ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pellou in amauh ka sumang ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Grepgui ah grepga a um sih dinga, theipi kunga ah zong theipiga a um sih ding hi; anate avuoi dinga, tualeh akung ua ka silpiehte ama ua kipat in ka lamang ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangdinga daptou ihi uoi? Hing kikhawm unlen khopi kulpineite ah lut vaiin, khunah sip khinkhian va ui. Aziehpen Mangpa i Pasian un, sip khin khian dingin ahing koita a, Mangpa tunga ikheltah ziehun, dawn dingin gu tui ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hamuonna ding isui ua, hinanleh silhoi bangma ahing tung sih hi, Damna hun ikineppi vangin buoina ahingtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Asakol nahging Dan akipat in akiza a, asakol hattahte uh ham gingin gamsung pumpi achitun sah hi. Aziehpen ahing tung ua gam leh asunga um zousie, khopi leh asunga tengte netum dingin ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai vawi, khawizuol theilou gulte leh, gulgukhate na lah uah kang sawl ding a, ahing tu ding uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka dana tunga kei leh kei kihamuon ka tup chiengin, ka lungtang ka sung ah aba gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gamlapi a kipat a ka mite tanute kaa awging khu, ngaiun, “Zion ah Mangpa umlou amah? Asungah aleengpa umlou amah?” “Bangdinga amilim siemthute u’leh, agamdang milimte utoh ang lungthahsah uh ahiei mah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Bu lah hun akikhelta a, nipi abeita, Eite lah hundam in ium sih nalai lai uhi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka mite tanute liemna khu, kei liemna ahi. Ka suuna, chizatna in ahing manta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilead ah singnai damdawi umlou ahiei mah? khunah sudamthei mi a umsih amah? Ahileh bangdinga ka mite tanute liemna khu, damdoh theilou ahiei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oh! ka lutang tuikhuh hihenlen, ka mit hituite tuinah hileh aw, tha a um ka mite tanute asun azan a, ka kaa theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gamdai ah khuolbuh neita maileng aw, ka mite nuasie a, peisan thei ding hi vengin. Azieh pen amauh abawn un, angkawm hatmi ahi ua, solhat mihon um khawm ahibou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thalpite uh kap dinga a loibang un, aleite uh zuou gen dingin azang uhi. Leitungah thutah adingin ahangsan sih uhi. Silhoilou khat akipat silhoilou dang khat abawl ua, Kei ahing theisih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Michin a innvengte chiet lah ah pilvang henlen, aunaupa koima khat zong tahsang sih heh, aziehpen unau chinteng mi solhat ngen ahi ua, innveng chinteng zong migensiet hatte toh avah kawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Michin in a innvengte chiet uh asol ua, thudih agen sih uhi, alei uh zuouthu gen ding dan ahilta ua, gitlouna bawl dingin akisugim gawpta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tenna khu solhatte lah ahi a, solna ziehin kei ahing thei utsih uhi; Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Ngai un, ka halsieng dinga, tualeh amauh ka enchien ding hi, Ka mite tanute ziehin bang chin ka bawlta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aleite uh thaltang kikapdoh bang ahi a, zuouthu agen uhi, mi khat in a innvengpa kungah, kilemna thu gen nanleh alungtangah ama abuh dap ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam silte ziehin amauh gawtlou ding ka hiei mah? Mangpa’n achi hi. Tambang namte tungah phuba ka lasih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Muol leh taangte adingin kap in ka mau dinga, gamdai a lou dawnna munte, suun in kaateng lou in ka awi dinga, aziehpen koima pei khah thei nawnlouna dingin akatumta uhi, Ganta ham aw ging miten aza nawn sih ding ua, tungleeng vate leh gamsate zong, ataizahta ua, apeimang siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem khu silsie kikoikhawmna vum leh, si-alte kuo in ka bawl ding a, tualeh Juda khopite khu ateng ding umlou, ahawmguoh ka suohsah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami theisiem ding mipil koi ahiei? Tualeh aphuonzah theina dinga, Mangpa kam in akunga thu agenna mi khu koi ahiei mah? Bangzieh a gam mangthai gawpa, koima peithei nawnlouna dinga gamdai banga kahtum sieng atai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n, “Amaute masanga ka koi ka dan ataisan ziehun, ka thu amang sih ua, zui zong azui sih uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh amauh lungtang ngaituona bangin agamta ua, apu apate un ana hil uh Baal nua azui zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: En un, tam mite gamsai in ka vah dinga, tualeh tuikha ka dawnsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama u’leh apu apate un athei khah ngailou uh namte lah ah ka thethang dinga, ka suhmang sieng masangsie’n namsau in ka nuadel sah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ngaituo unlen, kap leh mau a suun dingin, numei kapsiemte hankhawm un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaute hing kinaw u’henlen, imitte ua hitui aluona, imitvunte un hitui ahing luondoh sah theina dingun, eite adingin kap leh mau in sun uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zion akipat in ka leh mauna aw ging akiza hi: Bangchi tuha suhsiet ihita uoi! Aziehpen igam uh inuasieta ua, itenna munte ua kipat a nawdoh ihita ziehun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh, Numeite aw Mangpa thu ngaikhie un, Akam a thupawt na bil uah lut henlen, na tanute uh kaala hil un, tualeh michin in a innveng kaa leh mau dan zilsah uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I kottate ah shina ahing lutta a, i leeng inn huong sungah alutta hi. Khopi gawlzingte a naupangte that ding leh, kholaidungte atangvalte sattan dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin gen in achi hi: Mishiluongte gamlah ah sil deilou, kipaite bangin alum ding ua, bu atte nua a buphaite abang ding ua, koiman akhawm sih ding hi,” chiin gen in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Mipil in apilna suong sih henlen, mihat in ahatna suong sih heh, tualeh mihausa in zong ahausatna suong sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh asuong pouma in tami suong heh: Kei Mangpa khu itna hepinate, adiha vaihawmnate dihtatnate leitunga bawl zing. Mangpa kahi chi ahing thei u’leh, tua theisiemna khu ka kipahna ahi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ngai un, nite hing tung ding ahita, Mangpa’n achi hi: teptan himel a teptanloute banga umte zousie kagawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Iziptte, Judate, Edomte, Ammon tate leh Moabte leh gamdai ningkawi gamla tawpa teng namte zousie teptanlou ahi ua, tualeh Israel innkuonte zousie zong lungtanga teptanlou ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, Mangpa’n na kung ua athugen ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Namdangte umdan zui sih unlen, van a chiemtenate ziehin lungke sih un, Aziehpen namte amauh ziehin alungkie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Namte tawndan ngainate bangmalou ahi bou hi, amaun gamlah a singte ava phua ua, heipi toh mi khutsiemten singmilim akheng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua sing milim dangka leh sana in azem ua, akitatloh louna dingin sehta in siakilna toh akildet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Muisum sing bangin pielou in a ding ua; Hinanleh, aham theisih ua, apei theilou ziehun, puoh kawi kawi angai hi. Amauh giing sih un, silhoilou abawl thei sih ua, silhoi zong abawl thei sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangma bang koima a um sih hi, Nang na thupi a, na min zong hatna in athupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma hing giinglou ding koi ahiei, Aw namte leengpa? Tami na tan ding mawng ahi, aziehpen namte laha mipilte zousie leh, a leenggam pumpi sung uah zong, Nangma bang koima a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute pen lungtang thasie leh mimo ahi ua, sing milim khu akithuhilna uh phatuomlou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dangka sia kikheng pehte Tarshish apat in ahing pua ua, tualeh Uphaz apat in sana, khutsiemte nasep leh sana khengte khut suoh ahing puo ua; Puon dum leh asandup in azem ua, tuate zousie mikhutsiemte nasep ngen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa khu Pasian dihtah ahi a, Ama khu Pasian Hing leh kumtawn Lengpa ahi. Alungthah chiengin leitung akiling dinga, namten alungthahna athuoh zou sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tambangin akung uah nagen ding uhi: “Lei leh vante siem theilou pasiente khu, leitung leh vante nuoi akipat amangthai sieng ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman Avangletna in leitung abawl a, Ama’n apilna in khovel aphutdet hi. Tualeh atheisiemna in vante azahkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama’n aw asuo chiengin vante ah tui tampite a umsah a, tui meite kawlmong akipat in akaitou sah hi, guozuhna dingin tun aphesah a, agoubawmte akipat in hui alaangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Michin theina neilou in amawl ua, sana kheng chinteng amilim khen in azumsah hi, aziehpen amilim sunthaw khu kisolna ahibou hi, ama uah nahna hu a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangmalou ahi ua bawlkhelna nasep ahi giep uhi, gawt a aum hun chiengun amangthai siengding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakob tanvou khu ama ubang ahisih, aziehpen Ama sil zousie siempa ahi, Israel khu agoutan nam ahibou hi; Galkapte Mangpa Amin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nou kulpisunga imkhum a umte aw, gamsung akipat in na puonlomte uh lakhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “En un, tu hun in gamsunga tengte zousie ka paikhe dinga, atheitham ding un ka gentheisah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka liemna ziehin ka tung agih hi, ka liemna khu anase mama hi, hinanleh ken, “Adihtahin tampen kei a dinga gawtna khat ahi, ka thuoh teitei ding ahi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka puon inn suhsietin a umta a, ka khaute atan siengta; ka tate kei apat apeimang siengta ua, a um nawn sih uhi. Ka puon inn hing zah pieh kia ding leh, ka puon zahte hingkhai pieh ding koima aumta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen Belamchingte alungmawl siengta ua, Mangpa suidan athei sih uhi. Tuaziehin alawching thei sih ding ua, abelamhonte uh akithethang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai un, mallam akipat in buoina thusie, thawmging ahing tung a! Juda khopite luo loua koi a, si-alte umna suohsah ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, mihing umdan pen ama ah aum sih chi ka thei hi. Mihingin ama kalsuon dingte akipui thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, hing sudihin, hinanleh vaihawmna dih in, na lungthahnain vang hilou in, tuachilouin bangmalou na hing suo kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang hing theikhalou namte tungleh, namin loukha ngailou namte tungah, na lungthahna sungbuo in; aziehpen amaun Jakob anetumta ua, apumval ua anegam siengta ua, atenna gam uh asuhsiet pieh ua, tenna giehnalou asuoh sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa akipat a Jeremiah kunga thu hing tungin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tami thuhun thute ngai unlen, Juda mite kung leh Jerusalem a tengte kungah gen un; achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh akung uah gen inlen, Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi, tam thuhun thute zuilou mi khu samsiet in um heh, chi’n gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua thu khu: Izipt gam a sia haltuina meilipi akipat a napu napate uh ka puidoh ni a ka thugente mang unlen, na kung ua ka hing thupiehte dungzui in bawl un, tuachi’n Ka mite nahi ding ua, Kei na Pasian uh kahi ding hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachia, napu napate u’kunga tuni a banga, nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam pieh dinga kana kichiemna tangtung sah ding kahi,” achi hi, chiin gen in, achi hi. Tuachi’n “Ken hiheh Mangpa” chiin ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah: “Tam thute zousie Juda khopite leh Jerusalem gawlzing tengah phuongzah inlen, tam thuhun thute ngaikhie unlen, bawl un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Izipt gam a kipata ka puidoh ni akipat tuni dongin, Ka aw ngaikhie un chi’n matah a thou in, phatuomngai tahin, napu napate uh kungah thuhil kawm in ka phuut zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun amang sih ua, abil u’zong adaw sih uhi, tua nahsangin michin in amauh lungtang gilou ngaituona uh azuita zawsop uhi; tuaziehin, akung ua bawl dinga ka pieh thuhun thute zousie atung uah ka tungsah ding ka chi a, hinanleh amaun abawl sih uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Juda mite lah leh Jerusalem atengte lah ah aguh a thuphielna a um hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thu ngaikhe nuomlou, apu leh pate uh khelna lam ah akinua heita ua, ana uh seppieh dingin pasien dangte nua azuita uhi; Israel innkuonte leh Juda innkuonten, apulepate utoh ka bawl ka thuhun abawtseta uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: apel thei guollou uh sietna amaute tungah ka tungsah ding hi. Kei hing han nan u’leh ka ngaikhe sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachiengin Juda khopite leh Jerusalem a tengte apei ding ua, gimnamtui hal a alatna uh pasiente kungah akikou ding ua, hinanleh, tuaten abuoi hun chiengun ahundam thei mawngmawng sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Juda, na khopi uh tam dungzuiin na pasiente u’zong atam zel hi, tualeh Jerusalem gawlzing tamdan dungzui in, pasien zum huoi Baal kunga gimnamtui halna maitam na daw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tam mite adingin thungetpieh sinlen, ama ua dingin thumna ahiei thungetna ahiei zong nei sin, abuoi chieng ua ahing hatna uh dawnglou ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tampite toh silkidahhuoi bawl khawm in, ka itpen in ka inn ah bang bawl ding ahiei anei? Tahsa siengthou nanga kipat apei suohta chi thei in, sil hoilou na bawl chiengin na kipah deu deu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa’n na min dingin Olive sing hing hoitah leh ga hoi, ahing chi hi. Hinanleh buoina nasatah thawmging toh atungah, mei ataw kuonga abate atawng siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel innkuonte leh Juda innkuonten gitlouna abawl ua, Baal mai a gimnamtui hal a, ahing lungthah sah ziehun, galkapte Mangpa nang hing phutpa’n, na tunga sietna hing tung ding aphuongdohta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa’n tam thu kei ahing theisah a, ka thei hi, tuachi’n nangman asil bawlte uh na hing musah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh keipen gaw dinga kikai belamnou bang ka hi a, Kei hing tha sawm uh ahilam ka phawhkha sih hi. Amauten: “Sing kung khu aga pum in sumang vaiin, amin kithei nawn louna dingin mihing gam akipat ama satkhe vai,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw galkapte Mangpa, Nang dihtattah a vaihawmpa sunggil lam leh, lungtang enchien zelpa, atung ua na phulahna hing musah in, Na kungah ka tungthu ka hing sulangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin “Ka khut ua na shi louna dingin, Mangpa min in thu gen sin” chia, na hing sui Anathoth mite tungtang Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ngai un, amauh ka gawt dinga, tangvalte namsau in ashi ding ua, atapate u’leh atanute uh kiel in ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh ashimawh umsun chi mawng mawng a umsih ding uhi; aziehpen Anathoth mite tungah sil hoilou hing tungsah ding ka hi, akigawtna ding uh kum ngei in.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na kunga, ka phun in zong Nang na dihtat hi; hinanleh na vaihawmna thu ah nang hing houpi vang. Bangziah a migiloute gamtatna lawching ahiei? Bangzieh a lepchietah a sil bawlte kipah ahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang amauh na suon a, tuachi’n hui aha ua, akhang uhi, Ahi, ga ahing asuong ta uhi. Akam uah nanai a, alungsim uah na gamla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa, Nangman kei nahing thei a, nahing muta a, Ka lungtang nangma lam ah na enchien zel hi. Gaw ding belamte bangin amauh kaidoh inlen, gawna ni a dingin amauh guolsain koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gam sungin bangtan vei suun dinga, lougam mun tenga hampate bangtan vei vuoi ding ahiei? Asunga tengte gitlouna ziehin, gamsate leh vate amangthai sieng ua, “Amaun itawpna ni ding ama’n amu sih ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kenga pei mite toh na kitaidem a, gim nakisah leh, bangchidan a sakol toh kitaidem thei ding na hiei? Tualeh muonna leh bitna gam a, bawn ahing gimsah u’leh, Jordan gammang nuoi ah bang na chita ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na unaute leh na pa innkuonpite, nangawn in lepchietah in ahing bawlta uhi; Ahi, amaun kikou in ahing nuadel uhi. Na kungah thuhoi gennan u’leh tahsang sin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka inn ka taisanta a, Ka nei kalamteng ka nuasieta hi; ka hinna in a it angaipen amelmate khut ah ka peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka goutan khu kei adingin, gamlah a humpibahnei bang ahing hita a, ahing ngih khum a tuaziehin ka mudata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka goutan khu kei adingin langta pawl bang ahia, akimvel a um langta dangten ama a dou uh, bang hitalou ahiei amah? pei unlen gamsa zousie amauh negam dingin khawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Belamchingmi tampiten ka grep huon asuseta ua, amaun ka satan akengtaw un atuonchilta uhi; ka tanvou deitah khu gamdai gamkieu asuohsahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaun asusegawpta ua gamsie asuohta a, ka kungah akap hi; gam pumpi asegawpta, koiman lungsim in aveina sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamdai munsang kieu zousie tungah susemite ahing tunga, Mangpa namsau in anehtum ding ziehin, gam tawp langkhat akipat, alelam gam tawp donga mi koiman muonna anei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bu atu ua, hinanleh ling ga a at uhi, Ama u’leh amauh akisugim mama ua, hinanleh bangma alemlaw sih uhi. Mangpa lungthahna chizat huoi ziehin, na gasuote uah zumna muva u’teh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: ka mi Israelte kunga ka luosah goutan khoikha ka innveng giloute zousie tungah, “Ngai un agam ua pat in ka botdoh ding a, alah ua pat in Juda innkuonte ka botdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n tambang ahi ding a, amauh ka bawdoh nua chiengin, ka hing kinuahei kia dinga, atung uah lainatna ka nei dinga, michin agam u’leh agouluona mun chiet uah, ka nua pui kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh tambang a hing hi ding: Baal kunga ka mite kichiem azilsah mabang ua ka min siel a, Mangpa ahing hi chia, kichiem akizilsah ua, ka mite umdan pilvangtah a azilsah u’leh, ka mite lah ah tunding in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh thu amansih u’leh vang, tua thumanglou nam khu ka phungkal dinga, ka sumang ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin ka kungah agen hi: “Pei inlen puonmalngat a kibawl kawnggah khat lei inlen, na kawngah gah inlen, tui lah ah koisin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu dungzuiin, kawnggah khat ka lei a, ka kawng ka gahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu ka kungah ani veina ahing tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na kawnggah lei, na kawnga na gah khu tawi inlen, thou inlen, Euphrates lui ah pei inlen, suongpi hawm sung khat ah va phuol in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ahing thupieh dungzuiin kava pei a, Euphrates luipi gei ah kava phuolta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh ni tampi nua in hichi ahing hi a, Mangpa’n ka kungah thu agen a, “Thou inlen Euphrates lui ah pei inlen, khuna phuol dinga thu ka hing pieh kawnggah khu, khuna kipat in valadoh in,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Euphrates lui ah ka peita a, ka tou doh a, ka phuolna mun apat in kawnggah ka ladohta a, tualeh kawnggah khu ana ngot siengta a, bangmain akimang thei nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tambangmain Juda kiletsahna leh Jerusalem kithupisahna ka suse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thute ngaikhe nuomlou tam nam gilouten amauh lungsim ngaituona banga gamta a, pasien dangte nuazui a, ana uh seppiehte khu phattuomna neilou tam kawnggah bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen kawnggah khu mihing kawnga abel chinten bangin, Israel innkuon pumpi leh Juda innkuon pumpi, ka mite hi ding leh, ka minthanna, ka pahtawina leh ka thupina ahi theina dingun, ka kunga bel chinten dingin ka bawl a, hinanleh amaun angaikhe nuom sih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuaziehin amaute kungah tam thu nagen ding ahi: Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Tuithawl chinteng ah zu akithal dim ding ahi.” Tualeh amaun na kungah, tuithawl chinteng ah zu akithal dim ding chi ka thei sih uh amah? achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachiengin nang akung uah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, na chi ding hi: Ngai un, tam gamsunga teng zousie, David leengtoupha tunga tou leengpa ngel leh siempute, guolneite leh Jerusalem a tengte zousie zukhamna in ka dimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh amauh khat leh khat ka tattuo dinga, pa leh atate nangawn ka sutuo ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Amaute ka hepi sih dinga, ka hinkhawi sih dinga, ka khotuo vawt sih dinga ka suse zaw ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bil dawin ngaiun, Kiliensah sih un, Mangpa’n thu agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian u’kungah thupina pie un, mielna ahing tunsah masangin, taang miel tunga na kengte uh akipal pua masangin, Vah mu ding na kinep laitah un, Aman shina lim asuohsah a, miel satah in abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh na ngaikhieh nuom sih u’leh, na kiletsahna ziehun ka hinna aguh in akap dinga, ka mitte a hitui luong zungzungin hasetah in ka kap ding hi, aziehpen Mangpa belam honte sal a puimang in aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lengpa leh leengnu kungah gen in, “Kingai ngiem unlen, tou suhun aziehpen na vaihawmna uh kise ding ahita a, na thupina leenglukhu uzong nalutung ua pat ke ding ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Simlam khopite kha in a um dinga, Koiman ahong sih ding hi. Judate sal a puimangin a um ding ua, abawn un sal a puimangin a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Dahtou unlen, sahlang akipat a hing peite en un. Nangman hing kipie na belam hon, kilawm mamate hei a um uh atai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman ahing gawt hun chiengin bang na genta diei? Aziehpen nangman amaute khu, na tunga lamkai leh houtu a pang dingin na hilta hi, gimna in numei nauvei bangin ahing man sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na lungsim a bang zieh a tambang silte ka tunga hing tung ahiei? nachi khah leh, na gitlouna uh athupi seng zieh a, na nihten kihawhkhie a, zumna lientah na tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ethiopia miin avun aheng thei diei? ahisihleh gielbem in agiel aheng thei diei? Tuachi’n nou silgilou bawl zongsangten zong, silhoi bawl thei tuomlou nahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin gamdai huiin bushi amut leeng bangin, amauh ka thethang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami nahaitan uh, nou a dinga atuoma ka hing te pieh, kei apata na satan uh ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Kei na hing manghiltah ziehun zuouthu na tahsangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin keiman na maitang dongin, na nih ka lemtou dinga, tuachi’n na za maw akilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na angkawmnate uh, ngeu hua tau na bah koinate uh, huasantah a na kizuanate, muol tungte a nasil kidah huoi bawlte uh ka muta hi. Aw Jerusalem na tung agih hi! Tutan chienga zong kisusieng lou ding na mah?”
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khikhal ding tungtanga Jeremiah kunga Mangpa thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Juda in asuun a, akulkotpite anguita hi; Gamsung suun in kap in amau ua, Jerusalem kaa aw ging azamtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A miliente un anaupangte uh tui sui dingin asawl ua, tuikhuh ah ava pei ua, tui amu sih uhi. Abel hawm utoh ang kinuale kia uhi; azum ua, alungdong ua, akilukhu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen lei akhikhang a, gamsunga guo azuhlou zieh in, louhoumite ahing zumta ua, akilukhuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, Sakhiten gamlah ah nou anei ua, hinanleh loupa a umlou ziehin anuasieta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh gam sabiltungte munsang kieute ah ading ua, si-alte bangin huikhuo anam vutvut ua, loupa a umlou ziehin amit uh avaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa ka khelnate un hing heh nanleh, na min ziehin tami bawl in, aziehpen ka nuatolna uh atam sengta a, na tungah ka khielta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Israelte kinepna, mangbat hun chieng ua Hundampa, Bangzieh a gamsunga mikhuol banga, zan khat bep taam ding khuolzin mi bang na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh a mi lungkegawp bang leh, hundam zoulou mihat bangmai na hiei mah? Hinanleh aw Mangpa nang ka lah uah na um a, Koute na min a kihante ka hi ua, hing nuasie vawt sin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n tam mite kungah tambangin agen hi: “Amauten tambanga vahvai a ut ua, akalsuon uh akideh zousih uhi. Tuaziehin Mangpa’n amauh a pom thei sih a, Tuin Aman agitlouna uh athei ngitnget ding a, akhelnate uh agawt ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kung ah “Tam mite hoina dingin thungen sin, ang chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ann angawl chiengun akikou uh ka ngaikhe sih dinga, halmang sillat leh ann sillat alat chieng un ka pomsih ding hi. Hinanleh amaute, namsau in, kielin tualeh natna hi in ka thatgam ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken, “Eh, Mangpa Pasian, ngaiin, guolneiten akung uah namsau na mu sih ding ua, kiel zong na thuoh sih ding uh, hinanleh tam munah, Lungmuonna ka hing pe ding hi,” chiin ahil uhi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Guolneiten ka min in zuou thu agen uhi. Ken amauh ka sawl sih a, thu ka pekha sih a, akung uah thu zong ka genkha sih hi; Amaun na kung uah kilahna dihloute leh dawi aisante leh silphatuomlou leh alungtang lepchienate uh agen zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n ka min a thugen guolneite leh ka sawl zong hiloupi a, namsau leh kiel tam mun ah atung sih ding chi a gente tungtang tambang in agen hi; Namsau leh kiel in tua guolneite thagam ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua athugen lawhna mite uh khu, kiel leh namsau ziehin Jerusalem gawlzingte ah paidoh in a um ding ua, ama u’leh azite uh, atapate u’leh atanute uh hitaleh avui ding koima a um sih ding hi, aziehpen agitlouna uh atung ua sungbaw ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tam thute akung ua nagen ding ahi: Ka mit ah hituite sun leh zan in luong henlen, khawl sih uhen. Aziehpen ka mite tanu nungah siengthou khu, nasatah a vuoh leh liemna thuoh in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gamlah a ka pawtdoh leh en vawi, namsau a kithatte a um ua, Khopi sunga ka lut le lah, En vawi, kiel zieha chinate a um uhi! Ahi, guolnei hiin siempu hileh, ani un athei ngailou uh gam ah avahvai uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda pum dei a deilou na hita amah? Na hinna in Zion akidah mawngmawng ahita amah? Bangdinga suhdam theilou khop a koute hing vuo na hiei mah? Kouten muonna ka lam en ua, silhoi lah hing tung lou a, damna hun lam en unga, buoina bou a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka gitlouna u’leh ka pu leh pate uh, khelnate ka hing phuong uhi, aziehpen na tungah ka khielta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na min ziehin hing muda sinlen, na thupina leengtoupha suminse sin. Hing thei zing inlen Koute toh na thuhun suse sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Namte pasiente lah ah guo zusah thei a um eimah? ahisihleh vanten guopi akaisah thei uoi mah? Aw Mangpa ka Pasian uh nang khu, ama hilou na hiei mah? Tuaziehin nang ma ka hing ngah ding uhi, aziehpen nangman tam silte zousie, na bawl ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah: “Mosi leh Samuel ka mai ah dingnan u’leh, ka lungtang tam mite langah akihei tuom sih ding, ka muphahlouna ah amauh deldoh inlen, peimang uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, amaun na kunga hei a pei ding kahi uoi achi u’leh, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, chi’n hil in. “Koi zong natna ashi dingte natna shina ah, namsau a shi dingte namsau kungah, Kiel a shi dingte kiel kung ah, sal a mat dingte sal ah,” achi hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tualeh amaute tungah sil li ka guotpieh ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi: A that dingin namsau, atawmang dingin uite, negam ding leh suse ding in tungleeng vate leh leitunga gamsate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima’n ama u’khu Juda leengpa Hezekiah tapa Manassehin Jerusalem a asilbawl ziehin leitung leenggam zousie a koimang ding in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aw Jerusalem koi ahiei na tunga khotuona neiding? Ahisihleh koiin ahing suun diei? Ahisihleh koi ahiei bang nachi ei, chia dong dinga hing kihei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hing nuasieta, na nuatolta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tuaziehin na tungah ka khut ka ha dinga, kang suse ding hi; kisia ka chimtahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum gam a kulpi kotkhate ah zapsiengna in ka zapdinga, Atate uh ka lahpieh ding a, ka mite ka sumang ding hi, a umdan ua pat ahing kinua heikia lou ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ameithaite uh ka kungah, tuipi pieunel sanga tamzawin ka pungsah dinga, suntang laiin tanvalte nu tungah susetu ka tung sah ding a, amaute tungah lunggimna leh zauna, chizat huoitah thakhatin ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ta sagi neinu thazoi in apua a, anah hu atawpta hi, sunlai hinapi amanu adingin ni atumta hi, zum leh zalain a umta hi; asuohta umsunte, amelmate uh masangah, namsau a tha dingin ka pekhe ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka dei nu ka tung agih hi, gam pumpi kihauna leh, kinielna mi dinga nangna neikhah ka hi ta. Apung in koima ka leitawisah sih a, Apung in koima leiba kaba sih hi, hinanleh abawn un ahing hamsiet chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n, adihtahin na mi umsunte a dingin ahoi ding hi, pellouin sietna hun leh suhgentheina hunin, na melmate na kungah ka kitulutsah ngei ngei ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi’n sia mallam sia leh sum-eng akuoitan zou ding adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na gamsung pumpi a na khelna ziehin, na hausatna leh na goute amanbei a gallah dingin ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na melmate toh na thei ngailou gam ah, ka hing peisah ding hi, aziehpen ka lungthahna na tunga ka dingin, mei khat akuongdoh ta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nang na thei hi; Hing thei ngitnget inlen hing ve inlen, kei hingbawlsete tungah phuba hing lahpiehin, Na thuoh hatna apat in kei hing lamang sinlen, Nangma zieh a selphouna tuoh kahi lam hing thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thute mukhiet ahi a tualeh ka neta hi, Na thute kei a dingin lungtang nopna leh kipahna ahi; Aw galkapte Mangpa Pasian, Kei na min a kihan ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Misimmawte kikhopna lah ah ka tou ngai sih a, ka kipahpi sih hi; ka lungthahna a na hing dimsahta zieh in; Keimatangin ka tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh a ka natna bei theilou a, ka liemna suhdam utlou bang mai a, dam theilou ahiei mah? Kei a dinga, kingapna tahtah taahlou luita tui kang zel bang na hita amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Na hing kinuale kia leh ka hing pui kia dinga, ka masangah na ding ding hi. Thuginalou akipat a, thumanpha na gen leh, Keima kam bang na hi ding hi. Amauh nanglam ah hing kihei u’henlen, Nangpen ama ulam a na kihei ding ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh ama-ua dingin sum-eng kulpi in ka hing bawl dinga, amaun nang ahing dou ding ua, hinanleh ahing zou sih ding uhi, aziehpen nangma hing hundam ding leh, hing hunkhe dingin na kungah kang umpi hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Migilou khut akipat kang hunkhe dinga, mi zauhuoite khut akipat kahing tankhe ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tam mun ah zi na nei ding ahisih a, tapate, tanute zong na nei ding ahi sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tammun a pieng tapate leh tanute tungtang leh tam gamsunga, amaute paitu anute u’leh ahingkhie apate uh tungtangah tam bangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaute shi sie in ashi ding ua; Koiman asuun sih dinga, vui zong akivui sih ding uhi, leitung ah sil nieh paikhawm bang ahi zaw ding uhi, namsau leh kielin amauh athatgam ding a, a shi luongte uh tungleeng vate leh leitunga gamsate adingin ann ahita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Shisuunna inn ah lut sinlen, amauh kaapi ding ahiei, ahisihleh adaapi dingin zong vahaw sin; aziehpen tam mite apat ka hamuonna, ka itna leh ka khotuona, ka lamangta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Alienpen leh aneu pen zong tam gam sungah a shi tuoh tuoh ding ua, vui in aum sih ding ua, mihing koiman akaa sih ding ua, amaute ziehin koima aki atkeh sih ding ua, alu uh zong aheu kieu sih ding ua, amauh ziehin koima akizihkeh un alu uh aheukieu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mishi ngai a dalekapte henemna dingin koiman neh ding ann luilou ding hi, ahisihleh apa ahiei, anu ahiei shite hamuonna dingin dawn ding koiman amauh ape sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Guolnop bawlna innah zong ne ding leh dawn dingin ama utoh toukhawm dinga na peilou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngaiun, keiman tam mun akipat in na mitmu u’leh na damlai nite ua, lungnopna leh kipahna husa leh mouneipa leh mounu aw te ka tawpsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tualeh tam mite kunga tam thute zousie na hil chiengin, amaun na kunga Bangzieha Mangpa’n Ka tung ua tambang tuohsietna tung dinga aphuondoh ahiei? Ahisihleh ka gitlouna uh bang ahiei? Ahisihleh Mangpa ka Pasian uh tunga bang khelna bawl kha ka hi uoi? ahing chi chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n nang amauh kungah: Mangpa’n napu leh pate un ahing taisan tah zieh un pasien dangte nua ahing zuisanta ua, ana uh asem ua, abeta ua, Kei ang taisanta ua, ka dante azui nawn sih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh noute napu leh pate uh sanga gilouzaw in na gamta uhi; En un, michin ama lungsim ngaituona gilou dungzuiin agamta ua, ka thugen na ngaisah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin noute tam gam akipat in na thei khah ngailou u’leh napu napate un zong athei khah ngailou uh gam ah ka hing notdoh dinga, khunah pasien dangte nna sun leh zan in nasem ding ua, khunah noute deisahna ka hing musah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Ngaiun, anite ahing tung ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, Izipt gam a kipat a Israeltate puidohpa Mangpa khu ahing ahi akichi nawnlou a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Israelte mallam gama kipat leh adelmangna gam zousie akipata hing puidohpa Mangpa Ahing ahi achizohna ding uh nite hing tung ding ahita hi, tualeh keiman amauh apu leh pate uh kunga ka pieh gam ah ka puilut kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ngai un, ngaman mite tampi ka sawl dinga amauh aman ding uh, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tuazou chiengin sabeng mite tampi ka hansah dinga, amaun muol chin leh tangchin ah abeng ding ua, tualeh suong hawm lah apat asuidoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka mit in agamtatna zousie uh a mu ziehin ka mai akipat akiphuol sih hi; agitlounate u’zong ka mit apat akiphuol sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh agitlouna u’leh akhelnate uh aleni in ka thuh masa phot ding hi, aziehpen amaun ka gam asubuata ua, tualeh kidahhuoi leh luohsuoh huoi a milim luongte un ka goutan gam adimsahta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka hatna leh ka kulpi, genthei nia ka kibutna, kawlmong apat in Jentelte na kungah ahing pei ding ua, “Ka pu leh pate un, zuou leh bangmalou leh phattuomna mawngmawng, umlouna ana luota uhi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihingten ama dingin pasiente akibawl thu ding uh adiei? Tuate lah pasiente hiloupi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ngaiun, Keima’n amaute tami ka theisah phot ding hi. Ka bantha leh ka hatdan ka theisah ding; Tuachi’n amaun ka min khu, Mangpa ahi chi atheita ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Juda khelna khu sia laikung leh suongmantam muh hiem khuohthaw a kigiel ahia, tuakhu alungtang suongpeh u’leh amaitam kiite tunga gel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Atate nangawn un muol sangtung chintenga sing hing bul chintenga kidaw leh kiphut maitamte leh Ashera songlaite atheizing lai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw gam a um ka taang, na gamsung pumpi, khelna zieh in, tua gam a taangte leh na hausatna u’leh nagoute zousie uh na munsangte utoh gallah vante bang in pekhe sieng ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh nangma mama ka hing pieh na goutan na tangden nawn sih dinga, na thei ngailou gam ah nna ka hing semsah ding hi; aziehpen ka lungthahna mei kuong, akuong den dingin na hal kuongta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Mihing muonga, mihing bantha hatna muong a, alungtanga Mangpa kiheisan mi khu, hamsiet in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen gamgaw gam a hampa pou bang ahi dinga, silhoi ahing tun chiengin amukha sih dinga, gamdai gamgaw leh koima tenlouna gam ah ateng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mangpa muong mi leh a kinepna uh, Mangpa hi mi khu ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama khu tui luong kunga sing kisuon, lui gei a ahui ha bang ahi dinga, kholum hun hing tun chiengin azau sih ding a, a nate ahing ngitnget ding hi; khokhal kum khoh asa sih dinga, ga suo lou in a um sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungtang khu sil zousie sanga lepchie zaw leh gilou tawpkhoh ahi a, koi in atheizouta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kei Mangpa’n michin aumdan dungzui u’leh asilbawl ga dungzui ua, pe dingin lungtang ka ensuoh a, tualeh lungsim ka enchien zel hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dihloutah a hausatna nga mi khu, ama tui loupi op keu mengkeng bang ahi, adamsung nite ngeiin tua hausatna in anuasie dinga atawp ah mi maw ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Achiil a kipata pahtawina mangtoupha thupi sangtah khu mi siengthou te umna mun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Israelte kinepna, nang hing taisan zousie amuolphou ding uhi; Nang hing kiheisan poumate leivui lah a gel bang bep ahi ding uhi, aziehpen Mangpa hinna tuinah khu a hing ataisanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing sudam in, tuachi’n ka dam ding hi, hing hundam in tuachi’n hundam ka hi ding hi. Nang ka phat ngitngetpa khu nahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai vawi, amaun ka kungah, “Mangpa thu hei a um ahiei? Tuin hing tungta heh,” a chi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei ka hileh na nuazui, na belamchingpa ka hina apat ka taimang sih a, tunggihna ni zong ka lunggul sih hi, ka kam apata hing pawt dohte, na masangah adih ahi chi na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei adingin a giinhuoi hi sin, sietna ni a ka kinepna na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei hing bawlsete zalatsah in um u’henlen, hinanleh keipen hing zalasah sin, ama u pen lungkie in chimaw uhenlen, hinanleh kei pen hing lungkesah sin. Atung uah tuohsietna tungsah inlen, sietna ale niin amauh sumang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin ka kungah agen hi: “Pei inlen Juda leengte lutna leh pawtna mipite kulkotpi leh Jerusalem kulkotpi zousie ah vading inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tualeh akung uah, Juda leengte leh Juda mi zousie leh tam kulkotpi a hing lut Jerusalem a tengte zousie aw, Mangpa thu ngaikhie un, chiin gen in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Khawl ni in van gih posih unlen, ahisihleh Jerusalem kulkotpite a zong hing polut lou dingin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawl ni in na innte ua kipat in van gih podoh sih unlen, bangma nna zong sem sihun, napu napate uh kunga ka thupieh bangin Khawlni tang siengthou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun athu amang sih ua, abil u’zong adaw sih uhi, hinanleh angaikhiet louna ding u’leh athuhilnate apomlouna ding un, a ngawng uh akhausah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tualeh ka thu pilvangtah a na ngaikhiet u’leh tambang ahi ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi; Khawlni a tam khopi kulkotpite a, van gih nang puohlut sih ua, tua ni a nna naseplou ua, Khawlni natan siengthou u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David leengtoupha tunga tou leengte leh a uliente utoh tam khopi kulkotpite ah ahing lut ding ua, Amaute leh a Uliente uh, sakollengte leh sakolte tunga tuongin ahing pei ding ua, Juda mite leh Jerusalem a tengten zong ahing zui ding ua, tam khopi kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda khopite leh Jerusalem kim a munte akipat in leh Banjamin gam leh gam ngiem a kipan leh taanggamte a kipan leh, simlam gam a kipan bangin, halmang sillatte leh kithoinate leh ann sillatte leh gimnamtui sillatte leh phatna sillatte Mangpa inn ah ahing tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Khawlni tang siengthou ding leh Jerusalem kulkotpite a, khawlni a van gih popum a lutlou dinga ka thu na manlou u’leh Jerusalem kulkotpite ah phelmit guollou mei ka ka tawkuong dinga, Jerusalem leeng inn huongsung leh a kotpite ka katumsah ding hi,” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa akipat a Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thou inlen, belkhengpa inn ah vahaw suhin, khunah ka thu ka hing zasah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n belkhengpa inn ah kava hawsuh a, aman belkhenna kuol kipei in nna anasem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh tungman a abawl bel khu, belkhengpa khut ah adeibang mel polou in ahing um a, tuachi’n belkhengpan hoi asah bangbangin bel dangkhat in akheng zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aw Israel innkuonte tam belkhengpa bawl banga na tung ua bawl theilou ding ka hiei mah? Mangpa’n achi hi. Ngaiun belkhengpa khut a tungman a um bangin, ka khut ah na um uhi, Aw Israel innkuonte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangchih lai ahiei a, nam ahiei, ahisihleh leenggam ahiei tungtang thu a, bawtdoh ding leh loingiem ding thu kana genta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atunga vauhilna thu ka genna tua nam in agitlouna akiheisan u’leh atung ua ka bawltup silgilou apat ka lungtang ka hei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh nam khat ahiei, leenggam khat poupou tungtang a lamdoh ding leh phutdet ding thu ana gen hita nanleng zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mitmu a, silgilou abawl ua, ka aw angai sih u’leh amauh phattuomna ding a silhoi bawlvang ka chi apat ka lungsim ka kikhelsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin Juda mite leh Jerusalem a tengte kungah thu gen in; Mangpa’n tambang in thu agen hi, Ngai un, na tung uah tuohsietna tunsah ding ka lemguot a, thu ka phiel laitah ahi, noute michin, tuin na umdan hoilou ua kipat in hing kihei unlen, na umdan u’leh na silbawl hoiloute uh bawlpha un, chi’n gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hinanleh amaun phatuom sih! Ka lemguot dan dungzui un umva ungin, michin in ama lungtang ngaituona hoilou bang zelin kabawl ding uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tuin namte lah ah dong madi uale, koiin tambang thu aza ngaita uoi mah? Nungah siengthou Israel in sil chizat huoi pen khat abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon vuaten gamlah a ahing luonsuhna, suong kenlah anuasie ngai a mah? Ahisihleh muoltunga pata hing, luongsuh tuivot kikiehte akang ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka miten Kei ahing manghil tah ziehun, pannabei milimte kungah gimnamtui ahalta ua, tualeh amaun nidanglai lampite azui ua, amauleh amauh akipalpua sah ua, lamlienpi hilou in lam siellou lam ah apeisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Agam uh chizat huoi khop a susegawp ding leh, tawp neilou a enghouna tuohsah dingin; akunga suohkha pouma chiza sengin alu uh athinkhum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sualam huipi bangin amelmate uh masang ah ka thethang dinga, avangsiet ni chieng un ka mai hilou in, ka nualam ka ensah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun, “Hing peiun, Jeremiah tungah silgilou iphiel ding uhi; aziehpen siempu akipat in dan thu amang sih ding a, mipil akipat in thuhilna leh guolneite apat thu amang sih ding hi. Hing pei un ama ilei toh idou ding a, athugente mawngmawng ingaikhietpieh sih ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing ngaikhie inlen, tualeh ahing doute thugen ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Silhoilou khu sil hoi a thuh ding ahiei mah? Aziehpen amaun ka shina dingin kokhuh atou uhi. Ama ua dinga hoina thu gen ding leh ama uapat a na lungthahna heimang dinga na masanga ding ka hi dan thei ngitngetin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin atate uh kiel a shi dingin pekhie inlen, namsau hatna in asisan uh sungbuo in, tualeh azite uh meithai sah inlen, atate uh suun sahin. Tualeh apasalte uh thain um uhenlen, atangvalte uh kidouna mun ah namsau a tha in um uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Atung ua galkap hon thakhat a na tunsah chiengin, ainnte ua kipat in kaa aw ging kiza sah in, aziehpen amaun ka kiehna dingin kokhuh atou ua, tualeh ka keng awhna dingin thang aguhin akam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinapiin Mangpa aw, Kei tha hing sawm a athu dapphielte zousie uh nangman na thei sieng hi, agitlouna uh ngaidam sinlen, na mitmu apat akhelnate uh nuoimang sin, hinanleh amaute na masangah paimangin um uhenlen, amaute nalungthah ni in tuabangin bawl in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Pei inlen belkhengpa leibel khat va lei in, tualeh mipite upate leh siempute lah a upate zawpiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh suolam kulkot lutna kunga um Hinnom tapa guom ah pei inlen, khunah na kunga ka hing gen ding thute va phuongzah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tambangin vagen in: Aw Juda leengte leh Jerusalem a tengten, Mangpa thu ngaikhie un; galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi; Ngaiun, tam mun tungah thakhat thu in tuohsietna ka tungsah dinga, aza pouma bil akhen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun kei ahing taisan ua, tammun pen gamdang pasiente mun asuohsahta uhi; tualeh tam mun ah, amauleh apu apate u’leh Juda leengten zong athei ngailou uh pasien dangte kungah gimnamtui ahal ua, tualeh tam mun khu mawna neilou mite sisan in adimsahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ken amauh thu ka pieh khahlou, gen zong ka genkhah ngai lou, ka lungsim a zong lutkha ngai mawngmawnglou, Baal kunga halmang sillat dinga, atapate uh mei a ahalna dingun Baal mun sangte zong alampieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngai un anite hing tung ahita, Mangpa’n achi hi: tam mun pen Tophet ahisihleh, Hinnom tapa guom akichi nawn sih dinga, hinanleh kithana guom akichi zawta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tam mun a Juda leh Jerusalem sil guotte bangmalou ka suohsah dinga, tualeh amelmate uh masangah namsau leh ahinna uh suite khut ah ka puasah dinga, ashi luongte uh tungleeng vate leh leitunga gamsate ann dingin ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh tam khopi tennalouin ka hawmsuoh sah dinga chizat huoi khop a simmaw in ka bawl dinga akunga suoh kha pouma in akigawtna zousie zieh a chiza sengin a enghou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh amauten atapate u’leh atanute uh sa ka ne sah dinga, tualeh amelmate u’leh ahinna uh suiten amauh a imkhum ua, lunggima chimawna atuoh chiengun michin in alawmpa sa ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuachi’n nang na zawpite mitmu ah na leibel khu na sat keh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh akung uah, galkapte Mangpa’n tambang in agen hi, nachi ding hi. Tambangma in tam mipite leh akhopite nangawn uh, bawlphat kia thei nawnlou dinga, mi’n leibel asatguoi bangin ka suguoi ding hi. Kivuina ding mun awng umlou dongin, amishite uh Tophet ah avui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tambangin tam mun tung leh asunga tengte tungah ka bawl dinga, tam khopi khu Tophet bang ka hisah ding; Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem innte leh Juda leengte innte khu Tophet munbangin ka buasah ding hi, tua inntungte khu vanlam a aasi honte kunga gimnamtui ahalna u’leh pasien dangte kunga dawn sillat asunbuohna mun uh ahi ziehin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah khu Mangpa’n thugen ding a asawlna Tophet mun akipat ahing pei a, Mangpa biehinn tuol ah adinga, mipite zousie kungah thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, tam khopi leh khopi neute zousie tungah sietna ka tungsah ding chia ka gendohsa zousie ka tungsah ding hi, aziehpen ka thugente ngai nuomlou in a ngawng uh akhausah uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Immer tapa, Mangpa inn a houtu lienpen siempu Pashur in Jeremiah in tam genlawhna thute agen chi azata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pashur in Jeremiah avua-a, Mangpa inn kunga um, Benjamin kulkot sahta zaw a kul sungah akoltang sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zing niin Pashur in Jeremiah akoltanna apat in ahing ladohta hi. Tuachi’n Jeremiah in Pashur kungah, “Mangpa’n na min dinga aphuoh Pashur ahisih a, Magor-Missabib ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngai in, nangma ding leh na lawmte zousie adingin mi giinhuoi in ka hing bawl dinga, amauh amelmate uh namsau a apua laitah uh na mit ngel in na mu ding hi; tualeh Juda mi zousie Babilon leengpa khut ah ka pe doh dinga, ama’n amaute Babilon ah apomang dinga, ahisihleh namsau in athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuathamlouin tam khopi hausatna zousie, asepsuo zousie u’leh asil manpha zousie u’leh, Juda leengte gou zousie amelmate khut ah ka pedoh dinga ama un gallah vante bangin atom khawm ding ua, ala ding ua, Babilon ah apawta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh nang Pashur leh na inn sunga tengte zousie saltangin na pei ding ua, Babilon ah na hing tungta dinga, khunah na shi dinga, na kivuidenta ding hi, nang leh thu zuou na genlawhna na lawmte zousie toh, shi in na ki vui ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangman na hing sol a, sol in ka umta hi, Nang kei sangin na hatzaw a, Nang zouta hi. Nichinin nuizabuh ka suohta a, michin in ahing simmaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen thu kagen chiengin, “Ka kikoukhie a thagumsuona leh, manthaina chiin ka tangkoupi hi,” aziehpen Mangpa thu khu kei a dingin nichin in, simmawna leh selphouna ahi zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken “Ama min ka loukha nawn sih dinga, Amin in zong thu ka gen nawn sih ding” ka chi hi. Hinanleh A thu ka lungtang sungah, meikuong bangin akuonga, Ka gute sungah akikhumkha bangmai ahi a, ka thuohzouta sih a, ka um khinkhian theita sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen mi tampi kiguhhou kaza a, aning chin ah zauhuoina a um hi! “Heh unlen, heh khawm chiet vai,” achi ua, Ka meltheite zousie in, “Ka kipalpua ding ngahten sol in hing um vanin, izou ding ua, phuba ila ding uhi,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n mihat zauhuoitah bangin, ahing umpi a, tuaziehin kei hing bawlsete akipal pua ding ua, ahing zousih ding uhi. Nasatah in azum ding ua, alawching sih ding ua, akumtawn zalatna uh manghil in aum ngaisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw galkapte Mangpa, midihte enchienpa leh, lungtang leh lungsim mu pailetpa aw, amaute tunga na phulah hing musah in Ka tungtang thu na kungah ka hing kemsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa kungah la sa unlen, Mangpa phat un; aziehpen silhoilou bawlte khut a kipat in, mi zawng leh tasamte hinna ahundoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pien ni hamsiet in um henlen, ka nu’n ahing hinkhiet ni khu guolzawl in, umsih hen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka pa kunga tapa na neita hi,” chia thu hoi vagen a, ama kipahsahpa khu hamsiet in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua mipa khu Mangpa’n kisia keilou a khopi asuhsiet bang hi henlen, tualeh zingmawng in kaa ging za henlen, sunlai chiengin kikou aw ging za heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman naubu sungah ahing na that sih a, tuahileh ka nu gilsung khu kahaan ahimai ding a, naubu in kumtawn a hing pai ding hi ven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh a, sepgim, lungkhamdana mu ding leh, ka damsung nite zumhuoitah a beisah dinga, naubu apat hing pawtdoh ka hiei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Zedekiah in Melkiah tapa Pashur leh Ma-aseiah tapa siempu Zephaniahte akunga asawl lai a Mangpa akipata Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hepitahin Mangpa hing na dohpieh in; Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar eite dou dingin akisa hi, tuachi’n Mangpa’n anasep lamdangtahte zousie dungzui in ahing panpi in anua peisah kia khamaw diei mah?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in akung uah: Zedekiah kungah tambang na gen ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, Babilon leengpa leh Kaldai mite kulpi pulam a nou hing imkhumte na douna galvan na khut ua na tawite uh, nouma tungah ka le hei ding a, amaute tam khopi laikimtah ah ka kikhawm sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh keima ngel in, lungthahtah leh thangpai pum in ka banzah in, ka banthahattah zangin noute kang dou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam khopi sunga tengte ami asa in ka satlum dinga, natna hipi huoisetah in ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum nua chiengin, Keima’n Juda leengpa Zedekiah leh asuohte leh mipite leh tam khopi sunga hipi apata suohtate leh namsau leh kiel a pat a suohtate khu, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar khut leh amelmate uh khut leh ahinna uh tha tum a suite khut ah ka pedoh dinga, amaute namsau in athat dinga, koima ahinkhawisih dinga, ahepisih dinga, akhotuo vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuin tam mipite kungah Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, nachi ding hi: Ngai un, na masang uah, hinna lampi leh shina lampi a hung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam khopi sunga umte, namsau, kiel leh natna hipi in ashi ding ua, hinanleh taidoh a nou hing bulu Kaldai mite khutsunga kipelut pouma ahing ding ua, ahinna ukhu ama ua dingin kidouna nuomman ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen tam khopi tungah ahoina hilou in asietna dingin, ka mai gum ka ngatzouta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tam khopi Babilon leengpa khutah piehkhiet ahi dinga, aman, mei in ahaltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tualeh Juda leengpa innkuon tungtang thu ah: Mangpa thu ngaikhie un, chi’n gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw David innkuonte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Zingmawng chiengin vaihawmna dihtahin vaihawm unlen, mi bawlgenthei pa khut apat bawlsietna thuohpa hundoh un, tua ahisihleh na silbawlgiloute ziehun, ka lungthahna mei bangin akuongzah dinga, koima phelzou guollou in a kakha ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngai un, nou phaikuoma tengte leh, phaijang suongpi lah a tengte, Eite koiin ang dou thei ding uoi? ikibutna sungah koi ahiei hing lut thei ding? Chite aw, Ken noute hingdou ka hi, chi’n Mangpa’n agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh na silbawl ga dungzui un ka hing gawt dinga, agammang sung lah meiin ka hal kuong dinga, akimvel a sil um zousie akatum sieng ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Juda leengpa inn ah peisuh inlen, khunah tam thu gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David leengtoupha tunga tou, Aw Juda leengpa nang leh na suohte leh tam kulkotpite a lut na mipiten, Mangpa thu ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, vaihawmna dihleh dihtatna bawl unlen, mi bawlgentheipa khut apat bawlsietna thuohpa hundoh un, mikhuolte, paneiloute leh meithaite tungah dihloutah in bawlsih unlen, hiemngamna bawlsih un, ahisihleh tam mun ah mawnaneilou sisan zong suo vawt sihun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen tamte pellou a na bawl u’leh, David leengtoupha tunga touin, sakolleng tung leh sakol tunga tuongin leengte leh asuohte leh amite tam kulkotpite ah alut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh tam thute na ngaikhietsih u’leh, tam leeng innpi ahawm a nuasie in a um ding hi; chi’n keima leh keima ka kichiemta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n Juda leengpa innkuonte kungah tambangin agen hi: “Nang pen kei a dingin Gilead bang na hi a, Lebanon muolvum bang na hi. Hinanleh pellou in gamdai ka hing suohsah dinga, mihing tenlouna khopi bang ka hing hisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma sumang dingin sumang mite, agalvan uh tawichiet ka bawlkhol dinga; amaun na sidar sing hoipen pente uh aphua ding ua, mei khuo ah apai lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tualeh nam tampite tami khopi kungah apei ding ua, michin in ama innvengte chiet kungah, “Bangzieh a Mangpa’n tam khopi thupitah tambanga abawl ata diei?” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun, “Aziehpen amauten Mangpa a Pasian uh thuhun ataisan ua, pasien dangte abie ua, anate asep pieh zieh uh ahi, chiin adawng ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mishisa kaa sih unlen, sun zong suun sih un, hinanleh puimanga umpa adingin hasetah in kap un, ama ahing kinuale kia ngainawn sih dinga, apienna gam mukia nawnlou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Josiah tapa Shallum apa taanga vaihawm, tam muna kipat a peidohta tungtang thu Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi. “Ama pen ahing kinuale ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama sal a apuina mun lam ah ashi dinga, tam gam amu kia ngai nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Dihtatlouna a inn lam a, dihlouna toh a pindante bawl a, asepthaman pelou a a innvengte na semsah mi atung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman inn lienpitah ka lam dinga, indan awngthawltah ka bawl dinga, kottate ka hong dinga, sidar sing ka thuo suoh dinga, lousan ka mu ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sidar singa na ki imkhum zieh a vaihawm a pang ding a, kingaisut na hiei mah? Na pa in ane in adawn a, vaihawmnadih leh dihtatna abawl a, tuakhu ama adingin ahoi hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman mi zawngte leh mitasamte vai ahawm pieh a, tuachi’n ama a dingin ahoi hi. Tua khu kei ahing theina hilou ahiei mah? Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh na mitte leh na lungtang khu, na huoihamna ding leh, bawlgentheina leh thagum suona dingin na nei hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim tungtangah Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ehe! Ka unaupa ahisihleh Ehe! Ka unaunu chiin ama akaa sih ding uhi, Ehe! ka pu aw, ahisihleh Ehe! athupina chiin ama akaa sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem kulpikotte pulam a talkai leh, paidoh a um in sabiltung kivui bangin akivui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lebanon ah hawtou inlen, kapkhie inlen Bashan ah, na aw uh suo in, Abarim apat in kikou in. Nang hing itte zousie suhmang in a um siengta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lawchin laitah in na kungah thu ka gen a, hinanleh nangman ngaikhe sih vang na chi hi. Tam khu khangdawng na hing hi akipat a na umdan ahita a, tuachi’n ka thu na mang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huiin na belampute zousie anegam ding a, tualeh na itte sal a taang dingin apei ding uhi; Tuachi’n na gitlounate ziehin pellou in na zum dinga, na zala ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Lebanon a tenga, sidar singte lah a bu bawlpa natna na tunga, ahing tun chienga numei nauvei naa sa banga na um chiengin, hepihuoi sam va chie maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ka hin laisie, Mangpa’n achi hi: Juda leengpa Jehoiakim tapa Koniah khu ka khut ziet lam suoi namna khutsip hinanleh ka hing sut khe veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh nang pen na hinna suite khut ah leh amel uh mu ding na zaute khut ah tualeh Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar khut leh Kaldai mite khut ah ka hing pelut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n nang leh na pienna na nu, na pienna gam uh hilou gamdang ah ka hing notdoh dinga, khunah na shi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun hing kinuale kia dinga alunggul na gam uah ahing nuakia nawn sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam mi Koniah kichi khu Koima deilou, simmawhuoi kipahna um nawnlou bel kehgawpsa ahiei mah? bangzieh a ama leh ahah asuonte athei ngailou uh gam sena kinei uh ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw Gam, gam aw, gam, Mangpa thu ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Tam mipa ta neilou banga adam sung nite a, lawching ngailou dingin amin giel in. Aziehpen ahah asuonte koima alawching sih dinga, David leengtoupha tungah atou sih dinga, Juda tungah vai ahawm nawn sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka gantatna mun a belamte sumang a, thethang belampute, tung agih hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuazieh in ka mite vahtu belampute tungtang Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Ka belamhonte na thethang ua, na notmang ua, amauh na kem sih uhi, Ngaiun, na silbawl giloute ziehun ka hing gawt ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Keima’n ka ganhon umsunte ka nawmangna gam zousie akipat in ka khawm dinga, ahuong sung uah ka hing puikhawm kia ding hi, tualeh gan chiphatah ahi ding ua, apung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauh vah ding in atung uah belampute ka koi dinga, a zau nawn sih ding ua, ahisihleh alungdong nawn sih ding ua, amanga kimlou zong a um nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ngai un, David dinga bazam dihtah ka tundoh ding, hun hing tung ding ahita, Mangpa’n achi hi; aman leengpa bangin pilvang tahin vai ahawm ding a, gamsung ah thudih leh dihtatna a tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama hun sungin Juda hundam ahi dinga, Israel bittah in ateng ding hi. Ama kihatna min tami ahi ding “MANGPA I DIHTATNA UH”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ngai vawiun, ani hing tung paiding ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi, Izipt gama kipata Israel mite puidohpa Mangpa ahin laisie achinawn sih ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hinanleh mallam gam leh amauh ka delmangna gam zousie akipat Israel innkuonte hahlesuonte puidohpa Mangpa ahin laisie achi zawh hun uh hing tung ding hi; tuachi’n amau gam chiet ah ateng ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zawlneite ziehin ka sungah, ka lungtang akeehgawpa, ka gute akithing a, Mangpa zieh leh a sienthouna thute ziehin, zukham mi bang leh zuin athuzaw mi bang ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen gam sungah angkawmmite adimta, hamsietna ziehin gamsungin asuun a, gamdai mun nuomte agaw siengta, zawlneiten lampi hoilou azui ua, ahatna uh adih sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Aziehpen guolneite leh siempute’n, Pasian khawh asa sih ua, ka inn sung ngel ah agitlouna uh ka mu hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin alampite uh anal ding a, miel lah a delmangin a um ding ua, tuate ah akipalpua ding ua, atung uah sietna ka tungsah dinga, amauh gawtna kum ngei ah, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria guolneite tungah khelna kidah huoi ka mu a, Baal min suongin thu agen ua, ka mi Israelten sil abawlkhiel sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem guolneite lah ah zong sil chizat huoitah ka mu hi, ang akawm ua, zuou thu toh akhosa uhi; silgilou bawlte khut ahatsah ua, tuaziehin koima agitlouna akipat ahing kinuahei nuom sih uhi. Abawn un kei a dingin Sodom bang ahi ua, tualeh asunga tengte Gomorrah bang ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa’n guolneite, tungtang ah tambangin agen hi: “Ngai un ama ute gamsa in ka vah dinga, tuikha ka dawnsah ding hi; aziehpen Jerusalem guolneite akipat in, gamsung pumpi ah Pasian khosahlouna apawtdohta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Guolneiten na kung ua thumavang agente uh ngaikhe sih un, bangmalou ahing suo ua, Mangpa kam a thupawt hilouin, amauh lungtanga angaituote uh agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei hing simmawte kungah thu agen ngitnget ua, muongtah in na um ding uh Mangpa’n achi hi, achi uhi, tualeh mi ama lungtang ngaituona banga, gamta zousie kungah sietna bangma na tung uah, atung sih ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koi ahiei Mangpa thuhilna a, dingkha a athu thei a za kha ngai? A thuchiemte ngaikhe ngai koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai un, Mangpa lungthahna pingpei apawtdohta hi, pingpei huoisetah in migiloute lutang anuoi gawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n alungtanga atupte atangtun kim masangsie in, alungthahna akinuahei kia sih ding a, ni nukhia lam ah bukimtahin na theisiemta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tam guolneite ka sawl hilou napi atai uh a, Amaute kung ah thu ka gen sih a hinanleh, thumavang agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh ka lemguotna a dinga, ka mite ka thu zasah hi u’leh, tuachi’n a umdan giloute u’leh a silbawl hoiloute ua kipat in, amauh akinua heisahta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Nainou khat a um Pasian hi a, gamlapi a um Pasian zong ka hisih amah? Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka mu theilouna dinga, mun guh a kiphuol thei mi a um diei mah? Mangpa’n achi hi. Lei leh van ka dim suoh sih amah? Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mangin ka man hi, chia ka min a zuouthu gen guolneite thugen ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zuouthu gen zawlneite lungtangah, tami bangtan vei um ding ahiei mah? Ahi ama lungtanga kisolthu guolneite bep ahibou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Apu apate un Baal biehna zieh a, ka min amanghil bang ua, michin in ainnvengpa kunga ahil, amang zieha ka mite ka min manghilsah ding ngaituo mite ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Guolnei mang neiin a mang gen henlen, ka thu nei miin ka thu gin umtah in gen heh. Bupawl leh butangin kibahna bang ahiei anei uh? Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka thu meikuong bang hilou amah? Tualeh suongpi satguoi thei sehpi bang hilou ahiei mah? Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngaiun, michin a innvengpa akipata, ka thute guhpieh guolneite khu ka dou ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai un, guolnei kidangnalsah a, Aman achi hi, chi mite khu ka dou ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngai un, mang zuou gen a akung ua hil a, azuou thu u’leh khohsaloutaha ka mite silbawl khielsah guolneite khu ka dou ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi, Hinanleh ken amauh ka sawl sih a, thu ka pesih hi; tuaziehin amaun tam miten aphattuompi sih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tuachi’n tam mipite ahiei, guolneite ahiei, ahisihleh siempute ahiei in na kunga Mangpa puohgih bang ahiei chia ahing doh chiengun, akung uah bang puohgih e? Na chi ding ua, noute hing taisan ding kahi; Mangpa’n achi hi, na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh guolnei ahiei, siempu ahiei, ahisihleh mi koi ahiei in, ‘Mangpa puohgih’ chi aum leh Keima’n tua mipa leh a innkuonte ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Noute michin in na innvengte u’leh na unaupa uh kungah tambangin na gen ding uhi: Mangpa’n bang achi dawn in, Mangpa’n bang agen ei? na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa puohgih na genkha kia nawn sih ding uhi. Aziehpen michin ama thugen khu ama puohgih ahita ding hi, aziehpen nouten Pasian hing, galkapte Mangpa, i Pasian thu na heikawita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Guolneite kungah tambangin na gen ding hi: Mangpa’n nang bang ahing chi dawn ei? tualeh Mangpa’n bang agen ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa puohgih na chikhah pouma u’leh, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Mangpa puohgih na chilou ding uh ahi,” chia ka hing sawl hinapi, “Mangpa puohgih khu chia thute na gentaah ziehin;”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tuaziehin ngai un, Keima ngelngel in noute leh napu napate kunga ka pieh khopi khu ka manghil dinga, ka nuasie ding hi; tualeh ka mitmu akipat ka hing delmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh na tung uah kumtawn simmawna leh zumna beitheilou ka hing tungsah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in Juda leengpa Jehoiakim tapa Jakoniah leh Juda miliente, sing bawlmite leh siakheng mite, Jerusalem apata Babilon a ahing pui tung nua in, Mangpa’n, Mangpa biehinn mai a theipi ga law ni a kikoi ahing ensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Law khat ah theipi hoi mama, theipi min masa bangbang aum a, law dangkhat pen ah theipi ga hoilou, neh theilou khop a sie a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Jeremiah bang na mu ei?” Chi’n ang dong hi. Tualeh ken theipi, “Theipi hoi mama leh ahoilou, ahoilou mama zieh a nehtaah nawnlou khop hiel a hoilou,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Tam mun a kipata Kaldai mite gam a ahoina ding ua ka sawlmang Juda mite lah a sal a puimangte khu tam theipi hoite bangin ka en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hoina dingun atung uah ka mit ka hahsah dinga, tam gam ah ka hing puikia dinga, amaute ka lamtou dinga, ka luoingiem sih dinga, ka phut dinga, ka botdoh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa ka hi chi ahing theina dingun, lungtang ka pe dinga, tuachi’n amauh ka mite ahi ding ua, Kei a Pasian uh ka hi ding hi; aziehpen alungtang zousie utoh ka kunga ahing kinuahei kia dinguh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Theipi hoilou nehtaahlou khop a hoilou bangin, Judate leengpa Zedekiah leh a miliente leh Jerusalem a thamden a, tam gam a umden nalaite leh Izipt gam a umte ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute leitung leenggam zousie a dingin chizat huoi in ka siem dinga, ka delkhietna mun chinteng ah, simmaw, paunah, enghou leh hamsiet a um dingin ka pekhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh amau’leh apu apate uh kunga ka pieh gam apat a suhmang a aum masangsie uh alah uah, namsau, kiel leh hipi ka sawl ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim leenga apan kum li na a Juda mite zousie tungtanga Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung hi (tua hun khu Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar leenga apan kum khatna ahi.),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua thu khu guolnei Jeremiah in Juda mite zousie kung leh Jerusalem a tengte zousie kunga agen khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Juda leengpa Amon tapa Josiah vaihawm kum sawm leh thumna apat tuni tandong in kum sawmni leh kumthum sung Mangpa thu ka kung ah ahing tung ngitnget hi, tualeh zingmawng matah a thou in na kung uah ka gen leng hi; hinanleh na ngaikhe nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa’n asuoh guolneite zingmawng matah a thou in na kung uah ahing sawl a, hinanleh na ngaikhe nuom sih ua, aza dingin na bil u’zong na daw ut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaun tuin michin na umdan hoiloute u’leh na silbawl giloute ua pat in kisia unlen, Mangpa’n noute leh na pu napate uh kunga kumtawn kumtawn a ding a, ahing piehna gam ah teng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ana uh seppieh ding leh be dingin pasien dangte nuazui sihun, na khut nasepte un hing sulungthah sih unlen, tuachi’n ka hing suna sih ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinapiin, na sietna dingun, na khut nasepte ua, kei na hing lungthah sah theina dingun, ka thu na ngaikhe nuom sih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi ka thu na ngaikhieh lou ziehun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngaiun, mallam a um nam zousie leh ka suohpa Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar ka han dinga, tam gam leh asunga tengte leh akim apam a namte zousie ka dou sah ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Amaute ka sumang kilkel dinga, tualeh amaute mite chizat, enghou leh akhang akhanga segawp dingin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuathamlou in ama ua pat in, lungnopna leh kipahna aw gingte, mouneipa awte, mounu awte leh ann suh thawmgingte leh thaumei vahte ka lamang sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tam gam pumpi gamsie asuoh dinga, mite chizatna ahita ding hi, tualeh tami namten Babilon leengpa nna kum sawm sagi sung aseppieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n tambang ahing hi ding a, kum sawmsagi abei chiengin, Babilon leengpa leh tua nam leh Kaldai mite gam agitlouna ziehun ka gawt dinga, gamsie ka suohsah den ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua gam tunga tung ding a ka phuondoh ka thute zousie, Jeremiah in nam zousie tunga tung dinga ana genlawhsa, tam laibu a kigielte zousie khu ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nam tampite leh leeng thupitahten alah ua adeidei uh suoh leh sal dingin akitel ding ua, asilbawl dan u’leh akhut nasep dan dungzui un ka thuhkia ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israelte Mangpa Pasian in ka kungah tambang in agen hi: “Tam lungthahna zu nou khu ka khut apat in la inlen, akung ua ka hing sawlna nam zousiete dawn sahin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaun adawn ding ua, ahawi vadong ding ua, alah ua ka sawl ding namsau ziehin amodoh ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa khut apat in nou khu ka la a, Mangpa’n ahing sawlna nam zousiete ka dawn sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuate khu Jerusalem leh Juda khopite, aleengte u’leh a miliente uh segawp sienga, chizat huoi a enghounate, hamsietnate tang dingin, tunia a umdan bangun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Izipt leengpa Pharaoh leh asuohte leh amiliente leh amipite zousie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />nam kitohpol zousie, Uz gam a leengte zousie, Philistin gam a leengte zousie (Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron leh Ashdod a um leengte).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom, Moab leh Ammon mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tai-ar leengte zousie, Sidon leengte zousie leh Tuipi gal a, tuipi panggam a leengte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dedan, Tema leh Buz tualeh gam ningkawi tawpa umte zousie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arabia leengte zousie leh gamdai-gamgaw a teng nam kitohpolte leengte zousie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zimri leengte zousie leh Elam leengte zousie tualeh Medes leengte zousie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />mallam leengte zousie agamla leh anai a umte leh leitung maikai a um leitung leenggam zousie in aban ban in adawn ding ua, tua zou chiengin Sheshak leengpa’n zong adawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tuaziehin akung uah, galkapte Mangpa Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, na chi ding uhi: Na lah ua ka hing sawl ding namsau ziehin, dawn unlen, kham unlen, luo unlen, pua unlen, thoukia nawn sihun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tualeh tambang ahi ding hi: Na khut a nou dawn dinga alah nuom sih u’leh, akung uah galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: na dawn ngeingei ding uhi, achi hi, na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ngai un, Ka min puo khopi tungah sietna tunsah kipan ding ka hita a, noute maw gawtlou a na um ding uh? gawtlou in na um vawt sih ding uhi; aziehpen leitunga tengte zousie a dingin, namsau han ding ka hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tuaziehin atung uah tam thute gen inlen, akung uah hichi in chi in: Mangpa khu tunglam mun sang akipat ahawh ding a, tualeh a tenna mun siengthou akipat, in aw ngaitahin thu agen ding hi; ahuong tungah huoisetah in ahawh dinga, Grep chilte bangin akikou dinga, leitunga tengte zousie douin, akikou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Leimawng tawp dong thawmging in athawn dinga, Mangpa’n namte adou a, tahsa zousie tungah vai ahawm ding, Aman migiloute namsau kungah ape ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi Ngaiun, tuohsietna nam khat apat nam dang kungah atung ding, pingpei thupitah lei mawng gamla pen a kipat in ahing kipandoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin Mangpa mihatten, leitawpmong akipat in leitawpmong, langkhat tan adapsuoh ding hi; Koiman akaa sih ding ua, Koiman akhawm khawm sih ding ua, vui zong akivui sih ding ua, lei lah ah deimaw paiin akipai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Nou belampute mau unlen kap un, vut lah ah kilawm lie un, Nou belamhon lamkaite, tha a na umna ni ding u’leh, na kithethangna ding nite uh hing tung tahtah ding ahita; noute bel deihuoi bangin na pua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh belamputen taina ding lampi anei sih ding ua, belam honte lamkaiten suotatna lampi anei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Belampute kaa aw ging leh belamhonte lamkaite mauna akiza hi, Mangpa’n agantatna munte uh asuhsiet pieh taah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mangpa thangpaina zauhuoitah ziehin, hamuongtaha tenna munte, susiet in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Aman humpibahnei bangin akibutna mun anuasieta hi, kibawlgentheina zauhuoitah zieh leh, alungthahna zauhuoitah ziehin agam uh asegawpta hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim leenga apan chiil laiin, Mangpa akipat tam thute ahingtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Mangpa innhuong sungah ding inlen, Mangpa inna Pasian be dinga hing pei Juda khopi zousie kungah thu gen inlen, akung ua na gen dinga kang thupieh pouma tengkhat zong imlouin gen siengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Michin in a umdan gilou uh peisan in angaikhe kha maw sih ding uhi, tuachi’n asilbawl uh hoiloute zieha, atung ua sietna bawl ka tup khu ka kideh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh akung uah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Nang ngaikhieh sih ua, na masang ua ka koi ka dan thute na zui sih u’leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />na kung ua zingmawng matah a thou a, ka hing sawl ka suoh guolneite thu, ngaikhe dinga ka gen na ngaikhieh sih u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuachi’n tam inn khu Shiloh bangin ka bawl dinga, tam khopi pen leitung nam zousie a dinga hamsiet in ka bawl ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi,” chiin gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempute, guolneite leh mipite zousie in, Jeremiah in tam thute Mangpa inn a agen aza uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin Jeremiah in mipite zousie kunga, gen dinga Mangpa’n thu apieh zousie agen sieng nuain siempute, guolneite leh mipi zousie in ama aman ua, “Na shi ngeingei ding ahi achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh a tami inn Shiloh bang in aum dinga, tualeh tam khopi sunga teng ding umlou in asegawp ding hi, chia Mangpa min a thu mavang nagen ahiei mah?” achi uhi. Mipi zousie Mangpa inn sungah akikhawm ua, Jeremiah a imtawm va luoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda milienten tam thute azahtah un, leengpa inn akipat in Mangpa inn ah ahing peitou ua, Mangpa inn lutna kotpi tha ah atouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempute leh guolneiten, miliente leh mipi zousiete kungah, “Tam mipa shitah ahi, aziehpen na bil ngel ua na zah chiet ma bangun tami khopi sietna ding thu agen hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in miliente leh mipite zousie kungah, “Mangpa’n tam inn sietna ding leh tam khopi sietna dinga na thuzahte zousie uh gen dinga kei ahing sawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin na umdante u’leh na sil bawlte uh siempha unlen Mangpa na Pasian uh thu mangun, tuachi’n Mangpa’n na tung ua sietna hing tung ding a aphuondohsa akikhelsah thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei ka hileh na khut ua um ka hi, hoi nasah bang u’leh na dei dandan un, hing bawl mai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh na hing tha u’leh mawnaneilou sisan maw nouma ngelngel tung leh, tam khopi tung leh asunga tengte zousie tungah na tusah ding uhi, chi chientah in thei un, adihtah in Mangpa’n kei tam thute na kung ua gen dinga ahing sawl ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n miliente leh mipite zousie in, siempute leh guolneite kungah, “Tam mipa shitah ahisih; Mangpa i Pasian uh min a, ikung ua thu agen ahi bou hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamsunga upa koi ahiei a dingdoh a mipi kikhawmte zousie kungah thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Moresheth mi Mikah in Juda leengpa Hezekiah damlai in thumavang ana gen a, Juda mipite zousie kungah, galkapte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin thu agen hi: Zion lou bangin akikai dinga, Jerusalem khu silsie kisekhawm bang ahidinga, tualeh abiehinn muol khu gammang munsang bangmai ahi ding chiin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda leengpa Hezekiah leh Juda mipite zousie in ama athat ngel uoi mah? Aman Mangpa giing lou a, Mangpa deisahna ngenlou amah? Tualeh Mangpa’n amaute tunga sietna atun sah dinga aphuonsa khu akikhelsah sih amah? Hinanleh eiten itung uah sil hoilou thupitah itun sah ding uh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu in midang khat Mangpa min a thugen, Kiriath-Jearim mi Shemaiah tapa Urijah a um a, aman zong Jeremiah thugen zousie bangin tam gam leh khopi siet ding thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lengpa Jehoiakim leh amihatte leh a miliente zousie in athugen azahtah un tha atum uh a, hinanleh Urijah in tam thu azahtah in azauta, ataimanga Izipt gam ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Jehoiakim in Izipt ah mi asawl a, Akbor tapa Elnathan leh midangte Izipt ah asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Urijah Izipt apat in ahing zopi ua, leengpa Jehoiakim kungah ahing tut uhi, aman anamsau in asatlum a, aluong khu mi maimaite han ah apailut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahivang in Shaphan tapa Ahikam in Jeremiah apanpi a, mipite khut ah thalup dingin apekhe sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim leenga apan chiillai in Mangpa akipat Jeremiah kung thu ahing tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n ka kungah tambangin agen hi: “Nouma a dingin khau leh hahkolte kibawl unlen, tuate na ngawng uah baat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuate khu Edom leengpa kungah, Moab leengpa kungah, Amon leengpa leh Tai-ar leengpa leh Sidon leengpa kungah, Jerusalem a leengpa Zedekiah kunga hing haw thupote khut ah hahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Apute uh kunga thu gen dingin amauh thu pie inlen, galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: na pute uh kungah tambang in na gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka silbawltheina thupitah leh kabanzahin, leitung leh mihing leh sate ka siem a, piehtaah ka sahte kungah ka pezel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tuin tam gamte zousie Babilon leengpa ka suohpa Nebukadnezzar kungah ka pekheta a, gam lah a sate na ngawn zong ama nasep pieh dingin ka peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama gam gawtna hun ahing tun masangsie in nam zousie in ama leh atapa leh atupa nna aseppieh ding ua, tuazou chiengin nam tampite leh leeng thupitahtah ten ama suoh in abawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tualeh tambang hing hivan in: Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar nna seppieh nuomlou leh Babilon leengpa hahkol paw nuomlou nam leh leengpa pouma keiman namsau in, kiel in, tualeh natna hipi in, ama khut zanga ka thagam masangsie’n ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Babilon leengpa nna sem sihun, hing chi, na guolneite uh, na aisansiemte uh, na mangsante uh, na mitphieldawisiemte uh ahiei ahisihleh na dawithusiemte uh ahiei thu na ngaikhieh lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun na gam ua kipat gamlatah a ahing kisuonmangna ding leh ka hing delmang theina dingin na kung uah zuouthu agenlawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh nam khat poupou in Babilon leengpa hahkol nuoi a, angawng a guonlut a, ana aseppieh leh tuabang nam khu amauh gam ah ka um sah dinga, agam uh ahou ding ua, asungah ka tengsah ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda leengpa Zedekiah kungah zong tam thute zousie dungzui in “Babilon leengpa hahkol nuoi ah na ngawng lutsah inlen, ama leh amite nna seppieh mai inlen, hingin, kana chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieha, nang leh na mite namsau a, kiel a, tualeh natna hipi a, Babilon leengpa nasem nuomlou namte tungtanga Mangpa’n agensa banga shi ding na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kung ua Babilon leengpa nna nasep piehlou ding uh ahi, chi a guolneite thugen ngaisah sih un, aziehpen amaun na kung uah zuouthu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen ken amauh ka sawl sih, Mangpa’n achi hi; hinapiin noute ka hing delmang a nou leh na kung ua zuou thugen na guolneite uh na manthai theina ding un amaun ka min in zuou thu agen uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ken siempute kung leh mipite zousie kungah zong ka gen a, “Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: na kung ua, ngaiun, Mangpa inn a, bel leh kuongte tomkhat zou chiengin Babilon apat ahing nua puoh kia paita ding uhi, chi a guolneite thugen ngaisah sih un, amaun na kung ua zuou agen uh ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thugen uh ngaikhesih unlen, Babilon leengpa nna sem unlen, hing un, bangzieha tam khopi suhsiet a um ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaute guolnei ahi ua, Mangpa thu akung ua um ahileh, Mangpa inn leh Juda leengpa inn tualeh Jerusalema nuasie a um bel leh kuongte Babilon a kipomang lou dingin galkapte Mangpa kungah ngetna bawl uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa’n khuompite tungtang tuikuong tungtang, khuom kingahna tungtang leh tam khopi a um nalai bel leh kuong umsunte tungtangah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in Juda leengpa tapa Jekoniah leh Juda leh Jerusalem a, miliente zousie, Jerusalem apat Babilon a apuimang lai a, alahloute tungtang ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, Israelte Pasian, galkapte Mangpa’n, Mangpa inn leh Juda leengpa inn leh Jerusalema um nalai, bel leh kuongte tungtang ah, tambangin agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babilon langah ka pomang sieng dinga, amauh ka hing nua kan kia masangsie in, khunah a um den tadi ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tuachi’n amauh ka hing zawpi kia dinga tam mun ah ka koikia ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh khumi kum main, Juda leengpa Zedekiah leenga apan chiillai, akum lina, aha ngana ah Gibeon a um Azur tapa guolnei Hananiah in Mangpa inn a siempute leh mipite zousie mai ah, ka kungah thu tambangin agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israelte Pasian, galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin thu agen hi: Keima’n Babilon leengpa hahkol ka tawngsan sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in, Mangpa inn a bel leh kuong tam mun akipat a apuohmanga Babilon a atutte zousie kum ni sungin tam mun ka hing tut sieng kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda leengpa Jehoiakim tapa Jekoniah leh Juda gam akipata saltang ding Babilon a kipui mangte zousie tam mun ah ka hing tut kia ding hi, aziehpen Babilon leengpa hahkol suhtawng pieh ding ka hi, Mangpa’n achi hi,” chiin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Jeremiah in, siempute mai ah leh Mangpa inn a ding mipite mai ah, guolnei Hananiah kungah thu agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Guolnei Jeremiah in, “Amen, tuabangin Mangpa’n bawl heh, Mangpa inn a bel leh kuongte leh suoh leh sal a kikaimang zousiete Babilon apat in tam mun a hing puitung kia dinga na genlawh bangin Mangpa’n sutangtung ta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivang in tuin nangma zah leh mipite zousie zah a ka thugen khu ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nidang lai a Kei leh nang masanga guolnei na um masaten gam tampite tung leh leenggam thupite tungah, kidounate, sietnate, leh natpi hite tunding ana gen zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hamuonna thugenlawh guol nei khu, agenlawh thute ahing tangtun chiengin, guolneipa khu Mangpa sawl dihtah ahina chi akithei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Hananiah in guolnei Jeremiah ngawng apat hahkol alakhie a ahiehtawngta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Hananiahin mipi zousiete masangah thu agen a, “Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tambangma in Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar hahkol khu nam zousiete ngawng apat in kum ni sungin ka hiehtawng ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh guolnei Jeremiah apeimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Hananiah in guolnei Jeremiah ngawnga pat hahkol ahiehtan nua sawtlou in Jeremiah kungah Mangpa thu ahing tung hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pei inlen, Hananiah vahil in, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; Nang sing hahkolte na hiehtawngta a, hinanleh tuami taangin sia hahkol na bawlpieh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar nna aseppieh theina dingun, tam namte zousie ngawng ah sia hahkol ka baat piehta hi; tuachi’n amaun ana aseppieh ding ua, tualeh keiman gam lah a gamsate nangawn zong ama ka peta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Jeremiah in guolnei Hananiah kungah, “Tuin ngaiin, Hananiah, Mangpa’n nang ahing sawl sih hi; hinanleh tam mipite zuou thu na tahsangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; Ngaiin, leitung apat in ka hing deldoh ding a, tukum mama in na shi ding hi, Nangman Mangpa tunga heldan na hiltaah ziehin achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n khumi kum mama a ha sagina ah guolnei Hananiah ashita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin tamte guolnei Jeremiah in, Jerusalem akipata sal a puimanga um upate, kung leh siempute, guolneite leh Nabukadnezzar in Jerusalem akipat a Babilon a apuimang mipite zousie kunga alaihah a agen thute ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam pen leengpa Jekoniah leh leengpa nu leh michilgete, Juda leh Jerusalem miliente, singbawlsiemte leh siakheng mite Jerusalem apat puimanga a um nua uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua laihahpen, Shaphan tapa Elasah leh Hilkiah tapa Gamariah khut ah aposah hi. Juda leengpa Zedekiah in amaute Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar kunga asawl ahi. Tua laihah ah tambangin akigiel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in, Jerusalem apat a Babilon a sal a puimanga, ka umsahte kungah tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Innte lam unlen, khunah teng khinkhian un, huonte bawl unlen, aga kineh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zite nei unlen, tapate leh tanute nei unlen, na tapate uh zi ding lah pieh unlen, na tanute uh pasal neisah un, tua chia, tapate leh tanute anei theina ding u’leh na kiemlou ua, na pun deudeu na dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh sala ka hing puimangsahna khopi hoina ding sui unlen, tuami adingin Mangpa kungah thu nget pieh unlen, aziehpen tua khopi hamuonna ah, nou zong hamuonna na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa, Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: na lah ua um guolneite leh aisansiemte solzou in um sih unlen, mangsante mang zong gingta sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaun ka min in na kung uah zuou thu agen uhi. Ken amauh ka sawl sih hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Babilon a sal tanna kum sawmsagi achin zou chiengin, ka hing ve dinga, tam mun ah noute ka hing kinuale sah kia ding a, na kung ua ka thuchiemsa khu ka subukim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen noute a dinga ka lungsim geldan ka theizinga, na hun hing tung dingte uah kinepna pe ding, hoilouna ding hilou in na hamuonna ding uh ka ngaituo hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n kei nang han ding ua, tualeh na pei ding ua, ka kungah na thum ding ua, ka hing ngaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh nang sui ding ua, na lungtang zousie ua na hing sui chiengun nang mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei noute mu in ka umta ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, Ken nasal tanna ua kipat in kang nua pui kia ding hi; Ken noute nam zousie akipat leh, ka hing deldohna mun zousie akipat in, ka hing khawm kia ding a, tualeh sal a ka hing puimangsahna mun ngei ah, ka hing puilut kia ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nouten Babilon gam ah zong, Mangpa’n guolneite ahing tundoh pieh hi, na chitah ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa’n David leengtoupha tunga tou leengpa tungtang leh, tam khopi sunga tengte zousie leh, noute toh sal a puimanglou na sanggamte uh, tungtangah tambangin agen hi, chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngaiun, atung uah namsau leh kiel leh natpi hi, ka sawl dinga, amuot seng tah zieh a, neh theilou khop asie theipite bangin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh amaute namsau leh kiel leh hipi toh ka nuadel dinga, leitung leenggam zousie a dinga zauhuoi leh ka deldohna namte lah ah hamsiet leh chizat huoi, simmaw leh enghou dingin ka pekhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen ka thu angaikhe nuom sih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi, ka suoh guolneite zingmawng matah a thou a, akung ua ka sawlten agen uh ka thute angai nuom sih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jerusalem apata, Babilon a kang sawlmang saltang zousiete’n, Mangpa thu ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in, Kolaiah tapa Ahab leh Ma-aseiah tapa Zedekiah, ka min suonga na kung ua, zuou thugente tungtang tambangin agen hi. Ngai un, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar khut ah amaute ka pekhe dinga, ama’n na mitmu uah a maute athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaute zieh in Babilon a um Juda saltang zousie in, Babilon leengpa’n meia a em Zedekiah leh Ahab bangin, “Mangpa’n nang zong hing bawl heh, chiin hamselawna paunah in azang uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun Israel gam sungah sil mot huoi abawlta ua, a innvengte uh zite toh angkawmna abawl ua, amauh thu kapieh loupi ka min in zuou thute agen uhi. Keima ngeiin ka thei a, theipitu ka hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nehelam mi Shemaiah kungah zong tambangin nagen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Nangman na min in Jerusalem a um mi zousie kung leh siempu Ma-aseiah tapa Zephaniah kung leh siempute zousie kungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mimo guolnei kichi pouma suongkul a khum ding leh kolbul dinga, Mangpa inn a houtu a pang dingin, Mangpa’n nang Jehoiada taangin siempuin ahing pangsahta hi, chiin lai na hahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin bangdinga noute lah a, guolnei a kibawl Anathoth mi Jeremiah phawhthop lou na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen ama’n “Saltan hunsung sawt ding ahi; innte kilam unlen teng un, tualeh huonte bawl unlen, agate kineh un chi’n Babilon a um eite kungah lai ahing hah hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh siempu Zephaniah in tam laihah khu, guolnei Jeremiah zahin asim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu khu Jeremiah kungah ahing tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Saltangte zousie kungah hah inlen, Nehelam mi Shemaiah tungtang thu ah Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ka sawlloupi a, Shemai in na kung ua thu agen zuou thu ahing tahsansah ziehin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngaiun, Nehelam mi Shemaiah leh ainnkuonte ka gawt dinga; tam mite lah a teng ding mi anei sih dinga, ka mite dinga ka bawl pieh ding silhoi zong amu sih ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi; aziehpen aman Mangpa tunga helna thu ahilta hi,” chiin laihah in achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa akipat a Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin thu agen hi: Na kunga ka thugente zousie laibu khat ah giel in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen ngaiun ka mi Israelte leh Juda saltangte ka puikiana ding nite ahing tung ding ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tualeh Keima’n apu apate uh kunga ka pieh gam ah ka kinuale sah dinga, aluota ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Israelte leh Judate tungtanga athugente khu tamte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, muonna hilou a, chitutna zauna thawmging kaza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin dong unlen, en un, pasal in nau avei ngai amah? Bangzieh a numei nauvei banga pasal chintengin, akawng ua akhut uh akoi ua, amaite uh daang gawp sienga ka mu ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kasai! tua ni thupi hina mai e, akibatpi mawngmawng a um sih hi, tuakhu Jakob mangbat hun ahi, hinanleh ama pen tuate lah akipat hundam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Aziehpen khum ni chiengin tambang ahi ding, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi; angawng ua pat hahkol ka hieh tawng ding a, na kolbu uh ka tawngsah ding a, gamdang miten amauh suoh leh sal in akhawi nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun Mangpa a Pasian u’leh amaute leeng dinga ka tun ding aleengpa uh David nna asep pieh zota ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuaziehin aw ka suohpa Jakob zausin, aw Israel lungke vawt sin, Mangpa’n achi hi; aziehpen Ngaiun, ken gamlapi akipat nang leh na chi hahte asaltaanna gam ua kipat in ka hundam ding hi. Jakob ahing kinuale kia ding a, akhawldam ding a, a um khinkhian ding hi, koiman a zausah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen nang hing hundam dingin, na kung ah ka hing umpi hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Ka hing thethang na namte zousie subei sieng nanleng, nang pen ka hing subei kilkel sih ding hi; dihna toh nang ka hing sudih ding a, gawtlou in ka hing koi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Na liemna suhdam theiguol ahisih a, na kisuhliemna khu anase sengseng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tungtang thu gen ding mi koima a um sih a, na damna ding, damdawi a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na it na ngaite zousie’n ang manghil siengta ua, nang ang sui nawn sih uhi, melma satliem bangin ka hing liemsahta a, na gitlouna atam seng ziehin, mi gilou gawt bangin ka hing gawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangdinga na gimthuoh zieh a kap na hiei? Na gitlouna tampite ziehin na dana pha ding guol ahisih hi; na khelnate apun deu deu ziehin, tam silte na tungah ka bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuazieh in nang hing negam zousie nehgam in a um ding ua, tualeh na melmate zousie sal a puimang ahi ding uhi; tualeh nang hing bulute zousie bulu in a um ding ua, gallah a hing late zousie gallah dingin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen keiman damtheina ka hing pekia ding a, na liemnate ka damsah ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, amaun tami delmang a um Zion ahia, Koiman asuikia nawn sih ding hi, achi ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngai vawi, Jakob puon inn saltangte khu, ka hing nua puikia dinga, atenna munte uah khotuona ka nei ding hi; Khopi khu a umna muol ngaingai ah akilam dinga, leengpa inn zong a umna mun gaima ma ah a um kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute akipat in kipah thugenna leh, lungnopna thawmgingte ahing pawtkhe ding hi; amauh ka pungsah dinga, ka kiemsah sih ding hi, amauh ka pahtawi dinga, aneu vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tate uzong nidang lai bangin a um ding ua, ka masanga akikhopnate uh suhdet ahita dinga, amauh sugentheite keiman ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Alamkaite uh amau’lah a mi ngeingei ahita dinga, avaihawm mite uh khu amau’lah a hing pawtdoh ahi ding uhi, tuachi’n amaute ka kinai sah dinga, aman kei ahing zuon ding hi, aziehpen ama thu a kei hing zuon dinga, alungtanga kichiemngam koi ahiei? Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Noute ka mite na hi ding ua, Kei na Pasian uh ka hi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />En un, Mangpa pingpei khu thangpaina toh apawtkhie hi, pingpei tawplou khu; migiloute lutung huoisetah in anuoi gawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mangpa lungthahna zauhuoitah khu alungtanga atupte abawl bukim masangsie’n akinuale sih ding hi. Ni nukhia lam chiengin tamte na hing theisiem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tua hun chiengin Israel innkuonte zousie Pasian ka hi dinga, amauh ka mite ahi ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Namsau a tha mawhmiten gamdai ah khotuona amu uh, Israel kunga khawldamna pe dinga ka pei laiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nidang lai a ka kunga Mangpa hing kilang in, tangtawn itna in nang ka hing itta a, tuaziehin lainatna toh nang ka hing nua pui kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hing tungding kia dinga, tundingin na um ding hi, Aw nungah siengthou Israel, khuongta toh na kizem kia dinga, nopbawlna lamna mun ah na telta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria muol dung ah grep huon na bawlta dinga, asuon miten asuon ding ua, agate nuomtah in a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ephraim taang gama vengmiten, thou un, Zion ah Mangpa i Pasian kung uah ipeitou ding uh, chi a, akikou ni uh hing um ding ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Jakob a dingin nuomin lasa unlen, namte lah a thupipen a dingin kikou un, phuongzah unlen, phat un, Aw Mangpa na mi Israel umsunte khu hundam in, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai un amauh mallam gam akipat ka hing pui dinga, kawlmong tawp akipat in ka puikhawm dinga, amau’lah ah mittote, kengbaite, numei naupaite leh numei nauvei chiilte, toh ka hing puikhawm dinga, mipi tampi hing kinualete ahing tung khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kap kawm in ahing pei ding ua, lungmuong tahin ka pui tung ding, luitui luonna langah ka peisah dinga, akipalpua louna ding uh lampi tangtah ah, ka peisah ding hi, aziehpen Kei Israel pa ka hi a, tualeh Ephraim ka ta masa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nou namte aw Mangpa thu ngaikhie unlen, gamlapi a um tuipi panga gamte ah phuongzah un, Israel thethangpa’n amauh apuikhawm kia ding a, belampu in abelamhonte aven bangin aveng ding hi, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n Jakob atandohta a, ama sanga hatzawte khut akipat atandohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute Zion muol vum ah lasa kawm in, ahing pei ding ua, Mangpa hoina ziehin akipah ding uh a, bute, uointe, sathaute, Belamte leh gan guol noute tungah zong akipah ding uhi; ahinna uh khu huon tui kibuoh nom bang ahi dinga, kumtawn in alungkham nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n nungah siengthoute khu nuom in alam ding ua, tangvalte leh tehsete zong akipah khawm ding uhi; aziehpen alusun liengvainate uh, nopna ka suohsah ding a ka hamuon ding hi, alungkhamna ua pat ka kipahsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siempute hinna khu kiningchinna toh ka taisah ding a, ka hoina ziehin ka mite zong atai ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ramah khuo ah aw ging akiza hi mishi ngai a, kaa leh mau husa ahi a, Rachel in atate akaa a, atate a um nawnlou ziehin henem thei ahi sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Kaplou dingin na aw kideh inlen, na hitui luong sah sin, Mangpa’n achi hi, amaute melma gam akipat in ahing peikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hun hing tung dingte ah kinepna aum hi, na tate agam uah ahing peikia ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ephraim in “Nangman nang phawhhil a, bawngtal lah nailou bangin phawhhil in ka um ta hi. Hing siemtha in Kang kinuahei ding hi, Nang ka Pasian na hi ziehin. Chia akaana ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahing kiheisah nua in, ka kisia a, thuhil a ka um nua in ka pheipi ka beenga, ka zumta a, ka khangdawn lai minsietna ka thuoh ziehin, ka amgawp hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ephraim ka tapa deitah ahiei? Ka ngainat ka ta ahiei? Ken ama demin thugen ma nanleng, ka lung sungah kagel chinten hi; tuaziehin ka lungtangin ama ka lunggul a, pellou in ama ka khotuo ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Lampi chiemtenate bawl inlen, Lampi kohmunate phut in na peina lamlienpi na lungtangin chiemte hoi inlen, Aw Israel nungah siengthou, hing kile kia in, na khopite ah hing kile kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangtan vei vahthap ding na hiei, Aw nang tanu nuatol? Mangpa’n leitungah sil tha khat abawlta hi; numei in pasal ahun zota ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambang in agen hi: “Asaltaangte uh ka nuapui kia chiengin, Juda gam leh akhopite uah, tam kamham azang kia ding uhi; Aw dihna umna leh siengthouna muol! Mangpa’n hing guolzawlta hen, chi khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh khunah Judate leh akhopi zousie uah lounei mite leh belam ching mite atengkhawm ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen mi basamte ka halsah dinga, lungkhamte zong ka taisahta ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuazouin ka khanglouta a, Ka en kimvel a, ka imut atuita mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ngai un, Israel innkuonte leh Juda innkuonte ah mihing chi leh ganta chi ka tuna nite hing tung ding ahita, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hiding, amaute botdoh ding, suguoi ding, paikhe ding, suse ding leh suna ding ka ven bangin amaute tungding ding leh phut kia dingin, ka vengding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua nite ang tun chiengin amaun: Pate’n grep thua ane ua, tate ha aza hi, achi ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuanahsangin michin in ama khelna ashipi dinga, grep thua ne pouma ama ha mama aza ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ngai un, Israel innkuonte leh Juda innkuonte toh thuhun tha ka bawl nite hing tung ding ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Apu apate uh Izipt gam akipat a puidoh dinga akhut ua ka tuh lai a, amautoh ka bawl thuhun bang hilouin, ama ua dinga apasal uh hinapi inga, amaun tua thuhun abotseta uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh tua nite zou chienga Israel innkuonte toh ka bawl ding thuhun khu tami ahi ding hi; Mangpa’n achi hi; Amaute lungsim sunggil lam ah ka dan thu ka koi dinga, alungtang uah ka giel ding hi, tualeh a Pasian uh ka hi dinga, amauh ka mite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Koima’n ainnvengpa kungah tualeh michinin aunaupa kungah, Mangpa theiin, chi’n ahil nawn sih ding uhi; aneupen akipat alienpen tan in kei ahing thei chiet ding uhi, aziehpen agitlouna uh ka ngaidamta dinga, akhelnate uh ka thei ngitnget nawn sih ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mangpa’n sun a vahsah dinga ni pepa, ha leh aasite dinga dante guot pieh a zan a taang dinga thu pepa leh tui kinawhte ging he hu dinga tuipite tohthoupa’n tambangin agen hi, Amin khu galkapte Mangpa ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tam dan thupiehte ka masang a pat a abeimang vawt tahleh, tuachiengin ka masang akipat Israel hahlesuonte nam khat ahina uh abei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Tunglam van khu tethei ahi a, nuoilam leitung kingahna suidohguol ahileh, ken zong Israel suonte zousie asil bawlsate zousiezieh un, ka paimang ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“En un, anite hing tung ding ahita! Hananeel innsang akipat kulpi ninglam kotpi dongin, Mangpa dingin khopi akilam tha ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Atena khau khu Gareb muol dongin tangtah in akizan dinga, Goath lam ah akihei suh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh mishi luong paina guom leh vut kipaina muol pumpi leh gamlah zousie, Kidron luita guom tan dong; nisuona lam ah sakol kulkotpi ning tan dong, Mangpa a ding a siengthou ahi ding hi. Tua khu kumtawn in bawdoh leh paidoh ahi nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Zedekiah leenga apan kum sawmna, tuakhu Nebukadnezzar vaihawmna kum sawm le giet achin kum in, Mangpa akipat Jeremiah kungah thu ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen tua hunlaiin, Babilon leengpa galkapten Jerusalem ahing sim ua, tualeh guolnei Jeremiah khu Juda leengpa inn huongsung suongkul ah akikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda leengpa Zedekiah in ama suongkul ah akhum a, hichiin achi hi: “Bangzieh a, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngai vawi, Babilon leengpa khut ah tam khopi ka pe dinga, aman ala ding hi, chia thu na genlawh ahiei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Juda leengpa Zedekiah zong Kaldai mite khut apat asuohta sih dinga, hinanleh pellouin Babilon leengpa khut a pieh khiet in a um dinga kimaituo in akihou ding ua amit un aki entuo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Zedekiah khu Babilon langah pui vanin, khunah ama ka ve masangsie’n a um ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, Kaldai mite dou nan ulachin zou sih va uteh, chia bang dinga nagen ahiei? chia ataan sah ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Jeremiah in agen a, “Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai vawi, na paneu Shallum tapa Hanameel na kungah ahing haw dinga, Anathoth a um ka lou leiin, ka innkuon kinaipi pen na hi ziehin gouluo ding mawng na hi, ahing chi ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka pa neu tapa Hanameel khu, Mangpa gen bang dungzui in suongkul huongsung ah ka kungah ahing pei a, ka kungah Benjamin gam a Anathoth khuo a um ka lou leiin, gamluo thei na hi ziehin na tat thei mawng ahi, kilei mai in achi hi. Tuachi’n ken tami Mangpa thu ahi chi ka theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Anathoth khuo a um ka paneu tapa Hanameel lou ka leita a, tualeh adangka ka te pieh a, dangka sia shekel sawm le sagi tah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n lai ka giel a, suoi ka nam a, theipimite ka han a, tuachi’n dangka khu atena ah ka khaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n kileina lai gelna tawndan ngaina leh dan dungzui a kikha leh kihongte kala a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka pa neu Hanameel mitmu leh, kileina a mintuong theipi mite mitmu leh suongkul huongsunga tou Judate zousie masang ah Ma-aseiah tapa Neriah tapa Baruk kungah kileina lai ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n amasang uah Baruk thu ka pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Tam kileina laite akikha leh akihongtegel aniin la inlen, ni tampi a um theina dingin leibel sung khat ah koiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Innte leh loute leh grep huonte tam gam sung ah akilei kia ding hi, achi hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuin tua kileina lai Neriah tapa Baruk ka pieh zou in, Mangpa kungah thu ka ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh! Mangpa Pasian ngaiin, nangman na silbawltheina thupitah leh na ban jahin van leh lei na siem a, nang dingin ahaseng taluo bangma a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangman tul tampite kungah lungsietna leh hepina na langsah a, tualeh pate khelna khu anua ua atate angsungah na thuh lenga, Athupi leh ahat tungnung, galkapte Mangpa khu Na min ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lemguotna a thupi nasepna a hat, mihing tate umdan zousie na en chien a, michin a umdan leh a nasep dungzui a kipahman piea thuh zelpa na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangman Izipt gam akipat in chiemtena leh sillamdang na bawl a, tuni tandongin Israel leh midangte lah ah na bawl zel a, tuni a mabangin min khat na kibawldohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sil lamdangte, chiemtenate leh banthahat leh banzahdoh leh zauhuoina thupitah toh na mi Israelte Izipt gam a kipata puidohpa na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Apu apate uh kunga pieh dinga na chiem gam nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam khu amauh na peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahing lut ua, tam gam ahing luota uhi; hinanleh na thu amang sih ua, na dan lah azuisih uhi. Akung ua bawl dinga na thupiehte zousie bangma abawl sih uhi; Tuaziehin tam sietnate zousie amauh tungah na tungsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lei kisepvumte en vawi, khopi la dingin asung ah ahing lut ta uhi. Namsaute, kiel leh natpite ziehin tam khopi hing sim kaldai mite khut ah pieh ahita ding hi; na gensa zousie ahing tungta hi, en in, tami na muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Aw Mangpa Pasian nang ka kungah “Lou mun khu sum in lei inlen, theipimite han in,” khopi khu Kaldai mite khut a kipie ahita hi,” na chi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu Jeremiah kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ngai un, Kei Mangpa tahsa zousie Pasian ka hi, Kei a ding in sil hasa seng taluo a um eimah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngaiin tam khopi khu Kaldai mite khut leh Babilon leengpa khut ah ka pe dinga ama’n ala ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh tam khopi hing dou Kaldai mite ahing pei ding ua, tam khopi meiin ahal ding uhi; tualeh atung ua keima ahing lungthahsahna dingun, inntung vumte ah Baal kungah gimnamtuite ahalna u’leh pasien dangte kunga dawn sillatte asunbuohna innte uh ka haltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen Israel tate leh Juda taten akhangdawn lai ua pat in, ka mai ah sil hoilou ngen abawl uhi. Israel taten akhut nasepte un kei ahing sulungthah uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam khopi in akilam chiil ni a kipat tuni dongin ka lungthahna leh ka thangpaina atohthou sengta, tuaziehin ka mitmu akipat ka suonmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel tate leh Juda taten gitlouna abawl zousiete ziehun aleengte u’leh, amiliente uh, asiempute uh, aguolneite u’leh, Juda mite leh Jerusalem a tengte zousie in Kei ahing lungthah sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kei ahing nuangat ua, ahing maingat sih uhi; zingmawng matah a thou in, amaute hilhil nanlengzong, thuhilna zui dingin angaikhe nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh ka min pua, tua inn asuhbua na ding un, asil kidah huoite uh akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh sil kidahhuoi bawl a, Juda khielsah dinga thu ka pieh ngai vawtlou, ka lungsim a zong tuabang lut ngai vawtlou hinapi amauten atapate u’leh atanute uh Molek kunga meikuong laia apailut theina dingun, Hinnom tapa guom ah Baal munsangte alam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tuin, Mangpa Israelte Pasian in, namsau, kiel, leh natpi zang in Babilon leengpa khut ah akipekhe ding chia na gen uh tam khopi tungtang tambang in agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ngai un, ka lungthahna, ka lunghilouna leh ka thangpaina thupitah a, amauh ka delmangna gam akipat in ka puikhawm kia dinga, tam mun ah bittah in ka tengsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh ka mite ahi ding ua, Kei a Pasian uh ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh hoina ding leh anua ua atate uh hoina dinga, kumtawn a kei ahing giin theina dingun, lungtang mun khat leh umdan kibang ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh amautoh kumtawn thuhun ka bawl dinga, atung ua hoina ka bawl akipat ka kiheimangsan sih ding hi; alungtang uah keima giinna ka koi ding a, kei akipat apeimang ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahi atung ua silhoi bawl khu ka kipahna ahi ding a, ka lungtang zousie leh ka hinna pumpi in amauh tam gam ah ka phutdet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tam mite tunga tuohsietnate zousie ka hing tunsah mabangin, akung ua ka chiem silhoite zousie atung uah ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Gam suhsietsa mi leh sa tenlouna Kaldai mite khut ah akipeta hi, chia na gen uh gam sungah loute akilei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin gam leh Jerusalem khopi kimvel lah leh Juda khopite ah leh singtanggam khopite ah leh phaijang khopite ah leh simlam khopite ah miten sum in loute alei ding ua, kileina lai agiel ding ua, akha ding ua, tualeh theipimite ahan ding uhi, aziehpen asaltaan ua pat uh ka kinuale sah kia ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa thu Jeremiah kungah suongkul huongsunga aki khakhum laiin aniveina in ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa leitung siempa, leitung lim leh mel nei a bawl a sudetpan tambangin agen hi: Amin khu Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hing han inlen, ka hing dawng dinga, tualeh na theingailou sil thupi leh sil kiphuol ka hing musah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Israelte Pasian in, khopi simna dinga lei kisepvumte leh namsau a suhsiet a um tam khopi a innte leh Juda leengte innte tungtangah tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaldai mite toh kidou dingin ahing kuon ua, hinanleh ka lungthahna leh ka thangpaina a ka tha ding mite shi luong in amunte uh adim ding hi; agitlouna zousiete ziehun tam khopi apat in ka mai ka phuolta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngaiun, chidamna leh suhdamna ka hing puohpieh dinga, amauh ka sudam dinga tualeh muonna leh thutah kiningching ka neisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Juda saltangte leh Israel saltangte ka kinualesah kia dinga, amasa lai bangin amauh ka tungding kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tunga akhelnate zousie ua pat amauh ka siengsah dinga, tualeh ka tunga athulimlou nate u’leh atatkhelnate zousie uh ka ngaidam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam khopi tunga silhoi ka bawl dingte zousie tam leitunga na zakha namte zousie masangah kei a dingin, kipahna, pahtawina leh zatatna, min ahi dinga, tam khopi a dinga hoina leh lawchinna ka piehte ziehin zau in achitun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tam mun mihing lah umlou sa lah umlou ahawm guoha um Juda khopi leh Jerusalem gawlzingte suhsietsa mi leh sa umlou chia na genna mun ngei uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nopna leh kipahna awgingte, mouneipa aw leh mounu awte bang leh Mangpa inna kipahthu genna sillat hing tawite aw te leh tua sillat hing tawiten: Galkapte Mangpa khu phat un, Mangpa a hoi hi, A itna khu kum tawn in a umzing hi, achi uh akiza kia ding hi. Aziehpen Juda saltangte agam uah ka hing nuapui kia dinga masang lai bangin ka umsah kia ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Mi lah umlou sa lah umlou a, kiloisa tam mun ah leh akhopite zousie ah belamchingten abelam honte uh akhawldam sahna ding uh gantatna munte a umtha kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Singtanggam khopite ah, Phaizang khopite ah, simlam khopite ah, Benjamin gam ngiem lahte ah Jerusalem kim a munte ah leh Juda khopite ah, amauh simpa khut nuoi ah belamhonte akizui zung zung kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ngai un, Israel innkuonte leh Juda innkuonte kunga silhoi bawl dinga ka chiemsate ka tangtunsahna ding nite ahing tungta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nite leh tua hun chiengin David khanggui akipat in, dihtatna Bameng khat ka poudohsah dinga, Ama’n gamsungah vaihawmna dihtah leh dihtatna in vaiahawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Juda hundam in a um dinga Jerusalem bittah in ateng ding hi; tualeh amin ding khu tami ahi ding hi, “MANGPA KHU I DIHTATNA” ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: David in Israel innkuonte leengtoupha a tou ding mi atasam ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Levi mi siemputen zong ka mai a tawplou a halmang sillatte lan ding, ann sillatte lan ding leh kithoinate bawl dingin mi atasam ngai tuom sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu Jeremiah kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ahun ding ua kiguot banga, sun leh zan umlou dinga, sun dinga ka thuhun leh zan dinga ka thuhun, na suhsiet thei u’leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuachi’n aleengtouna tunga tou ding tapa neilou ding leh, siempu Levi mite ka masang nasemte umlou dingin, ka suohpa David toh ka thuhun na suse thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Van a aasite akisim senglou bang leh tuipi gei a pieunelte te guol ahilou bangin, ka suoh David hahlesuonte leh ka mai a nasem Levimite ka pungsah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa thu Jeremiah kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tam miten Mangpa’n ateldoh innkuon khu apaidohta hi chia agen uh ngaituo ngailou na hiei mah? Amaun tambanga ka mite amit mu ua nam chitham ahilouna dingun ka mite a simmaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Sun dinga ka thuhun leh zan dinga ka thuhun adetlou a, tualeh van leh leitunga sil umdante ka guotlou ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jakob hahlesuonte leh ka suoh David zong ka paimang dinga, tuachi’n Abraham, Isak leh Jakob, hahlesuonte tunga vaihawm dingin ahah asuonte lah ah koima ka la sih ding hi; aziehpen asaltanna ua pat ka kinuale sah kia dinga, atung uah lainatna ka nei ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar leh agalkapte zousie, athuneina nuoia um leitung leenggam zousie leh mipi zousiete’n Jerusalem leh akhopite zousie sim a ahing dou lai ua, Mangpa a kipat a Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Pei inlen Juda leengpa Zedekiah kung ah va hilin; Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngai in, tam khopi Babilon leengpa khut ah ka pe dinga, ama’n meiin ahal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh akhut a pat in na suohta sih ding a, ahing kiman ngeingei ding a, ama khut ah ahing kipekhe ding hi, tuachi’n na mit in Babilon leengpa na mu dinga, aman nang kimaituo in ang houpi dinga, tualeh Babilon ah na pei ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Juda leengpa Zedekiah, Mangpa thu ngaikhie in, Mangpa’n na tungtang thu tambangin agen hi; namsau in na shi sih dinga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh hamuong tahin na shi ding hi, tualeh na masanga na um leeng masate, napu napate adinga gimnamtui ahalpieh bangun, nanga dingin zong ahal ding uhi. Tualeh “Kadei! pu aw,” chi’n ahing kaa ding uhi; aziehpen athu ka phuongdohta hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Jeremiah in Jerusalem a Juda leengpa Zedekiah kungah tam thute zousie agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babilon leengpa galkapten Jerusalem leh Juda khopi kinuasie zousie leh Lakish leh Azekah ahing dou laiun, tamte Juda khopite lah a kulpi nei khopi um nalaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami leengpa Zedekiah in Jerusalem a um mi zousie toh, akung ua zalenna phuongdoh dinga thuhun abawlpi nua a, Mangpa akipat Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung khu ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Michin in asuohpa ahiei, asuohnu ahiei, Hebru pasal ahiei, Hebru numei ahiei ahileh ahadoh ding ahi, mi koima aunau Hebru mi naseppieh a aumlou ding ahi, chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin tam thuhun a pang miliente leh mipite zousie in asuohpasalte u’leh asuohnumeite uh suotasah ding leh amaute saltangsah nawnlou dingin, tua thuhun apom ua, a suoh leh salte uh ahadohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh anua in alungsimte uh aheng ua, ahadohsa uh asuohpasalte u’leh asuohnumeite uh anuamat kia ua athunuoi uah suoh leh sal in ataangsah kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa akipat Jeremiah kungah thu ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi; Izipt gam asaltanna inn ua kipat na pu napate uh ka puidoh laiin ama utoh thuhun ka bawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kum sagina bei kuon chiengin michin in na unaupa Hebrumi na kung ua suoh dinga hing kizua mite na hadoh chiet ngeingei ding uh ahi. Kum guh na nna asep nua chiengin nang apat na zalensah ding ahi, ka chi hi. Hinanleh na pu leh pate un ka gente azui sih ua, abil u’zong adaw ut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n tumasang zepin na hing kisia ua, ka mitmu ah sildih na bawl ua, michin in a inn vengpa kungah zalenna na phuong uhi. Ka min puo inn ah, ka masangah thuhun nangawn na bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n na kilehei ua, ka min na buasah uhi; michin in nouma utna a na zalensah uh, na suohpate u’leh na suohnute uh na nuamat kia ua, na thunuoi ua, suohpasal leh suohnumei dingin napui kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Noute michin in asanggampa kungah leh ainnvengpa kunga zalenna na phuondohna uah, ka thu na mang sih uhi, ngai un, noute adingin, namsau, kiel leh hipi kungah, zalenna ka phuong hi, tualeh noute leitung leenggam zousie lah ah chizat huoi in ka hing bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh ka thuhun botsete, ka masanga athuhun bawl uh zuiloute khu bawngnou phal ni suo a, akaal a apei suoh bang in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda miliente leh Jerusalem miliente, michilgete, siempute leh mipi zousiete bawngnou phal ni kisuo kaala peisuohte khu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amelmate uh khut ah leh a hinna uh tha sawma suite khut ah ka pekhe dinga, tuachi’n ashiluongte uh tungleeng vate leh leitung gamsate ann ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Juda leengpa Zedekiah leh amiliente khu amelmate u’leh ahinna tha sawma suite khut ah, noute apat a peimangsa Babilon leengpa galkapte khut ah ka pekhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai un, amauh thu ka pe dinga, tam khopi ah ka hing kinuale sah kia dinga, amaun ahing dou ding ua, ala ding ua, meiin ahaltum ding uhi, tualeh ken Juda khopite ka suse gawp ding a, koima ateng thei sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim, leeng vaihawm lai a, Mangpa akipat Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Rekab inn kuonte kungah haw inlen, amauh houpi inlen, Mangpa inn sunga pindan khat ah hing puilut inlen, adawn ding uh zu pie in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken Habazziniah tapa Jeremiah, Jeremiah tapa Zaazaniah leh asanggamte leh atapate zousie u’toh Rekabmite innkuon zousie toh ka pui a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama ukhu Mangpa inn a Pasian mi khat Igdaliah tapa Hanan tapate pindan, kotpivengpa Shallum tapa Ma-aseiah pindan tunga, miliente pindan kunga um ah ka hing puilutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rekabmite innkuonte tapate masangah zu a dim belte leh noute, akung uah ka tunga, “Dawn un” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun “Zu ka dawn sih dinguh, aziehpen ka pa uh Rekab tapa Jonadab in, noute leh na tapate un, kumtawn a zu na dawnlou ding uh ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inn zong na lamlou ding uh, haichi zong na thelou ding uh, grep-huon na bawllou ding uh, neh zong na nehlou ding uh, hinanleh na dam sung teng uh puon inn a na ten ding uh ahi, mikhuol na hina gam ua ni tampi na ten theina dingun, chiin thupieh ahing pie hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuamabangin koute leh ka zite hiin ka tapate uh, ka tanute uh hitaleh ka damsung sie uh zu dawnlou dingin ka pa uh Rekab tapa Jonadab in thu ahing pieh pouma ka zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tenna ding uh innte ka lamsih ua, grep huonte ka neisih ua, loute lah ka bawl sih ua, tualeh haichite zong ka tu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh puon innte ah ka teng ua, thu ka mang ua, ka pa uh Jonadab in ahing thupieh zousie dungzuiin ka bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh tambang ahing hi a, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar tam gam dou dinga ahing kuontou laiin, hing pei un, Kaldai galkapte leh Siria galkapte azauhuoi zieh un Jerusalem ah ipeitou ding uhi ka kichi ua, tuachi’n Jerusalem ah ka umdenta uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu Jeremiah kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambang in agen hi, Pei inlen Juda mite leh Jerusalem a tengte va hilin, ka thute ngaikhe dingin thuhilna sanglou ding na hi uoi mah? Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekab tapa Jonadab in zu dawnlou dingin atapate thu apie a, athupieh azui ua, tuni tan dongin apu uh thupieh azui ziehun zu adawn sih uhi. Hinanleh ken zingmawng matah a thou in noute kungah thu kagen a, ka thu namang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kung uah ka suoh guolneite zousie, matah a thouin ka sawl a, michin na umdan hoilou ua kipat in hing kinuale unlen, na sil bawlte uh siempha un, tualeh pasien dangte nuazui sih unlen, anna u’zong seppieh sih un, tuachi’n noute leh napu leh napate u’kunga ka pieh gam ah na teng ding uhi, achi uhi. Hinanleh nabil uh nadaw sih ua, ka gen zong na ngaikhe sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rekab tapa Jonadab taten apa un akung ua athupieh amang ua, hinanleh tam miten ka thu amang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un Juda leh Jerusalem a tengte zousie tungah ka gensa sietna ka tungsah ding hi. Aziehpen amaute kungah thu ka gen a, hinanleh angaikhe sih uhi, amaute ka han a hinanleh ahing dawng sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jeremiah in Rekabmite innkuonte kung ah, “Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Na pa uh Jonadab thupieh na man ua, tualeh athuhilnate zousie na zui ua tualeh ahing thupieh dungzui a na bawl ziehun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua ziehin galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Rekab tapa Jonadab in ka masang a ka nasem ding mi atasam ngai sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim leenga apan kum lina ah, Mangpa akipat Jeremiah kungah tam thu ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Laibu ziel khat la inlen, tuanah Israel leh Juda tungtang thu leh namdang zousie tungtang thu na kunga kagen ni apat leh, Josiah hun lai apat a tuni tandonga ka thugen zousie giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda innkuonten atung ua sil hoilou ka bawl tup zousie azah chiengun, michin a umdan gilou uapat ahing kinuahei khamaw sih ding ua, Ken agitlounate u’leh akhelnate uh ka ngaidam theina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in Neriah tapa Baruk ahana, tuachi’n Baruk in Mangpa thu Jeremiah kunga kigen zousie Jeremiah in akunga ahil bangbangin laibu ziel khat ah agielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Jeremiah in Baruk kungah thu apie a, “Kei pen khakhum a um ka hita a, Mangpa inn ah ka haw theita sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin nang va haw inlen, Mangpa thu ka hing hil laibu ziel a na gelte, Mangpa inna mipite zah ah ann ngawl in vasim in, tualeh akhopite ua kipat a hing pawtdoh Juda mite zah ah zong na sim ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaun Mangpa mai ah thungetnate bawlin michin a umdan gilou ua kipat in ahing kihei kia khamaw ding uoi mah; aziehpen Mangpa’n tam mite tunga a thangpaina leh alungthahna aphuondoh khu athupi mama hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Neriah tapa Baruk in, guolnei Jeremiah in bawl dinga thu apieh zousie abawl a, Mangpa inn ah laibu ziel akipat, Mangpa thute asimkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim leeng vaihawm kum ngana, aha kuona ah tambang ahing hia, Jerusalem a mi zousie ding leh, Juda khopite akipata Jerusalem a hing peimi zousie a dingin, Mangpa mai a ann ngawlna aphuong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Baruk in Mangpa kul kotpi tha kunga um, huongsung leituol sahtazaw a laigielpa Shaphan tapa Gemariah pindanah mi zousie zahin laibuziel apat Jeremiah thugente asimkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Shaphan tupa, Gemariah tapa Mikaiah in laibu akipat a Mangpa thute azah tahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />leengpa inn a laigielpa pindan ah ava peisuh a, khunah milien zousie ana toukhawm ua; laigielpa Elishama, Shemaiah tapa Delaiah, Akbor tapa Elnathan, Shaphan tapa Gemariah, Hananiah tapa Zedekiah leh milien dangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Baruk in mipite zah a, laibuziel apat asim, zou in Mikaiah in azahte zousie amaute kungah aphuongdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin miliente zousie in, Kushi tapa, Shelemiah tapa, Nethaniah tapa Jehudi khu Baruk kunga, mipite zah a na sim laibuziel khu “Na khut in hing tawi inlen, hing peiin,” chi dingin asawl uhi. Tuachi’n Neriah tapa Baruk in laibuziel khu akhut a tawiin akung uah ahing peita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaun akungah “Touphot inlen, ka zah ngei uah hing sim vawi” achi ua, tuachi’n Baruk in azah un asimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaun tam thute azah tahun, zauin khatlekhat aki entuo ua, Baruk kungah “Tam thute zousie leengpa kungah kahil ngeingei ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Baruk kungah, hing Pei vawi, “Tam thute zousie pi, Jeremiah hing gen banga nagel amah?” chiin a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Baruk in amauh a dawnga, “Tam thute zousie akam in ka kungah aphuongdoh a, tualeh ken laibu sungah laitui in ka giel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n milienten Baruk kungah, “Pei inlen Jeremiah toh va kiphuol un, tualeh na umna mun uh koima theisah sihun,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaute leengpa kungah, ahuongsung leituol ah ava haw ua, hinanleh laibuziel khu laigielpa Elishama pindan ah akoi ua, thu zousie leengpa zah ah ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Jehudi laibuziel la dingin asawl a, Jehudi in laigielpa Elishama pindan apat ahing tawi hi. Tualeh Jehudi in leengpa zah leh leengpa kunga ding miliente zah in asimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh aha kuona ah, leengpa aphalbi inn ah atou a, amai a meikhuh ah mei akuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hi a, Jehudi in bung thum ahiei, li ahiei asim zou tahin, leengpa’n laigiel mi temta ala a, a attan a, meikhuh a meikuong a apailut a, meikhuh a meiin tua laibuziel akahtum masangsie in ahalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinapiin tam thute zousie za leengpa leh anasemte azau mawngmawng sih ua, apuonsilte u’zong abotkeh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahivangin Elnathan, Delaiah leh Gemariah in laibuziel haltumlou dingin leengpa kungah angen ua, hinanleh ama’n angaikhiet pieh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngaikhiet pieh nahsangin, Lengpa’n Hamalek tapa Jarahmeel leh Azriel tapa Seraiah leh Abdeel tapa Shelemiah, laigielpa Baruk leh guolnei Jeremiah man dingin thu apie a, hinanleh Mangpa’n amauh aphuolmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n laibuziel leh Jeremiah gen banga Baruk in agel thute leengpa’n ahaltum nua in Jeremiah kungah Mangpa thu ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Laibuziel dang khat la kia inlen, asungah Juda leengpa Jehoiakim in ahaltum laibuziel masapen sunga thute zousie giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Juda leengpa Jehoiakim kungah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Babilon leengpa pellou in ahing kuon dinga, tam gam asuse dinga, tana mi leh sa um zousie asugam sieng ding hi, chia na gel ahia, ana hal tum ta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n Juda leengpa Jehoiakim tungtang thu ah tambangin agen hi: Ama’n David leengtoupha tunga tou ding mi koima anei sih dinga, aluong khu sun a nisa leh zan a daitui thuoh dingin ka paidoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama leh atate, tualeh asuohte, akhelna ziehun ka gawt dinga, ama u’leh Jerusalem a tengte tungah leh Juda mite tunga tung ding a ka phuondoh sil hoilou zousie ka tungsah ding hi; hinanleh angaikhe sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in laibuziel dangkhat ala kia a, Neriah tapa laigielpa Baruk kungah apie a, ama’n tua sungah Juda leengpa Jehoiakim in mei a ahaltum laibu a thu umte zousie Jeremiah kam apat in agiel lut a, tuate ban ah zong akibahpi thu tampi abelap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in Josiah tapa Zedekiah Juda gam a leengpa dinga aguot khu, Jehoiakim tapa Koniah taangin leengpa in ahing pangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh ama hiin, anasemte hiin, gamsunga mite hitaleh, Mangpa’n guolnei Jeremiah tungtawn a athugente angaikheta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Zedekiah in guolnei Jeremiah kungah Shelemiah tapa Jehukal leh siempu Ma-aseiah tapa Zephaniah asawl a, “Mangpa i Pasian kungah kou a ding tuin thungen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tulaitah in Jeremiah khu suongkul a kikhum nailou ahiziehin mipite lah ah, lut in apawt zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharaoh galkapte khu Izipt a kipat in ahing kuontou ua; tuachi’n Jerusalem va sim a um Kaldai miten tuabang tanchin azah tahun, Jerusalem apat apawtdohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu Jeremiah kungah ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ka kunga thu dong dinga noute hing sawl, Juda leengpa kungah tambangin na gen ding uhi: Ngai un noute panpi ding a hing kuondoh Pharaoh galkapte amauh gam Izipt ah anuakia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Kaldaimite ahing nua kia ding ua, tam khopi ahing dou ding ua, ala ding ua meiin ahaltum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Kaldai miten eite hing peisan ngeingei ding uh ahi” chiin, nou leh nou kisol sihun; ahing peisan sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen noute hing dou Kaldai galkapte zou nan ulachin, alah ua miliem umsunte apuonbuh chiet ua kipat hing thoudohin tam khopi meiin ahal thou thou ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hia, Pharaoh galkapte a zau zieh ua, Kaldai miten Jerusalem asimlai uh a nuasie laiun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jeremiah Benjamin gam a amite lah a, anei alam umte va kemtup dinga, kuon dingin Jerusalem khopi apat apawtdoh panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin kotpi a aumlai tahin, vengmite lamkai khat amin Hananiah tapa, Shelemiah tapa, Irijah kichi khat ana um a; ama’n “Guolnei Jeremiah khu Kaldai mite langa pang nahi,” chiin ana man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in, “Tami zuou ahi, Kaldai mite langah ka pang vawt sih hi” achi a; hinanleh athugen angaikhe sih hi. Tuachi’n Irijah in Jeremiah aman a, miliente kungah ahing zawpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin miliente khu Jeremiah tungah athangpaita ua, avuo ua, laigielpa Jonathan inn ah suongkul ah akoita uhi. Aziehpen Jonathan inn khu suongkul a azah uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jeremiah khu suongkul sung tawng thuh leh pindan sung ah alut a khunah hun sawtpi ataang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Lengpa Zedekiah in mi asawl a, ava ladoh sah a, leeng inn sungah aguh in ama adap doh a, “Mangpa akipata thu hing tung a um ei?” achi hi. “Um ma e” chiin, Jeremiah in adawnga; “Nang pen Babilon leengpa khut ah piehin na um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Jeremiah in leengpa Zedekiah kungah “Nang tung hiin, na nasemte tung hiin ahisihleh tammite tungah bang bawlkhiel ka nei a suongkul a nang khum ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Babilon leengpa khu noute dou ding leh tam khopi dou dingin hing kuon sih va chia, na kunga gen na guolneite tu in hei a um ata uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin hepitahin ngaiin, ka pu leengpa aw, ka thugen na mitmu ah pomtah hihen, laigielpa Jonathan inn ah hing nua peisah kia vawt sin, tuachilouin ka shi kha ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Zedekiah in Jeremiah khu suongkul huongsunga koi ding leh khopi sunga tanghou abei masangsie, nichin a tanghou bawlte gawlzinga pat tanghou pe dingin thupieh abawl hi. Tuabangin Jeremiah khu suongkul huong sungah a um denta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Mattan tapa Shephatiah, Pashur tapa Gedaliah, Shelemiah tapa Jukal leh Malkiah tapa Pashur in mipite kunga Jeremiah thugen ana za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tam khopi sunga umden pouma, namsau, kiel leh natpite in ashi ding uhi; hinanleh Kaldai mite kunga pei pouma ahing ding hi, ahinna khu ama dingin kipahman ahi dinga, ahing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tam khopi Babilon leengpa galkapte khutah akipe ngei ngei dinga, ala ding uhi, chia agen khu azata uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin milienten leengpa kungah, “Hepitahin tam mipa kithat heh, aziehpen ama’n tam khopi sunga umden galdou mite leh mipite zousie, tambanga agen ziehin azawngkhal sahta hi. Aziehpen tam mipa’n mipite hoina ding asui sih a, asietna ding uh asui zaw hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zedekiah in akung uah, “En un, ama na khut ua um ahi. Lengpa’n noute kal in bangma abawl thei sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Jeremiah aman ua, suongkul huong sung a um, leengpa tapa Malkiah tuikul sungah akhesuh ua, khauhuol in Jeremiah khu akhaikhesuh uhi. Tualeh tua tuikul sung ah buonnaang chilou tui a umsih hi, tuachi’n Jeremiah buonnaang lah ah atumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa inn a um michilgete lah a khat, Ethiopiami Ebed-Melek in, Jeremiah tuikul sungah akhesuhta uh chi azahtah in, leengpa khu Benjamin kulkotpi a atou laitah ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ebed-melek leengpa inn akipat apawtkhie a, leengpa ava houpi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka pu leengpa aw, tam miten guolnei Jeremiah tuikul sunga apailut ukhu sil hoiloutah bawl ahi uhi; a umna mun ah gilkiel a shi mai ding ahi, aziehpen khopi sungah tanghou a um nawn sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Ethiopia mi Ebed-Melek thu apie a, “Tana pat in mi sawmthum zawpi inlen, guolnei Jeremiah khu tuikul sunga kipat in ashi masangin ladoh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ebed-melek in tua mite azawpi a, Sum koina nuoia leengpa inn ah alut ua, tuana kipat in puonsil lui kipaite leh puonsete aladoh a, tuikul sunga Jeremiah kungah khauhuol in akhaikhe suh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ethiopia mi Ebed-melek in Jeremiah kungah, “Tami puonsil lui leh puonsiete na zah nuoi ah khauhuol toh gah det in,” achi a, Jeremiah in tuabangin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Jeremiah tuikul sunga kipat in khauhuol in akaidoh ua, aladohta uhi. Tualeh Jeremiah suongkul huong sungah a umdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuazou in leengpa Zedekiah in mi asawl a, guolnei Jeremiah khu Mangpa inn lutna thumna ah akungah azawpi a, tualeh leengpa’n Jeremiah kungah, “Sil khat ka hing dong ding hi, ka kungah bangma im neisin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in Zedekiah kungah, “Na kungah hing phuongkheta leng na hing that sih ding amah? achi hi. Thuhilna hingpe leng zong hing ngaikhe sih vateh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Zedekiah in Jeremiah kungah aguh in akichiem a, “I hinna hing bawlpiehpa Mangpa ahin ziehin, ka hing shi sah sih ding a, na hinna sui mite khut ah zong ka hing peh sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuazou in Jeremiah in Zedekiah kungah, “Galkapte Pasian, Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Babilon leengpa miliente khut a na kipieh leh na hing ngeingei dinga, tami khopi zong meiin akihal sih dinga, nang leh na innkuonpite na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Babilon leengpa miliente kunga na kipieh sih leh tami khopi Kaldai mite khut ah akipe dinga, amaun meiin ahal ding ua, akhut ua pat na suohta sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Zedekiah in Jeremiah kungah, “Kaldai mite khut a kipelut Judate ka giing hi, Kaldai miten amauh khut ah ahing pekhe ding ua, amaun ahing bawlse kha ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Jeremiah in, “Amauh khut ah ahing pekhe sih ding uhi; hepitah in na kunga Mangpa thu ka gente sang mai in, tuachi’n nanga dingin ahoi dinga, na hing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh na kipieh khieh nuom sihleh pen, Mangpa’n ka kunga alatsah tami ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai un tuin, Juda leengpa inna kinuasie numeite zousie Babilon leengpa uliente kunga piehkhiet ahi ding ua, tua numeiten: Na lawm hoipen pente un ahing solta ua, ahing zouta uhi Na kengte buonnawi lah ah atumta a, Amaun ahing kinua heisan kiata uhi; achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n na zite leh na tate zousie Kaldai mite kunga piehkhiet ahi ding ua, akhut ua pat na suohta vawt sih dinga, hinanleh Babilon leengpa khut a mat in na um dinga, tam khopi meiin ahal ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuazou in Zedekiah in Jeremiah kungah, “Tam thute koiman thei sih henlen, hileh na shi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh milienten nang kang houpi chi azah ua, na kunga ahing haw ua, leengpa kunga bang ahiei nagen, tuin ka kung uah phuongdoh in, tualeh leengpa’n na kungah bang agen ei, ka kung uah bangma im nei sin, ka hing that sih ding uhi, ahing chi u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuachi’n nang ama u’kungah, Jonathan inn a shi den dinga hing sawlkia lou dinga, leengpa kunga ngetna va bawl ka hi, na chi mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n miliente zousie Jeremiah kungah ahing pei ua, adongta uhi. Tualeh leengpan athupieh zousie dungzui in amauh ana hil hi. Tuachi’n ama toh ahoulimna uh asutawpta uhi, sil umdan atheilou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem kilah zou ni tan dongin Jeremiah suongkul huong sungah a umdenta a, Jerusalem kilah ni in, khunah a um hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Zedekiah leenga apan kum kuona aha sawmna ah, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar leh agalkapte zousie, Jerusalem dou dingin ahing kuon ua, a imtawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah leenga apanna kum sawm leh khat, ha lina, ani kuo ni in, khopi kulbang phukeh in khopi sung ah alut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon leengpa miliente zousie ahing lut ua, Kulkotpi laita ah ahing tou uhi. Amaute: Nelgal-Sharezer, Samgar Nebo, Sarsekim, Rabsari, Nelgal-Sharezer, Rabmag leh Babilon leengpa milien dangte zousie ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hia, Juda leengpa Zedekiah leh galkapte zousie in, amauh amutahun, ataita ua, khopi apat zanlai in, leengpa huon lampi a kulbang ni kikaal a, kulkot ah apawtdohta uhi. Tualeh ama khu phaijang lampi langah apawtdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Kaldai galkapten ama anuadel ua, Jeriko phaijang ah Zedekiah adelphata uhi; Ama aman ua, Hamath gam a Rebla ah, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar kungah ahing zawpi ua, khunah aman atunga gawtna ding thutanna abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon leengpa’n, Riblah ah Zedekiah tapate Zedekiah mitmu ngel ah athat a, tualeh Babilon leengpa’n Juda miliente zousie zong athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Zedekiah mitte gel zong akheudoh pieh hi, tualeh sia khau in ahen a, Babilon langah azawpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaldai miten leengpa inn leh mipite innte meiin ahal ua, Jerusalem kulbangte asuchimta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n vengpawlte lamkai Nebuzaradan in khopi a mipi umsunte leh ama lam a pang dinga hing kipelutte leh mipi um nalai dangte toh, Babilon langah sal in apuimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa vengpawl lamkai Nebuzaradan in Juda gam a mi zawng bangma neiloute anuasie a, grep huonte leh loute ama u’kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in Jeremiah tungtangah leengpa vengpawl lamkai Nebuzaradan thu apie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ama zawpi inlen, hoitahin bawl in, bawlse vawt sin, amabou na kunga agen bang bangin atung ah bawl in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa vengpawl lamkaipa Nebuzaradan leh Nebushasban, Rabsari, Nergal Sharezer, Rabmag leh Babilon leengpa miliente zousie in mi asawl ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuachi’n Jeremiah khu suongkul huong sung apat in apuidoh ua, Shaphan tapa Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kungah, inn langa pui ding in akemsahta uhi, tuachi’n ama khu mite lah a atengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeremiah suongkul huongsunga khum a aum laiin Mangpa thu akungah ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Pei inlen Ethiopia mi Ebed-Melek kungah va houpi inlen, galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, tam khopi tungah ahoina ding hilou in, asietna dingin ka thu gente tangtung sah ding ka hita, tua hun chiengin na mitmu ah ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh tua ni chiengin nang pen ka hing hunkhe ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, tualeh na giin mama mite khut a pieh in na umsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen pellou in kang hunkhe ngeingei dinga, namsau in na shi sih ding hi, hinanleh na hinna khu nang a dingin na nuomman ahi ding hi; aziehpen keima tungah namuonna na koita hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem leh Juda akipat a Babilon a saltaanga puimangte lah a leengpa vengpawl lamkaipa Nebuzaradan in Jeremiah siakhau a hen pum a apui lai a, Ramah a kipata apeisah nua a, Mangpa akipat a Jeremiah kunga thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lengpa vengpawl lamkai pa’n Jeremiah apui a, akungah, “Mangpa na Pasian in tam mun a sil hoilou tung ding ana phuongdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa’n tami ahing tungsahta a, agen bangin abawlta hi; aziehpen Mangpa tungah na khielta ua, athute na zui sih ua, tuazieh a tam silte na tung ua hing tung ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin en in, na khut a siakhaute akipat nang ka hing hadohta hi. Kei toh Babilon langa pei ding nanga dingin hoiva nachi leh hing zuiin hoitahin ka hing keem ding hi. Hinanleh Babilon a ka kunga hing pei hoi sihva na chileh hing zuida mai inlen, tanah um maiin; En in gam pumpi na masang ah a um hi, nanga dinga hoi leh lemtang nasahna mun mun ah peiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin Jeremiah anua peikia masangin, Nebuzaradan in akungah, Babilon leengpa’n Juda khopite tunga uhpipa dinga aguot Shaphan tapa Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kungah pei inlen, mipite lah ah ama toh tengkhawm in, Ahisihleh peina ding lem nasah na lamlam ah peiin,” achi hi. Tuachi’n leengpa vengpawl lamkai pa’n neh ding silpieh apie a, apeisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuazouin Jeremiah khu Mizpah khuo a Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kungah apeita hi, tualeh gam sunga kinuasie mipite lah ah ama toh atengkhawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuin gamlah a um galkap lamkaite zousie leh agalkapte un, Babilon leengpa’n Ahikam tapa Gedaliah khu gamsung uhpipa in abawlta a, tualeh Babilon a sal a puilou pasalte, numeite, naupangte leh gamsunga azawng bangma neiloute akhut ah akeemsahta hi, chi azahtah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amaute Mizpah khuo a Gedaliah kungah ahing haw ua, khuna hing hawte, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael, Kareah tapate Johanan leh Jonathan, Tanhumeth tapa Seraiah, Netophath mi Ephai tapate, Maakath mi tapa Jezaniah leh amite utoh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Shaphan tapa, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah in ama u’leh a galkapte uh hamuon dingin kichiemna abawla; “Kaldai mite nna sep ding zau sih unlen, gamsungah teng khinkhian unlen, Babilon leengpa nna sem un, nou a dingin ahoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ka hileh Mizpah ah ka um dinga, ikung ua hing pei Kaldai mite nna ka sem ding hi. Hinanleh nouten grep zute, nipi lai theigate leh sathaute lakhawm unlen na belte uah koi unlen, na lahsa khopite uah tengun,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabangma in Moab gam leh Ammon mite lah a umte leh Edom gam leh gam tuom tuom a teng Judate zousie in, Babilon leengpa’n Juda mi lawikhat anuasie a, atung ua uhpipa dingin Shaphan tapa Ahikam tapa Gedaliah akoita hi chi azahtah un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Delzaha a umna gam zousie ua kipat in Judate zousie ahing kinuale kia ua, Juda gam a Mizpah khuo ah, Gedaliah kungah ahing pei ua, uoin leh nipi lai a theigate kiningching tahin alakhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Kareah tapa Johanan leh gamlah a um galkap lamkai zousie Mizpah khuo a Gedaliah kungah ahing pei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />akungah “Ammon mite leengpa Baalis in Nethaniah tapa Ishmael, nangma that dingin ahing sawl hi chi na theichien ei mah?” achi ua, hinanleh Ahikam tapa Gedaliah in amauh atahsang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kareah tapa Johanan in Mizpah khuo a Gedaliah kungah guhsim in agen a, “Hepitahin hing peisah inlen, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael kava that dinga, koiman athei sih ding hi. Bangzieh a aman nang ahing tha a, na kunga kikhawm Judate zousie akithethang ua, tualeh Juda mi umsunte abeimang ding uh chi’n agen hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Ahikam tapa Gedaliah in, Kareah tapa Johanan kungah, “Tambang sil na bawllou ding ahi; aziehpen Ishmael tungtang dihloutah in na gen hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin aha sagina ah tambang ahing hia, leeng innsung mi, leengpa miliente lah a khat, Elishama tapa, Nathaniah tapa, Ishmael, Mizpah khuo ah mi sawm toh, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kungah ahing haw ua, tualeh Mizpah khuo ah ann anekhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nathaniah tapa Ishmael leh akunga um mi sawmte ading doh ua, Babilon leengpa’n gam sung uhpipa dinga aguot Shaphan tapa, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah namsau in asat ua, athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ishmael in Mizpah a Gedaliah toh umkhawm Judate zousie athat sienga tualeh khuna um Kaldai galkapte zong athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Gedaliah athat chi koiman atheilou ni ni nua in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Shekem apat in, Shiloh apat in tualeh Samaria apat in, mi sawm giet akhamul uh metsiengin, apuonte uh botkeh in, atahsa uh kikuikeh gawpsa in akhut ua sillatte leh gimnamtuite tawi in Mangpa inn a lan dingin ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin Nathaniah tapa Ishmael khu amaute kimupi dingin Mizpah a kipat in lam tungtawn a kap kawm in ahing pei a, ama utoh akituoh tahin, ama’n akung uah, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kungah “Hing peiun” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi sunga ahing luttah un, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael leh akunga a umpiten, amaute athat ua, tuikul sungah apailutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh alah ua mi sawm in Ishmael kungah, “Hing that sih un, aziehpen kouten lou ah bu leh taang, sathau leh khuoizu phuolguh ka nei uhi,” achi uhi. Tuachi’n ama’n amaute a unaute lah uah athattel ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Ishmael in Gedaliah zieh a amithate luong apailutna tuikul khu leengpa Asa in, Israel leengpa Baasha a giin zieh a abawl ana hia; Nethaniah tapa Ishmael in tua tuikul khu mishi luongin adimsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuazou in Ishmael in Mizpah a mihing umsun, leengpa tanute leh Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kunga, leengpa vengpawlte lamkai Nebuzaradan in akepsah Mizpah khuo a um nalai zousiete sal in apui siengta hi. Nethaniah tapa Ishmael in amaute sal in apuimanga, Ammon mite kunga peipi dingin akipandohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Kareah tapa Johanan leh akunga um galkap lamkaite zousie in Nethaniah tapa Ishmael silgilou bawl zousie azah tahun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />akunga um agalkapte zousie uh apui ua, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael toh kidou dingin akuon ua, tualeh amaun Gibeon a tuikul lienpi umna kungah adelphata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ishmael kunga um mipi zousie in Kareah tapa Johanan leh akunga um galkap lamkaite zousie amu tahun, akipahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ishmael in Mizpah apata sal a apuimang mipite zousie akinuahei ua, ahing kinua le ua, Kareah tapa Johanan kungah ahing peita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Nethaniah tapa Ishmael khu mi giet toh Johanan apat asuohta ua Ammon mite kungah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kareah tapa Johanan leh akunga um galkapte lamkaite zousie in, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael in, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah nua a, Mizpah khuo akipat a Nethaniah tapa Ishmael apat Johanan in ahutdoh mi umsunte zousie, galkapte, numeite, naupangte, michilgete, Gibeon apat anua puikiate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaute apei zel ua, Izipt gama pei sawm in Bethlehem kung nai a um Geruth Chimham mun ah a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nethaniah tapa Ishmael in, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah, Babilon leengpa’n gamsung uhpipa dinga akoi khu atha ziehin amauten Kaldai mite agiing mama uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap lamkaite zousie leh Kareah tapa Johanan leh Hoshaiah tapa Jezaniah leh mipite zousie aneupen apat alienpen tan dongin ahing pei nai ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Guolnei Jeremiah kungah “Hepitahin ka ngetna na masangah pomtah hi henlen, kou tam mun a mi umsun nalaite adingin, Mangpa na Pasian kungah hing thumpieh dingin ka hing ngen uhi, (na hing mu bangmain tampi hilaipi tawmnoukhat nuasie in ka umta uhi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian in ka peina lampi ding u’leh, ka bawl ding uh silte ahing kohmu theina dingin ahing chi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Jeremiah in amaute kungah, “Na gen uh kana zata hi, Ngai un nagen bangun Mangpa na Pasian uh kungah, ka ngen dinga, tualeh Mangpa’n ahing dawnna pouma Kang hil dinga na kung uah bangma ka hing im sih ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Jeremiah kungah, “Mangpa na Pasian in nang hing sawl a, ka kung ua ahing thugen banga ka bawllou pouma u’leh, Mangpa khu ikaal ah theipitu dih leh ginum, hi heh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahoi hiin ahoilou hitaleh, ka hing sawlna uh Mangpa ka Pasian uh kamsuo ka zui ding uhi; Mangpa ka Pasian uh kamsuo ka zui u’leh kou a dinga hoina ahi ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sawm nua in Jeremiah kungah Mangpa thu ahing tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n Kareah tapa Johanan leh akunga um galkap lamkaite zousie tualeh mi zousie aneupen apat alienpen tandong ahankhawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />akung uah; “Na ngetna uh amasanga tut dinga nang sawlnapa uh Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam gam a na umden u’leh ka hing luoipua sih dinga, ka hing tungding ding hi, ka hing botdoh sih dinga, ka hing phutdet ding hi; aziehpen na tung ua ka silhoilou bawlte ka kisia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na giin mama chiet uh Babilon leengpa giing sih un, ama giing nawn sih un, Mangpa’n achi hi, aziehpen noute hing hundam ding leh akhut apat hing hunkhe dingin keiman ka hing umpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Noute ahing khotuo theina dingin, na tung uah khotuona ka langsah dinga, na gam mama uah ka hing kinuale sah kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten, tam gam ah teng sihva ung chia, Mangpa kamsuo thute na zui utsih u’leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hilou e! Izipt gam ah ka pei zaw ding ua, khunah ka teng ding uhi, khunah kidouna ka musih ding ua, pengkul gingte ka za nawn sih ding ua, tualeh ann du a gilkiel lou ding ka hi uh na chi u’leh pen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin nou Juda umsunte aw, Mangpa thugen ngai un, Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Izipt gam a lut a khuna ten tum chinten na hi u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tambang ahing hi ding: Na giin uh namsau in Izipt gam ah ahing delpha ding a, khunah na shi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Izipt gam a tengdinga pei tum chintente zousie tungah tambangin atung ding hi, namsaute, kielte leh natpite in ashi ding ua, atung ua ka tunsah ding sietna a kipat in koima asuohta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi; Ka lungthahna leh ka thangpaina Jerusalema tengte tunga ka sunbuoh bangin, Izipt gam a na lut chiengun, noute tungah zong ka lungthahna ka sungbaw ding hi. Tualeh noute pen mite hamse lawkhum, mite chizat, kamthauhauna leh simmaw, na hita ding ua, tam mun na ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw nou Juda umsunte, noute tungtangah Mangpa’n agen hi: Izipt ah pei sih un, tuniin noute kang vauhil ahi chi chientahin thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa ka Pasian ukung ah thu hing ngetpieh inlen, tualeh Mangpa ka Pasian un agen zousie bangin ka kung uah phuongdoh inlen, tua dungzui in ka bawl ding uhi, na chi lai un, lepchie tahin nang gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh tuni’n na kung uah ka phuongdohta hi, hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian uh aw hiin, na kung uah kei ahing sawl a athugente zousie na zui tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin teng dinga na zotna mun uah namsau in, kiel in, tualeh natpi in na shi ding uh, chi chientah in thei un.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hi a: Jeremiah in mipite zousie kunga Mangpa a Pasian uh thugente zousie, Mangpa a Pasian un gen ding a akung ua asawlna thu zousie mipite kunga agen zouin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hoshiah tapa Azariah leh Kareah tapa Johanan leh mi kiliensah zousie in, Jeremiah kungah, zuou gen na hi, “Mangpa ka Pasian un nang, Izipt gam a teng dingin pei sih un, chi a gen dingin ahing sawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaldai miten ahing tha theina ding u’leh Babilon a ahing puimang theina ding ua, Kaldaite khut a hing pekhe ding a, Neriah tapa Baruk in, koute dou dingin ahing thusawl ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kareah tapa Johanan leh agalkap lamkaite leh mipite zousie in, Juda gam a teng dingin Mangpa kamsuo khu a zuita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Kareah tapa Johanan leh galkap lamkaite zousie in Juda gam a teng dinga, delmanga a umna nam zousie lah a kipat hing kinua le;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasalte, numeite, naupangte, leengpa tanute leh michin teng; leengpa vengpawl lamkai Nebuzaradan in Shaphan tapa, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah leh guolnei Jeremiah toh, Neriah tapa Baruk toh, a nuasie zousie apuimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten Mangpa kamsuoh zuilou in Izipt gam ah apeita uhi, tualeh Tahpanhes tan dong apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tahpanhes ah Mangpa thu Jeremiah kung ah ahing tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na khut in suong lienpi la inlen, Tahpanhes a Pharaoh inn lutna bul a um tehlei halna tungman lah ah, Juda mite mitmu ngelngel in phuol in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tualeh akung uah, galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: ngaiun ka suohpa Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar ka hansah dinga, tam ka suong phuolte tungah aleengtouna ka tungsah ding a, Aman a leeng puon inn azah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ahing pei chiengin Izipt gam ahing dou dinga, shi dinga aguotte tungah shina atun dinga, saltang ding a guotte sal ah ataang ding ua, tualeh namsau a shi dingte namsau kungah apekhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Keima’n Izipt pasiente innte ah mei ka tawkuong ding a amauh ahal ding a, sal in apui ding hi. Tualeh belamchingpa’n apuonte asil bangin, Izipt gam in akivon dinga, tuana pat in galmuong in apei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama’n Izipt gam a um Beth-Shemesh a um suong milim khuomte ka satchim dinga, Izipt gam pasiente innte mei in ahal ding hi,” chiin gen in achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izipt gam a um, Migdol khuo a, Tahpanhes khuo a, Noph khuo a, tualeh Pathros gam a um Judate zousie tungtang thu a Jeremiah kunga Mangpa thu hing tung khu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Jerusalem tung leh Juda khopite zousie tunga sietna ka hing tunsah zousie na muta uhi, tualeh ngaiun, tuni’n asegawpta ua, koima tenna lou a, taisan leh loi ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amauh hiin, noute hiin, napu napate uh hitaleh, na theikhah ngailou uh pasien dangte be ding leh gimnamtui hal dinga akung ua peiin, Kei na hing suhlungthahna ding ua, na gitlou zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahivang in ka suoh guolneite zousie na kung uah matah a thouin, tam ka huot sil kidahhuoite bawl sih un chia gen dingin ka hing sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun agitlouna ua pat kihei ding leh pasien dangte kunga gimnamtui hallou dingin abil uh dawin angaikhe nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka lungthahna leh ka thangpainate sunbuoh in aumta a, Juda khopite leh Jerusalem gawlzingte ah, akuongzahta hi; tualeh tuni a aum bangin khopi sie leh nuasie in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuniin, Mangpa galkapte Pasian, Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Bangzieh a, Pasal numei, naupang leh naungehte Judate lah a, koima asuohta umlou a, satkhieha a umna ding ua, tambang gitlouna thupitah bawl nahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tenna uh Izipt gam pasiente kunga gimnamtui hal a, leitung nam zousiete lah a, hamsethuoh leh gensiet na hi theina ding ua, nouma leh nouma na kisatkhiet theina dingun na khut nasepte un, na hing sulungthahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Napu napate u’leh, Juda leengte leh azite uh gitlouna leh nouma gitlouna leh na zite uh gitlouna, Juda gam leh Jerusalem gawlzing lah a, gitlouna na bawlte uh manghilta nahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuni tandongin amaute akingaingiem sih ua, tualeh nou leh napu napate uh masanga ka koi ka dante leh ka thugousiete azui sih ua, zong agiing tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, na sietna ding u’leh Juda mite zousie sattan dingin ka hing maingat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Izipt gam a teng dinga pei tum chinten Juda mi umsunte, ka thatgam sieng dinga, Izipt gam sungah apua ding uhi. Amaute namsau leh kiel a thagam sieng ahi ding ua, aneupen apat alienpen dongin namsau leh kiel in ashi ding uhi, tuachi’n amaute hamsethuoh leh chizat huoi leh kamthauhauna leh simmaw ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen Jerusalem ka gawt bangin, Izipt gam a tengte namsau leh kiel leh natpi in ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda gam a umsun Izipt gam a teng dinga peite koima asuohta sih ding ua, hing pei kia a, tenna ding a alunggulna uh Juda gam a tung dinga suohta koima a um sih ding uhi; aguh a taidohte chiloungal koima ahing kinuale sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n azite u’leh akung ua ding numei zousie toh mi tampi in pasien dangte mai ah gimnamtui ahal uh, chi thei pasal zousie leh Izipt gam a teng mipite zousie in Pethros ah Jeremiah a dawng ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mangpa min a ka kung ua na thugen kouten ka ngaikhe sih ding uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh kou leh ka pu ka pate u’leh, ka miliente un, Juda khopite leh Jerusalem gawlzingte a, ana bawl bangun, van leengnu kunga gimnamtuite hal ding leh akunga dawn sillatte sung dinga ka kam ua thupawt pouma, ka bawl ngei ngei ding uhi; aziehpen tuabanga ka bawl chiengun, nehletah ka kiningching ua, ka damthei ua, sietna ka thuoh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh van leengnu kunga, gimnamtui hal leh akunga dawn sillatte sun ka tawpsan ua kipat in sil zousie ka tasam ua, namsau leh kiel a thagam in ka umta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh “Numei ten zong, van leengnu kunga gimnamtuite ka hal ua, amai a dawn sillatte ka sun laiun leh amanu biehna dinga tanghoute ka bawl lai un, ka pasalte uh phalna lou in ka bawl ngai uh amah?” achi belap na lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in ama kunga dawnna pie mipite zousie leh numeite zousie kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Juda khopite leh Jerusalem gawlzingte a nou leh napu napate u’leh, na leengpate u’leh na miliente u’leh gamsunga mipite’n na hal uh gimnamtuite khu Mangpa’n theizing louin, alungsimah alut ngai sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n na gamtat uh ahoilou zieh leh na silbawl hoiloute uh, tualeh na sil kidahhuoi bawlte ziehun, Mangpa’n ahing thuoh zou nawn sih hi. Tuaziehin na gam uh asegawpa chizat huoi, hamsethuoh leh tuni a, a um bangin koima tenlouna ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gimnamtui na hal zieh u’leh, Mangpa tunga na khelzieh u’leh Mangpa kamsuoh na zuilou ua, adante, athuguotte leh athutheisahnate na zuilou ziehun, tuni a banga, na tung ua sietna hing tung ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, “Jeremiah in mipite zousie kung leh numeite zousie kung ah, Izipt gam a um mi zousie in Mangpa thu ngai un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Nou leh na zite un, van leengnu kunga gimnamtui hal ding leh dawn sillatte sungbo dinga kichiemna ka bawlte uh, ka tangtun ngeingei ding uh hi, chi in nou leh na zite un na kam un na gen ua, na khut nasep un na tangtung sahta uhi. Na kichiemnate uh na bawl ding ua na tangtung sah ngutngei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin Izipt gam a teng Judami zousiein Mangpa thu ngai un, Ngai un, ka min thupitah sielin ka kichiemta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, Mangpa Pasian ahing hi, chi’n Izipt gamsung mun chinteng a teng Juda mi koima kam ah ka min akiloukha nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngaiun, Keima’n ama ua dinga hoina hilouin, asietna dingun ka enkhe zing hi. Tualeh Izipt gam a um Juda mi zousie abeisieng masangsie un, namsau leh kiel in ka thatgam sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh namsau apat suohta mi tawmnoukhat Izipt gam akipat in Juda gam ah ahing kinuale kia ding ua, tua hun chiengin Izipt gam a teng dinga va pei Juda mi umsunten koi thu ahiei adihzaw, kei thu ahiei, ahisihleh amauh thu, chi ahing thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh ka thu na sietna dingun na tung uah adingdet ding chi na theina dingun tami nou a dingin chiemte ahi ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, Juda leengpa Zedekiah melma ahinna lah sawm a suikawi, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar khut a ka pieh bangin, Izipt leengpa Pharaoh-Hophra khu amelmate khut leh ahinna lah sawma sui amelmate khut ah ka pekhe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim leenga apan kum lina a, Jeremiah in agenthaw thute Baruk in laibuziel a gelnua a, goulnei Jeremiah in Neriah tapa Baruk kunga ahilte tami ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aw Baruk, Mangpa Israelte Pasian in na kungah tambangin thu agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka tung agih hi, aziehpen Mangpa’n ka dana tungah, lunggimna ahing belappieh ta hi, ka mauna in ka balaw gawpta a, khawldamna mawngmawng ka musih, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tambanga akunga nagen ding ahi; Mangpa’n tambang in agen hi: Gamsung pumpi a ka lamsa khu ka phelse dinga, ka phusa khu ka botdoh ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh nangma a dinga sil thupi sui na hiei mah? Suida konin, aziehpen ngaiin, tahsa nei zousie tungah sietna hing tut ding ka hi, Mangpa’n achi hi; hinanleh na hinna pen na peina mun teng ah, gallah nuomman bangin ka hing pe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Namte tungtanga, guolnei Jeremiah kunga Mangpa thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izipt tungah: Juda leengpa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim leeng apan kum lina a, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in, alah Karkemish gama Euphrates luipi panga um Izipt leengpa Pharaoh Neko galkapte tungtang thu ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Lum leh phaw neutawite thu pie unlen, galphuollam naiin hing kuon un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakolte aphaw toh von unlen, sakol tungte ah tuong tou unlen, nou sakol tungtuong mite aw, na sia lukhu utoh dingdoh un, Na teipite uh tat hiem unlen, na sia puonahte uh silun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangdinga amaute lungkie leh chimaw a, nua tai a ka vamu ata diei? Amihatte uh aguolelta ua, kintahin ataizahta ua, akinuahei vawt sih uhi; aziehpen munchin tengah zauna a um hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Taihatte zong tai mansah sih unlen, Mihatte zong suohta sih uheh; Euphrates luipi pang mallamah, akipal pua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tam Nile luipi khan banga khanga atuite luipi khan banga khanga atuite luipi luong banga kihot khu, koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt khu Nile lui bangin akhanga, atuite luipi luong kihot bangin akhanga, Aman, ka khangtou nalai dinga, leitung katuom suoh dinga, khopi leh asunga umte ka sumang ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sakolte aw hing peitou un, Kangtalaite aw kintah in delun, Mihatte hing pawtdoh unlen, lum tawi Ethiopia mite leh Ethiopia mite, tualeh thalpi toi Lidia mite, ma suon un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen tua ni khu, galkapte Mangpa Pasian ni ahi, amelmate tunga phuba lah theina dinga phulahna ni ahi. Namsau in athatgam dinga, alungkim dinga, asisan uh khamtahin adawn ding hi. Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa Pasian in, mallam gam Euphrates lui pangah, kithoina lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Izipt tanu nungah siengthou, Gilead ah kuontou inlen, singnai damdawi vala in, phattuomna bei in damdawi tam na zang dinga, na dam tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namten na zumna ana zata ua, na kaa husa gamsung adimta hi, mihat tunga mihat akipalpua ziehun, ani un apuakhawm ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Guolnei Jeremiah kunga Mangpa thugen khu, tambang ahi; Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar ahing kuon dinga, Izipt ahing dou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Izipt gam ah phuongdoh unlen, Migdol ah phuongzah un, tualeh Memphis leh Tahpanhes phuongzah un, Dingkip unlen, kimansain um un, aziehpen na kimvel a umte namsau in thatgam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh a na galhangte taimang ahiei? Mangpa’n adelmang zieh a ding theilou ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman tampi apuasah a, Ahi, khat tungah adangte apua ua; Tualeh Amaun, Thou un, nuoisiena namsau taisan in i mite kung leh, i pienna gam ah ipei kia dinguh, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khunah akap ua, Izipt leengpa, Pharaoh athawmging ngai bep ahibou hi, Aman a hun kiguot khu apelta hi, a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Amin galkapte Mangpa ahi, Leengpa’n achi hi, Ka hin laisie in, taangte lah a Tabor taang bang leh, tuipi panga Karmel taang bangin, Ama ang pei kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw nang Izipt gam a teng tanu, saltaang dingin kigingsa in um un, aziehpen Memphis khopi akisuse dinga, ateng ding umlouin, a hawm in akinuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Izipt khu bawngla hoitah bang ahi a, hinanleh sietna ahing tung dinga, mallam akipat in ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Alah ua sumthalaw a galdou dinga, agoite uh zong bawngtal thautah bangin, alah uah a um uhi, aziehpen amauh akinua hei ua, ataimang khawmta uhi; atuohsietna ni u’leh, akigawtna ni uh atung ua ahing tun taah ziehin, ading thei tasih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Athawmging khu gulpi kithol ging bang mai ahi dinga, aziehpen galkap hon toh ahing pei ding ua, sing phuate bangin heipi toh amauh dou dingin, ahing kuon ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A gammangte sa mama nanleh, aphua kieu ding uhi, amaute khauphe hon sanga tamzaw ahi ua, simseng guol ahi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Izipt tanu khu azala dinga, mallam gam mite khut ah piehkhiet in a um ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in agen hi: “Ngai un, No khuo a Amon leh mipite leh Pharaoh tualeh Izipt khu apasiente utoh, aleengpa utoh Pharaoh leh ama tahsang zousie ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh ama ukhu ahinna uh suite khut leh Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar khut leh asuohte khut ah ka pekhe dinga, tuazou chiengin masang lai nite bangin luo in a um kia ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hinanleh zausin Aw nang ka suoh Jakob tualeh lungke sin, Aw Israel, aziehpen Ngai un, nang pen gamlapi akipat kang hundam dinga, tualeh na hah nasuonte asaltaanna gam ua pat in ka hundam ding hi. Jakob ahing kinuale kia dinga, akhawldam dinga, lungmuong tahin a um dinga, koiman azausah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka suohpa Jakob aw zau vawtsin, nang ka hing umpi hi; aziehpen ka hing delmangna namte zousie, ka subei sieng dinga, hinanleh nang pen ka hing subei sih ding hi hinanleh a hun giap in ka hing bawl hoi dinga, gawtlou keei innvang ka hing nuasie sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pharaoh in Gaza asim masanga, Philistinte tungtang a goulnei Jeremiah kunga Mangpa thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, mallam akipat in tui ahing lien a, tui sanglet ahing hi dinga, Gamsung leh asunga umte zousie, tualeh khopi leh asung a tengte atum dinga a, tuachi’n mite akikou ding ua, Gam sunga tengte zousie, amau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asakol hattahte kengchin totgingte, Sakolleng taigingte, sakolleng keng kipei gingte ah, hansanna atahsap tah ziehun, paten atate uh anua et ngam sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistinte suhmangthaina ni leh, Tai-ar leh Sidon apat panpi thei ding mi, Umsunte sattan nading ni ahing tun ziehin, Mangpa’n Kaphtor gam a Philistin mi um sunte asumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gaza lutang akiheu kieuta Ashkelon aphaijang a mi umsunte toh satkhieh ahita. Bangtan vei nouma leh, nouma ki at ding nahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw nang Mangpa namsau, bangtan vei sip dildel ding na hiei? Na pai sungah kisietlut inlen, um khinkhian inlen, sip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n bawl dinga thu hing pie hiven, bang dingin asip dildel thei diei? Ashkelon leh tuipi pieu dou dingin, Ama’n tami aguotta hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab tungtang ah galkapte Mangpa Israelte, Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Nebo tung agih hi, aziehpen suhsiet in a umta hi, Kiriathaim zumsah in a umta a, lah in a umta, akulpi sangtahte zumsah ahita a achimawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab in pahtat alaw nawn sih ding hi, Heshbon ah asietna ding angaituo uhi, hing peiun, nam khat ahina uh sattan vai, akichi uhi. Madmen khuo aw nang zong sattan a um ding na hi; namsau in ahing del ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Horonaim apat in kikou aw ging leh, manthaina leh sietna a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab suhmangthai ahita, ataneute uh kaa aw ging zahin a umta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Luhith peitouna lampi ah kapkawm in apeitou uhi. Aziehpen Horonaim peisuhna lampi ah, melmaten manthaina kikou aw ging azata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tai unlen, na hinna uh humbit un, Gamdai a, gam sabiltung bangin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kulpite u’leh na hausatnate uh na muon ziehun, noute zong puimangin na um ding uhi. Tualeh Kemosh khu asiempute leh amiliente, toh sal a puimang khawm in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh suse dingpa khopi chinteng tungah, ahing pei dinga, khopi khat zong asuohta sih ding hi. Phaizawlte amangthai dinga, phaijang khu suhsiet ahi ding hi, Mangpa’n agensa bang ngeiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Alenmang theina dingin, Moab kungah ha pie un, akhopite nuasie ahi dinga, asungah koima ateng nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Koi zong thase kawm a Mangpa nasem khu, hamse law in um heh, sisan suolou dinga anamsau, apai a siet kia khu hamse law in um heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Moab khu khangdawng ahilai apat in nuomsa tahin a um a, adeibanga nuomtah a buol ahi a, bel khat apat bel danga hei awngin a um ngaisih a, sal a pui in zong aum ngaisih hi, tuaziehin atui ngaiin atui a, agimnamtui zong akiheng ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ngaiun, anite hing tung ding ahita, Mangpa’n achi hi. Sungkhe ding mite ka sawl dinga, tuachi’n amaun asungkhe ding ua, abelte ahawmsah ding ua, athawlte atawkeh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Israel innkuonten amuon uh, Bethel azumpi bangun, Moab in Kemosh azumpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Bangchidan a koute galhat, kidouna phuol a gal hangte kahi uh, na chi thei uh ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moab suhmang in a umta a, akhopite ukhu meikhu in azamtouta, atangval teltuomte uh thagam in a um siengta uhi, Amin galkapte Mangpa ahi. Lengpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moab tuohsietna huoisetah hing tunna ding anaita, thuohgimna ahing tung pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nou akimvel a umten ama kaa unlen, Nou amin theikha poumaten, Bangchidan a leengchieng khautah leh, kilawm khu sattan a um ahiei? chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Debon a tengte tanu aw, na thupina akipat hing kumsuh inlen, dangtah in touin, Moab susepa nangma dou dingin ahing kuontou a, na kulpite ahing suhsiet pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aroer a tengte aw, lampi gei a dingin en un, ataidohpa leh asuohtanu dong unlen, Bangchidan ahiei? chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moab zumsah in a umta, suhsiet ahitaah ziehin, kap unlen kikoukhie un, Moab suhsiet ahita chi Arnon ah phuong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Muoltung zang gam ah vaihawmna ahing tungta, Holon, Jahzah leh Mephaathte tung ah zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tualeh Dibon tung leh, Nebo leh Beth-Diblathaim tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kiriathaim leh beth-gamul leh Beth-meon tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Kerioth leh Bozrah leh a gamla leh, anai a um Moab gam khopite tungah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab kii khu sattan ahita a, tualeh aban zong sattan ahita hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ama zu khamsah un, Mangpa tungah akiliensah ta hi, Moab ama luoh ah akibuol ding a, mi nuisat in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel khu nanga dinga nuizat huoi hitalou amah? Gutate lah a ama mukhah ahiei mah? Ama tungtang nagen chinin simmaw in na lu na lawkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Nou Moab a tengte aw, Khopite nuasie unlen, suongpi kawm lah ah teng un, leihawm kam gei a bu bawl vakhute bang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab kiletsahdan (Ama akiliensah sengseng hi) akikoisangdan, akisahtheidan leh kiletsahdan, tualeh alungtang kisahtheidan, ka zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Athangpaina ka thei hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, Hinanleh adih sih hi, azuougenna in bangma aphatuomsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin Moab a dingin ka kap dinga, Moab zousie a dingin ka kikoukhe dinga, Kir-Heres mite ka suun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aw Sibmah grepgui, Jazer ka kakhum bangin nangma ka hing kakhum ding hi. Na bazamte tuipi tungah azam a, Jazer tuipi tan dong atung uhi. Na nipi theigate leh, na grepga tungah susepa ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nopna leh kipahnate, ga tamtah suong theihuonte apat leh, Moab gam apat in lahmang ahita hi; grep suhna khuh a pat greptui ka kangsahta hi, Koiman kikou pumin achil nawn sih dinga, akikou u’leh zong kipahna kikou ahisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Heshbon apat akikoukhie ua, Elealeh Jahaz tan dong aw asuo ua, Zoar apat Horonaim tan dongin, tualeh Eglath-Shelishyah tan dong in zong akiza hi, aziehpen Nimrim tuite zong akangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, Moab gam a munsangte a sil lanmite leh, apasiente u’kunga gimnamtui halte ka tawpsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaziehin Moab suunna in ka lungtang theile bangin amau a, Kir-heres mite suunna in theile bangin amau ding hi. Tuaziehin hausatna amusa zousie uh abeimang siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Aziehpen lutang chinteng akiheukieu dinga, khamul chinteng metkieu ahita, khut tung zousie at-keeh ahi dinga, kawng tungah saiip puon akiteng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moab gam a inntungvumte leh agawlzingte ah, kaa leh mauna chilou bangma a um sih, aziehpen koima deilou bel bangin, Moab ka tokehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bangchidan a suhsiet a um atai? Bangchidan a Moab zalataha anua langa zumkia vawt atai? chiin amau vengvung ding uhi. Tuachi’n Moab khu akim avel a umte dingin, nuizatbuh leh lungkieh umtah ahita ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ngai un, muvanlai bangin aleengdinga Moab tungah aha azah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kerioth lah ahita, akulpite uh thakhat in akisim ding hi, tua ni chiengin, Moab galhangte lungtang numei nauvei abang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh Moab khu nam khat ahina apat suhmang ahita ding, Mangpa kal a ama leh ama akitawisang ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nou Moab gama teng mite aw, zauna kokhuh leh thang na masang uah a um hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Zauhuoina kipata taite kokhuh ah akeding ua, kokhuh apat pawtdoh pouma thangah a awh ding uhi. Aziehpen Moab tungah, amauh gawtna kum ka tungsah ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Heshbon lim nuoi ah galtai basamte akhawl uhi. Hinanleh Heshbon apat mei ahing kuongdoh dinga, Sihon lah a akipat in akuongdoh ding a, Moab talpang leh mi kikou vengvung tate lutunga, manglukhu akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Aw Moab na tung agih hi, Kemosh mite a mangthaita, na tapate uh sal a puiin a um ua, na tanute uh sal ataangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hinanleh, ni nukhia chiengin Moab vangphatna ka pe kia ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.” Tamtan chieng Moab tunga vaihawmna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ammon mite tungtangah Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Israel in tapate neilou ahiei mah? Gouluo ding neilou ahiei mah? Tua ahileh bangzieh a, Milkom in Gad aluo a, amite akhopi sunga teng ahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngai un, anite hing tung ding ahita, Mangpa’n achi hi: Tuachi’n Ammon mite khopi Rabbah ah kidouna thawmging kaza sah dinga, tam pen silsie kisevum kinuasie giap ahi ding. Tualeh akhoneute uh meiin akihal ding hi. Tuachi’n Israel in ama deldohte adeldoh ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Heshbon kap in mau in, aziehpen Ai khuo suhmang ahita, nou Rabbah tanute kap unlen, saiip puon teng unlen, kaa un, Kulpi sungah suhtai toutai un, aziehpen Milkom asiempute leh, amiliente toh saltang khawm ding ata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangdinga na phaijang hoite kisahtheipi na hiei? Aw muonhuoilou tanu, na hausatna muongin koi ahiei, kei dou a hing kuon ngam ding? na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngaiun, na kim na pam a umte akipat in, zauna na tungah ka tungsah dinga, mi zousie deldoh in na um sieng ding ua, michin amazawn chiet uah atai ding ua, galtai vahthapte koiman apuikhawm kia sih ding hi, galkapte Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hinanleh, anuachiengin Ammon mi saltangte ka hing puikia ding, Mangpa’n achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom tungtang, galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Teman ah pilna um nawnlou ahiei mah? mipilte apat thuhilna beimang ahita amah? apilnate uh mangsieng ata amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dedan a tengte aw, tai unlen, kinua heiun, mun thuhtah ah tengun, aziehpen atung ah Isau tunga, sietna ka hing tungsah ding hi, ama ka gawt ni chiengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kungah grepga khawmte hing peita u’leh, grep sang themkhat beh nuasie neilou ding ahi uoi mah? Zanlai in gutate hing peita u’leh, adei za uh alah masangsie uh agu sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh ken Esau saguohin ka umsahta, aselguh munte ka hawhkheta a, akisel thei nawn sih ding hi; ahah asuonte suhsiet ahita a, ama leh a unaute leh a innvengte toh, a um nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na naupang paneiloute nuasie unlen, Keima’n ka keem hing na ding hi, Tualeh na meithaite un kei hing muong uheh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ngai un, nou dawntahlou ding achiten, adawnta ngei mai ua, gawtlou in na um thei pouma ding uoi mah? Gawtlou in na um vawt sih ding a, na dawn teitei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima min louin ka kichiemta Bozrah khu, ahawma nuasie gensiet leh suhsiet, tualeh samsiet ahing hi dinga, akhopite zousie ase den ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa akipat thuthang khat ka zata hi, “Tualeh namte kungah palai khat sawl ahita, Kikhawm khawm unlen, ama dou dingin hing kuon unlen, galdou dingin kipan un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngaiun, namte lah ah ka hing suneuta hi mihingte lah ah, simmawhuoi in ka hing bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na chizat huoina leh na lungtang kisahtheina in ahing solta hi, Aw nou suongpi kawm lah a tengte leh, muolvum sanga tengte, Muvanlai bangin sangtah ah, na bu bawl nanlachin, khuna pat in ka hing luoikhe ding, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Edom zong chizat huoi asuoh dinga, akunga peikha poumain chizat huoi asa ding ua, lamdang sa sengin a chiza ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomorrah leh akim apama khopite toh, suhsiet a a um bangin, khunah koima a um nawn sih dinga, mihing tapa khat zong ateng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai un ama khu Jordan gammang akipat in humpibahnei bangin, mihat tenna mun ah ahing kuontou dinga, hinanleh ama khu amanu a kipat in thakhat in ka taimang sah ding a; tualeh amanu tunga thunei dinga ka guot koi ahiei? Kei bang koi ahiei? Koi ahiei kei hing ngoh ngam ding? Ka masanga ding ding tua belampu khu koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin Edom tungtanga Mangpa lemguot leh Teman a tengte tungtanga asiltupte ngaikhie un, belamhon lah aneute pellou in akikaimang dinga, pellou in atenna uh amauh pumin asuse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pua ging un leitung akithingsah dinga, akaa ging uh tuipisan ah akiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai un, ahing kuontou dinga, muvanlai bangin aleengtou dinga, Bozrah muol ah ahate azah ding, tuani chiengin Edom mihatte lungtang khu numei nauvei nat thuoh abang ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Damaska tung thu ah: “Hamath leh Arpad azalata uhi, thuthang hoilou azah ziehun, alungtang uh zauin azunta, amaute tuipi kihot siptheilou bangin abuoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Damaska ahing zawngkhalta a, taimang dingin akihei a, zauna in ama amanta hi; lung khamna leh danain numei nauvei bangin amanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangzieh a, khopi minthang, ka kipahna khopi taisan a umta ahiei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin atangvalte uh kholai dungah apua ding ua, tuani chiengin agalkapte zousie suhmang in a um sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Damaska kulbangah mei ka tawkuong dinga, tami’n Ben-hadad kulpite akatum ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in ana zawsa Kedar leh Hazor leenggamte, tungtang thu ah Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Thou inlen Kedar ah kuontou unlen, suolam mite vasumang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A puon innte u’leh abelamhonte uh lamang un, apuonzahte u’leh a um abelte uh lamang unlen, nouma a dingin a sangawngsaute uh pomang un, kilchin ah zauna a um chi’n akikou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Taimang unlen gamla pi ah vahmang unlen kokhuh thuhtah ah teng un, Aw nou Hazor a tengte, Mangpa’n achi hi. Aziehpen Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in nang douna ding siltup khat aneita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Thou unlen nam nuomsa lungmuong tah a amatang a teng kulkotpi leh a kalna zawl neilou, dou dingin mailam nawt un, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A sangawngsaute u’khu galmat ahi dinga, aganhonte uh galvanlah ahi ding, gamlapi a umte huilah ah ka thethang dinga, kilchin akipat in sietna atung uah ka tung sah ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Hazor khu si-alte tenna ahita dinga, akinuasie denta ding hi. Khunah koima ateng nawn sih dinga, mihing ta koima ateng sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Juda leengpa Zedekiah leenga apanchil lai a, Elam tungtanga guolnei Jeremiah kungah Mangpa thu ahing tung a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ngai un, Elam thalpi ahatna bulpipen ukhu, ka tawngsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Van ning li apat hui lite Elam dou dingin ka hing tungsah dinga, amaute tua huite lah ah ka thethang ding hi; Elam mi deldoh a umte tunphah louna nam koima mawngmawng a umsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aziehpen Keima’n Elam amelmate leh ahinna suite masangah ka lungke sah dinga, tualeh atung uah sietna leh ka lungthahna zauhuoitah ka tungsah ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi; tualeh abawn ua ka thagam masangsie’n anua uah namsau ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Elam ah ka mangtoupha kadaw ding a, khuna pat in leengpa leh amiliente ka sumang ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Hinanleh ni nukhialam chiengin, Elam saltangte ka hing puikia ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon leh Kaldai mite tungtanga guolnei Jeremiah kunga Mangpa thugen khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Namte lah ah phuongzah unlen, kitangkoupi un, tualeh puonlap khaisangun, phuongzah unlen bangma im sihun, Babilon laah ahita a, Bel Mualphou ahita, Merodak akehgawpta, a milimte Mualphou ahita, amilim pasiente akehgawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aziehpen mallam akipat in ama dou dingin, nam khat ahing kuon dinga, agam asuse ding hi, asungah koima ateng sih dinga, mihing leh gamsate ataimang ding ua, koima tenna lou a, nuasie in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tua nite leh tua hun chiengin Israelte ahing pei ding ua, Ama utoh Juda tate kap pumin ahing peikhawm ding ua, Mangpa a Pasian uh asui ding uh, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaun Zion zotna lampi adong ding ua, amai uh khumlang nga kawm in, hing peiun manghil ni umlou dingin, kumtawn thuhun in Mangpa toh ikizop ding uh, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka mite belam mang ahita uh, aching miten alam pielsah ua, muoltung lah ah avahthangsah ua, muol apat tangtung lah ah avahthang ua, akhawlna mun uh amanghilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute mu zousiein anegam ua, agalte un koute ka khiel sih uhi, Mangpa apu apate uh kinepna, dihna umna Mangpa tunga, akhel ziehuh ahi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Babilon apat in taikhie unlen, Kaldai mite gam apat pawtkhie un, kelhonte masang a keltalte bangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai un, Babilon dou dingin mallam gam a kipat nam thupi tahtah, kikhawmte ka tohthou dinga, tualeh ama dou dingin pan mun akhaw ding ua, tuana kipat ama lahzou ahi dinga, athaltangte u’khu galdousiem mihattah, khut guoh a nuakia ngailou bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Kaldai khu tomgam in a um dinga, ama tomgamte zousie alungkimta ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kipah in nuomsa mama nan u’lachin, nou ka goutan sumang mite aw, loudawng lah a bawngla thau kidieng kawi bang nan u’lachin, tualeh bawngtal bangin ham nan u’lachin zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />na nu uh azum mama dinga, nangma hing pai nu khu azala ding hi. Ngai in amanu khu namte lah a neupen, gamdai, gamgaw leh senelgam, asuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa lungthahna ziehin, luolou gam ahi dinga, apumpi a luolou a, nuasie ahita ding hi. Babilon kunga peikha michin in, asiet dimdem dante lamdang sa in achiza ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nou thalpi tawite aw, Babilon kimkot in panmun khawin kiguol unlen, kap un, thaltang khet sih un; aziehpen Mangpa tungah ana khielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Akimkot ah kikoukhum un, Ama leh ama akipedohta, akingapna suongphum apuata a, akulbangte a chimta hi, tami Mangpa phubalahna ahi, atungah phula unlen, aman midangte tunga abawl bangin, ama tungah bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Haichi thepa Babilon apat satkhie unlen, bu lahlai a kawite tawipa sattan un; nuoisiena namsau zauna ziehin michin amite kungah kile kia henlen, michin amau’gamlam chiet ah tai uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Israel khu belam kithethang bang ahita, humpibahneiten ama adelmangta, amasa in Assiria leengpan anegamta a, tuin atawpna ah Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in agute asutanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa Israelte, Pasian in tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, Assiria leengpa ka gawt bangin, Babilon leengpa leh agam ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel khu atenna gam ah ka puikia ding a, Karmel leh Bashan ah akivah dinga, ahinna khu Ephraim leh Gilead taang ah atai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khumi ni leh hun chiengin, Israel gitlouna akisui dinga, a um sih ding hi, tualeh Juda khelna akisui dinga, hinanleh akimu sih ding hi. Aziehpen ken ka mikhet umsunte ka ngaidam ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Merathaim gam dou dingin kuontou unlen, Pekod a tengte dou dingin kuontou un; thatgam unlen, sumang siengun, tualeh thu ka hing pieh zousie bangin bawl un, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gam sungah kidouna husa leh sietna nasatah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangchidan a leitung pumpi sehpi khu, aphal phal a kisatkeh gawp atai! Bangchidan a Babilon namte lah a susiet gawpa um atai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Babilon nang dingin thang ka kam a, na theilou kaala awh na hita ve, mu in na um a, mat na hita; Mangpa na dou ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mangpa’n agalvan koikhawmna ahongta a, alungthahna galvan ahing ladoh a, tami Kaldai mite gam a galkapte Mangpa Pasian nasep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gam ning tawp gamlapen akipat in, ama dou dingin hing kuon unlen, a bu innte hong unlen, bu vum bangin siekhawm unlen, nasetahin sumang unlen; bangma khawi nei sihun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A bawngtalte zousie that unlen, sagoute kungah peisuhsah un, atung uh agih hi! Aziehpen amauh gawtna ni hing tung ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Mangpa i Pasian aphulahna, abiehinn a aphulahna Zion a phuongzah dinga, Babilon gam a pat a suohtate leh, galtaite awging khu ngaivawi un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Babilon dou dingin thalkap siemte hankhawm un, Nou thalpi tawite zousie akimkot ah giehphuol sat unlen, koima suohta sah sihun. Anasep bangbangin thuh unlen, ama bawl bangbangin atungah bawl un. Aziehpen Mangpa Israelte Misiengthoupa, tungah akiliensahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaziehin atangvalte uh kholaidungah apua ding ua, agalkapte zousie uh tua ni chiengin, satkhieh in a um ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ngai vawi, mikiliensahpa ka hing dou hi, galkapte Mangpa Pasian in achi hi; aziehpen nang ka hing gawtna ni leh hun ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Akiliensah pen pa akipal dinga apua ding a, Koiman aphong sih ding hi, tualeh akhopite sungah mei ka tawkuong dinga, akimkot a umte zousie akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi Israel tate leh, Juda tate suhgenthei khawmin a umta ua, amauh sal a mante’n dettahin atu ua, apawtdoh sah nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Atanpa uh ahat a, Amin galkapte Mangpa ahi, Aman amaute tungtang pellou in agen pieh dinga, agam uh khawldamna apieh theina dingin, hinanleh Babilon a tengte akhawldam sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Kaldai mite douin namsau aleeng hi, Babilon a tengte leh a miliente u’leh amipilte tung uah zong, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A phunsante uh douin namsau a leeng hi, mi mo asuoh theina dingun! amihatte uh dou in namsau aleeng hi, amaute suhsiet ahi theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A sakolte u’leh a sakollengte u’leh alah ua, gamdangmi galkap umte dou in namsau aleeng hi, amaute numei ahing suoh theina dingun, agoute tungah namsau a leeng hi, lahpieh a a um theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Atuite akangta, agaw gawp sieng theina dingun, aziehpen agam uh milim khenthu biehna gam ahi a, a milimte uh a motlaw siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Tuaziehin gamdai gamsate leh ngiete ateng ding ua, vangawngsang zong asungah ateng ding ua, kumtawn in koima ateng nawn sih dinga, akiluo nawn sih dinga, akhang akhangin akilawi denta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pasian in Sodom leh Gomorrah leh, akimvela um khopite asuhmang mabangin, khunah koima ateng nawn sih ding a, mihingta asungah ateng sih ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Ngai un, mallam akipat mi hon khat ahing kuon ding ua, tualeh nam thupi leh hat mama khat leh, leeng tampite leitung ning tawp akipat in ahing kitungdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amaun thalpi leh teipi atawi ding ua, agilou ua, khotuona anei sih ding uhi. A aw uh tuipi bangin ahawh ding a, sakol tungah atuong ding ua nangma dou dingin, galdou ding bangin akiguol ding uhi, Aw Babilon tanu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Babilon leengpa’n amauh tungtanga thutut azata a, akhut azawta, mangbatna in numei nauvei natna thuoh, bangin ama amanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“En un, ama khu Jordan luigei gammang lah a kipat in, mihat tenna mun a humpibahnei bangin ahing kuontou dinga; hinanleh ama apat in amauh thakhat in ka tai mang sah pai ding hi. Tualeh ama utunga thunei dingin ka deitel pen ka guot ding a, Keima bang koi ahiei um? Koi ahiei kei hing ngoh ngam ding? Belampu koi ahiei ka mai a ding ngam ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuaziehin Babilon tung a Mangpa lunggel za un, tualeh Kaldai mite gam tungtanga asil tup khu, ganhonte lah a, anou neupen zong kai mangin a um dinga, pellou in gantatna mun a mite achi za ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Babilon kilahzou ziehin leitung chitun in akiling ding a, akikou awging uh namte lah ah akiza ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “En un, Babilon tungah leh Leb-Kamai a tengte tungah suse dingin, huipi hattah ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Babilon tungah zapsiengding mi ka sawl dinga, aman azapsieng dinga, agam ka hawmsuohsah ding hi. Aziehpen mangbat niin akim avel a umten ama adou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thalkap miten athalpi luoi sih uhenlen, sia puonah silin ding zong dingda uheh, atangvalte uh khatbeh hinkhawi sih unlen, agalkapte zousie uh that siengun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabangin galthate khu Kaldai mite gam ah apua ding ua, kholai dungah sutpailet a liem in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Agamsung uh Israelte Misiengthoupa douna khelnain, dim nanleh Israel leh Juda galkapte, Mangpa a Pasian un ataisan ngaisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Babilonte lah apat taikhie un, Tualeh michin in ahinna humbit hen, agitlouna ah sattan in um sih un, aziehpen tami Mangpa phubalahna hun ahi; Aman athuhkiana akungah ape ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babilon khu Mangpa khut a leitung zousie, khamsahtu sana nou ahi! Namten a zu adawnkham ua, tuaziehin namte amota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babilon khu thakhat in apuata a, susiet in a umta hi. Ama suun in mau unlen, anatna a dingin dam dawi la un, ahing damkia kha maithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Babilon ka sudam nuom uh hi, hinanleh adam thei sih hi. Nuasie unlen, michin eima gam chiet ah ikipei ding uhi; aziehpen atunga vaihawmna in van asuta a, vanthamzawl donga dopsang ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n idihtatna ahing kilangsahta, hing peiun, Mangpa i Pasian uh nasep Zion ah phuongzah vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Thaltangte nawtval unlen, lumte khawm un! Mangpa’n Medes leengpa lungsim atohthouta hi, aziehpen ama siltup khu Babilon suhsiet ding ahi a, Mangpa phubalahna ahi; abiehinn a dinga aphulbalahna ahiziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babilon kulbangte ah puonlap khai unlen, venna hatsah unlen, vengmite koi un, galbuhnate bawl un, aziehpen Mangpa’n Babilon a tengte, sietna ding agensa khu angaituo a abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw nou tui tampi gei a tenga sum leh pai haumamate, na tawpna uh a hing tungta a, na hinna tena khau atanta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Ama min louin akichiem a, pellouin nang khauphete bangin, mihingin ka hing dimsah dinga, tualeh amaun na tungah guolzawna aw ngaitah toh, ahing kikou khum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ama’n asilbawltheina in leitung abawla, Apilna in leitung atungdoh a, atheisiemna in van akizahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama’n a aw asuohdoh chiengin, vante ah tui tampite ahing um khawm a, kawlmong apat in, tui meite azamtou sah hi, guo zuhna dingin tunphe aphesah a, a goubawm apat in hui alaangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Michin theina neilou in, alungmawlta uh, dangkakheng michinteng amilim khente un azalasah ta hi; amilim sunthute uh zuou ngen ahi a, amau’sungah nahna hu a umsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaute bangmalou suhkhelna nasep ahibou hi; akigawt ni chiengun abeimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob tanvou khu ama uh bang ahisih a, Ama silbangkim siempa ahi a, tualeh Israel khu ama gouluo nam ahi a, Amin khu galkapte Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Nang khu ka galdouna heitang na hi a, ka galdouna vanzah na hi. Nangma zangin namte ka satguoi a, nangma zangin leenggamte ka susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangma zangin sakol leh atunga tuongpa, ka satguoi ding a, nangma zangin sakolleng leh, atunga tuongpa ka satguoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma zangin numei pasal ka satguoi a, nangma zangin tehsete leh khanglaite, ka satguoi hi; nangma zangin tangvalte leh, nungahte ka satguoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangma zangin belamchingpa leh, abelamhonte ka satguoi a, nangma zangin loubawlmi leh, abawngtal hahkolte ka satguoi a, nangma zangin uhpipate leh, vaihawmte ka satguoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na mitmu ngel ah Babilon leh, Kaldai a tengte zousie in Zion a, sildihlou abawlte zousie uh ka thuh ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ngai in, nang suhsiet hat taang aw, leitung pumpi susie, nangma ka hing dou ahi, Mangpa’n a chi hi. Nangma douna in ka khut kalam dinga, kawl suongte lah apat ka hing lia suh dinga, meikah kieu muol ka hing suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Koiman nang akipat inn ninga, pang ding suong ala sih dinga, inn suongphum dingin zong suong ala sih ding hi, hinanleh kumtawn a donloua segawp den nahi ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Gam sungah puonlap khai unlen, namte lah ah pengkul mut un, ama dou dingin namte kisa sah unlen, ama dou dingin Ararat, Minni leh, Ashkenaz, leenggamte hankhawm un, ama dou dingin galkap lamkaite guot unlen, khauphehon kitawm un, ama dou dingin galkap lamkaite guot unlen, khauphehon kitawm letlut bangin, sakolte kuontou sah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama dou dingin namte, Medes leengte, a uhpipate leh, a vaihawm liente, tualeh athuneina nuoi a gam um zousie toh kisa sah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh gam khu lungkham in, akiling ding hi, aziehpen Babilon gam koima tenna lou dinga, suse dingin Babilon tunga Mangpa siltup khu, suhtangtung ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babilon galhatte kidou atawpta ua, akulpite uh sungah a um khinkhianta uhi, ahatna uh abeita a, numei abangta uhi, a umna munte uh ahalta ua, akotpi zawlte uh atanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Babilon leengpa kunga, akhopi ning chin apat lah ahita chi a gen dingin, patong khat in patong dang khat mu dingin atai a, thangkou khat thangkou dang khat mu dingin atai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Alui kaannate khatan ahita a, pumpengte meiin ahalta uhi, tualeh agalkapte uh a zauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in, tambangin agen hi: Babilon tanu khu bu vuohna phuol a bu kivuo bang ahia, hinapiin dachieng hun sawtlou nua chiengin, ama bu laah banga kilaah hun ahing tung ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in ahing negamta a, ahing gawtguoita hi; aman bel hawmguoh ahing suohsahta a, Gulpi bangin kei ahing valtumta hi, ka tahsa tuituoh na lai tein agilpi avasah a, ahing nuasetdoh kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka tung leh ka tahsa tunga hiemngamna kibawl khu, Babilon tungah tu heh;” Zion a tengten achi ding uhi; Tualeh “Ka sisan khu Kaldai gam a teng mite tungah tu heh,” Jerusalem in achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Ngai un, na tungthu uh ka hing genpieh dinga, na phuba ka hing lahpieh ding hi; tuipi ka kangsah dinga, atuinahte ka gawsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Babilon silsie kisievum asuoh dinga, si-alte tenna mun ahi ding a, mun chizat huoi leh, chilphit khum leh, koima tenlouna ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Amaute humpibahnei bangin ahawhkhawm ding ua, humpibahnei noute bangin mi angih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Alungnop kipah laitahun annkuong ka luipieh dinga, ka khamsah dinga, akipah theina dingun, tualeh thou nawnlou a, a imutden theina dingun, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Gaw ding belamnoute leh belamtal leh, keltalte bangin amauh ka zawpi suh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Oh, bangchidan a Sheshak kila mawh atai leh! Oh, bangchidan a leitung pumpi pahtawi khu, mat a um atai! Bangchidan a Babilon khu namte lah a, chizat huoi khop a suhsiet atai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Babilon tung ah tuipi ahing khangtou a, atuikihot tampiten ama atuumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A khopite segawpin akiloita a, gamgaw leh gamdai, koima tenlouna leh, mihing tate vapei khahlouna gam asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Babilon ah Bel ka gawt dinga, akam sunga pat avalsate ka ladoh dinga, tualeh akungah namte apeikhawm nawn sih ding ua, Ahi, Babilon kulbang achimta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Ka mite alah ua pat in hing pawtdoh unlen, Mangpa lungthahna zauhuoitah apat in, na hinna uh humbit un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Gam sunga thuthang na zah chiengun, lungke sih unlen, zau sih un. Kum khat in thuthang khat ahing thang dinga, akum kia chiengin thuthang dangkhat ahing thang kia dinga, tua thu khu gamsunga kigumbawlna thuthang ahi dinga, vaihawm mi leh vaihawm mi kidemtuona thuthang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ngaiun, Babilon milim khenthute tung a vaihawmna, ka bawlna ding nite ahing tung ding a, agam pumpi azala ding hi; tualeh ami kithatte zousie agam sungah apua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin lei leh van leh asunga um zousiete’n, Babilon tungah kipah thanuom in la asa ding uh, Aziehpen mallam akipat in akungah mi ahing pei ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Babilon zieh a leitung pumpia tha a umte, zousie apua bangin, Israela tha a umte ziehin Babilon apua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />“Nou namsau apat a suohtate, peidoh kin un, muongin ding nalai sih un, gamlapi apat Mangpa thei ngitnget unlen, na lungsim uah Jerusalem geeldoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gensietna ka zah ziehun zum in ka umta uh, zumna in ka mai uh akhut a, aziehpen Mangpa inn mun siengthou sungah, gamdang mi ahing lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ngaiun amilim khenthute tung a, vaihawmna ka tunsahna nite ahing tung ding hi, tualeh agam sung pumpi ah mi limte thum in amau ding uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Babilon van sunin sang nanleh, ahatna sangtah in kulpi kikhokhum nanleh, kei apat in sumang dingte akungah atung sah veve ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />“Babilon apat in kaa leh mauna husa ahing um a, Kaldai mite gam a kipat suhmangna thawmging thupi ahing um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Mangpa’n Babilon asuseta a, A aw ging ngaitah khu asipsahta, athawmging ukhu tui pi kihot ging bang nanleh, achimaw kikou ging un gamsungteng athawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Sumangtu khat Babilon dou dingin ahing tungta, agalhangte uh mat in a umta a, athalpite uh atawng siengta, aziehpen Mangpa Pasian khu athuhkia pa ahi a, Aman pellouin athuh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ken amiliente, amipilte, a uhpipate, alamkaite leh agalhangte, ka khamsah ding hi. Amaute alumden ding ua akhanglou nawn sih ding uhi, Lengpa, Amin galkapte Mangpa’n, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Babilon kulbang liente khu achimse dinga, akulkotpi sangte meiin akihal ding a, amipiten amawhna’n nna asemgim ding ua, tualeh namte’n mei a halvaam ding bou ahi,” a gimpi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Juda leengpa Zedekiah leenga apan kum lina a, Ma-aseiah tapa Neriah tapa Seraiah, Zedekiah toh Babilon langa apei lai ua, akunga guolnei Jeremiah thupieh tami ahi. Seraiah khu leengpa inn sunga neh leh dawn vaisai lien khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in Babilon tunga sil hoilou hing tung ding zousie laibu khat ah agielkhie hi. Tam thu kigiel zousie Babilon tungtang thu a kigente ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeremiah in Seraiah kungah, “Babilon ah na tun chiengin, tam thute zousie na simdoh ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tuazouchiengin, Aw Mangpa tammun tungtang ah thu na gen a, tam mun satkhieh in a um dinga, mi hiin sa hitaleh koima tenna lou a, kum tawn a suhsiet a um dingin thu nana genta hi; nachi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, tam laibu nasim zou chiengin suong khat toh na kaanbeh dinga, Euphrates luipi lai ah na pailut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tuachi’n tambangin Babilon atummang dinga, atunga ka hing tut ding sil hoilou akipat athoudoh kia nawn sih ding hi. Tualeh amaute aba mama ding uhi,” chiin gen in achi hi. Tamte Jeremiah thute beina ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah leenga apan chiil in kumsawm ni leh khat a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh khat leeng in apang hi. Anu min Hamutal ahia, Libnah khuo a Jeremiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoiakim bawl bangbangin aman zong Mangpa mitmu ah sil hoilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa lungthahna ziehin, Jerusalem leh Juda gam ah tambang sil ahing umta a, Amitmu apat amauh apaikhieh dongin, Zedekiah khu Babilon leengpa tungah ahelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zedekiah vaihawm kum kuona aha sawmna ani sawmni in, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar agalkapte zousie toh Jerusalem dou dingin ahing kuon a, khopi pulam ah giehphuol asat ua, khopi kimkot ah kul kikhokhumin panmun akho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Zedekiah vaihawm kum sawm leh khatna tan dongin khopi khu imbuchip in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh aha lina, ni kuo niin, khopi sungah kiel anase mama a, gamsung a mipite neh ding a umta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi kulbang asatvang ua, galkap zousie atai ua, leengpa huon kunga um kulbang nite kikaal a lampi ah zanlai in khopi apat in ataimangta uhi; Kaldai galkapten khopi kimkot in im nan u’leh, amaute phaijang lampi ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Kaldai galkapten leengpa anuadel ua, Jeriko phaijang ah Zedekiah adelphata uhi, tuachi’n galkapte zousie ama apat ataizah siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun leengpa aman ua, Hamath gam a Rablah khuo ah, Babilon leengpa kungah ahing pui uhi, tuanah Babilon leengpa’n atunga gawtna ding thukhenna apuongkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon leengpa’n Zedekiah tapate amitmu ah athat a, Juda miliente zong ama’n Rablah ah athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuazou in ama’n Zedekiah mitte akheudoh pieh a, tualeh Babilon leengpa’n sum-eng kol abun sah a, Babilon ah azawpi a, a shi ni tan dongin suongkul ah akhumdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n aha ngana, ni sawmni in, tua khu Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar vaihawm kum sawm leh kuona kum ahi a, Babilon leengpa vengpawl lamkai Nebuzaradan khu Jerusalem ah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama’n Mangpa inn leh leengpa inn tualeh Jerusalema innte zousie leh mi thupite leh miliente inn zousie zong meiin ahaltum sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa vengpawl lamkaipa kunga um Kaldai galkapten Jerusalem kimvel a kulbang zousie asatchimta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n vengpawl lamkai Nebuzaradan in mizawngte pawl khat leh khopi sunga um nalaite leh Babilon leengpa kunga kipelutte tualeh khutsiem dangte zousie sal in apuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh vengpawlte lamkai Nebuzaradan in gam sunga mizawng pawlkhat khu grep huon kem ding leh loute bawl dingin anuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa inn a um sum-eng khuomte leh akingahnate leh Mangpa inn a um tuikuongpi leh Mangpa inn a um zousiete Kaldai miten asatgawp ua, asum-eng zousie Babilon ah apawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaun belte, vut luohnate, meisuhmitnate, hengkuongte, tawkeute, leh siempute vanzah sum-eng um leh belte, zousie apomang siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh vengpawlte lamkaipa’n khutsilna kuongte, mei-am luohnate, hengkuongte, belte, meivah tunnate, tawkeute leh noute, sana sieng a kibawl zousie, abawn in apomang siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuom nite leh tuikuongpi khat leh akitunnate, sum-eng a kibawl bawngtal sawm leh nite leh atunna ding kikhuohte, leengpa Solomon in Mangpa inn a dinga abawl tua sum-eng te gih dan teguol ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khuomte ahileh, khuom khat sandan tong sawm leh giet ahia, apum letdan tong sawm leh ni ahia, asa dan zung li ahi a; alaihawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khuompi dawn ah, khuomluboh khat a um a, tua khuomluboh khat tong nga in asanga, tua sum-eng khuom luboh kimvel khu khutsiemtah in akizem a, kawlbuthei lim a kizem ahi. Akhuom ni na zong kawlbuthei lim a kizem akibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pang ah kawlbuthei lim sawmkuo leh guh a um a, akimvel zousie a kizepna kawlbutheite khu zakhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh vengpawl lamkaipa’n siempulien Seraiah leh siempu ni na Zephaniah tualeh kot veng mi thumte sal in apuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama’n khopi sung a kipat in, galkap mite lamkai leengpa vaihawmpi mi sagi, khopi sunga um nalaite leh gam sunga galkap umte min gelna kempa laigielmi lamkai lienpa leh khopi sunga um gamsung mi sawm guhte toh sal in apuidohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh vengpawlte lamkaipa Nebuzaradan in amaute zousie azawpi a, Rablah khuo a Babilon leengpa kungah atutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hamath gam a Riblah khuo ah Babilon leengpa’n amauh asatlum siengta hi. Tambangin Juda agam apat in sal a puimangin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamte Nebukadnezzar in sal a apuimang mite tam dan ahi: Akum sagi na ah Juda mi tul thum leh sawmni leh thum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar leeng apan kum sawm leh gietna kum in Jerusalem apat mi za giet leh sawmthum leh ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />avaihawm kum sawmni leh thumna ah, vengpawl lamkai Nebuzaradan in Juda mi za sagi leh sawm li leh nga sal in apuimang hi; abawn un mi tul li leh zaguh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda leengpa Jehoiakin saltan kum sawmthum leh sagina, ha sawm leh ni na, khum ha ni sawmni leh nga, ni in tambang ahing hi a, Babilon leengpa Evil-Merodak in, avaihawm kum khatna kum in, Juda leengpa Jehoiakim lutang adopkaang pieh a, suongkul apat aladohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n kam nemtah in ama ahoupi a, Babilon a akunga um leeng dangte sangin leengtoupha sang zaw apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiakin in asuongkul taanna puonte aheng a, tualeh ni sim in adam sungtengin leengpa toh ann ane khawm denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh ni sim a aneh ding leh apoimaw leengpa’n adam sung tengin, ashi ni tan dongin neh ding ape ngitnget hi.
  </para>
</usx>
